#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Xfce Desktop Environment"
msgstr "Xfce mahaigain ingurunea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/_index.md:0 content/_index.md:7 content/about/_index.md:6
msgid ""
"Xfce is a lightweight desktop environment for UNIX-like operating systems. "
"It aims to be fast and low on system resources, while still being visually "
"appealing and user friendly."
msgstr ""
"Xfce UNIXen antzeko sistema eragileentzako mahaigain-ingurune arina da. "
"Azkarra izan eta sistemaren baliabide gutxi erabiltzea du helburu, bisualki "
"erakargarria eta erabilerraza izaten jarraituz."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"desktop environment, window manager, desktop, speed, lightweight, gtk+, open"
" source, xforms common environment"
msgstr ""
"mahaigain-ingurunea, leiho-kudeatzailea, mahaigaina, abiadura, arina, gtk+, "
"kode irekia, xforms common environment"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/_index.md:0
msgid "About"
msgstr "Honi buruz"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/_index.md:8
msgid ""
"Xfce embodies the traditional UNIX philosophy of modularity and re-"
"usability. It consists of a number of components that provide the full "
"functionality one can expect of a modern desktop environment. They are "
"packaged separately and you can pick among the available packages to create "
"the optimal personal working environment."
msgstr ""
"Xfce-k modulartasunaren eta berrerabilgarritasunaren UNIX filosofia "
"tradizionala gorpuzten du. Mahaigain-ingurune moderno batetik espero "
"daitekeen funtzionaltasun osoa eskaintzen duten zenbait osagaiz osatuta "
"dago. Bakoitza bere aldetik paketatuta dago, eta eskuragarri dauden paketeen"
" artean aukera dezakezu zure lan-ingurune pertsonal ezin hobea sortzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/_index.md:10
msgid ""
"Another priority of Xfce is adherence to standards, specifically those "
"defined at [freedesktop.org](https://freedesktop.org)."
msgstr ""
"Xfce-ren beste lehentasun bat estandarrak betetzea da, bereziki "
"[freedesktop.org](https://freedesktop.org) guneak definitutakoak."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/_index.md:12
msgid ""
"Xfce can be installed on several UNIX platforms. It is known to compile on "
"Linux, NetBSD, FreeBSD, OpenBSD, Solaris, Cygwin and MacOS X, on x86, PPC, "
"Sparc, Alpha..."
msgstr ""
"Xfce zenbait UNIX plataformatan instala daiteke. Badakigu Linux, NetBSD, "
"FreeBSD, OpenBSD, Solaris, Cygwin eta MacOS X sistemetan konpilatzen dela, "
"x86, PPC, Sparc, Alpha… arkitekturetan."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/_index.md:14
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Ezaugarriak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/_index.md:16
msgid ""
"Xfce contains a number of core components for the minimum tasks you'd expect"
" from a desktop environment:"
msgstr ""
"Xfce-k zenbait oinarrizko osagai ditu mahaigain-ingurune batetik espero "
"daitezkeen gutxieneko zereginetarako:"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/_index.md:18 content/about/tour44.md:49
msgid "Window Manager"
msgstr "Leiho-kudeatzailea"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/_index.md:20
msgid ""
"Manages the placement of windows on the screen, provides window decorations "
"and manages workspaces or virtual desktops."
msgstr ""
"Leihoak pantailan non kokatzen diren kudeatzen du, leiho-apaingarriak "
"eskaintzen ditu eta laneko areak edo mahaigain birtualak kudeatzen ditu."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/_index.md:22
msgid "Desktop Manager"
msgstr "Mahaigain-kudeatzailea"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/_index.md:24
msgid ""
"Sets the background image and provides a root window menu, desktop icons or "
"minimized icons and a windows list."
msgstr ""
"Atzeko planoko irudia ezartzen du, eta erro-leihoaren menua, mahaigaineko "
"ikonoak edo ikono minimizatuak eta leihoen zerrenda eskaintzen ditu."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/_index.md:26 content/about/tour44.md:69
msgid "Panel"
msgstr "Panela"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/_index.md:28
msgid ""
"Switch between opened windows, launch applications, switch workspaces and "
"menu plugins to browse applications or directories."
msgstr ""
"Aldatu irekitako leihoen artean, abiarazi aplikazioak, aldatu laneko areaz "
"eta erabili menu-pluginak aplikazioak edo direktorioak arakatzeko."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/_index.md:30
msgid "Session Manager"
msgstr "Saio-kudeatzailea"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/_index.md:32
msgid ""
"Controls the login and power management of the desktop and allows you to "
"store multiple login sessions."
msgstr ""
"Mahaigaineko saio-hasiera eta energia-kudeaketa kontrolatzen ditu, eta "
"zenbait saio gordetzeko aukera ematen dizu."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/_index.md:34
msgid "Application Finder"
msgstr "Aplikazio bilatzailea"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/_index.md:36
msgid ""
"Shows the applications installed on your system in categories, so you can "
"quickly find and launch them."
msgstr ""
"Sisteman instalatutako aplikazioak kategoriatan erakusten ditu, azkar "
"aurkitu eta abiarazi ahal izateko."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/_index.md:38 content/about/tour44.md:21
msgid "File Manager"
msgstr "Fitxategi-kudeatzailea"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/_index.md:40
msgid ""
"Provides the basic file-management features and unique utilities like the "
"bulk renamer."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategiak kudeatzeko oinarrizko funtzioak eta tresna bereziak eskaintzen "
"ditu, hala nola multzoka berrizendatzeko tresna."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/_index.md:42 content/about/tour410.md:69
msgid "Settings Manager"
msgstr "Ezarpen-kudeatzailea"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/_index.md:44
msgid ""
"Tools to control the various settings of the desktop; like keyboard "
"shortcuts, appearance, display settings, etc."
msgstr ""
"Mahaigaineko ezarpenak kontrolatzeko tresnak: laster-teklak, itxura, "
"pantailaren ezarpenak, etab."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/_index.md:46
msgid ""
"Beside the basic set of modules, Xfce also provides numerous additional "
"applications and plugins so you can extend your desktop the way you like, "
"for example a terminal emulator, text editor, sound mixer, application "
"finder, image viewer, iCal based calendar and a CD and DVD burning "
"application. You can read more about the modules of Xfce in the "
"[projects](/projects) page."
msgstr ""
"Oinarrizko moduluez gain, Xfce-k aplikazio eta plugin gehigarri ugari ere "
"eskaintzen ditu, zure mahaigaina nahi duzun moduan hedatzeko: adibidez, "
"terminal-emulatzailea, testu-editorea, soinu-nahasgailua, aplikazio-"
"bilatzailea, irudi-ikustailea, iCal-en oinarritutako egutegia eta CD eta "
"DVDak grabatzeko aplikazioa. Xfce-ren moduluei buruz gehiago irakur dezakezu"
" [proiektuen](/projects) orrian."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/credits.md:0 content/about/tour44.md:144
#: content/about/tour46.md:142
msgid "Credits"
msgstr "Kredituak"

