#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:9
msgid "<!--more-->\n"
msgstr "<!--more-->\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1235692800.md:11
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.6 features a new configuration backend, a new settings manager, a "
"brand new sound mixer, and several huge improvements to the session manager "
"and the rest of Xfce's core components. A list of all the changes since the "
"last release candidate can be found on this page."
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.6-k konfigurazio-motor berria, ezarpen-kudeatzaile berria, soinu-"
"nahasgailu guztiz berria eta saio-kudeatzailean zein Xfce-ren gainerako "
"oinarrizko osagaietan hobekuntza handiak ditu. Azken hautagai-bertsiotik "
"izandako aldaketa guztien zerrenda orri honetan aurki daiteke."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1235692800.md:13
msgid "A visual overview of Xfce 4.6 is available [here](/about/tour46)."
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.6-ren ikuspegi orokor bisuala [hemen](/about/tour46) dago "
"eskuragarri."

