#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1334361600.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.10pre2 released"
msgstr "Xfce 4.10pre2 argitaratu da"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1334361600.md:7
msgid ""
"The Xfce development team is proud to announce the second preview release "
"for Xfce 4.10. Together with this preview release, the Xfce project "
"announces the string and code (only critical bug fixes or regressions) "
"freeze for the final 4.10 release which is set to be pushed out to the world"
" on April 28th, 2012."
msgstr ""
"Xfce garapen taldeak harro iragartzen du Xfce 4.10-en bigarren aurrebista-"
"bertsioa. Aurrebista-bertsio honekin batera, Xfce proiektuak kateen eta "
"kodearen izozketa iragartzen du (akats larrien edo atzerakaden zuzenketak "
"soilik) 4.10 bertsio finalerako, zeina 2012ko apirilaren 28an argitaratzea "
"aurreikusten baita."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1334361600.md:11
msgid ""
"This release incorporates some new features like improved responsiveness of "
"file operations in Thunar and tiling improvements in Xfwm4. Everything else "
"is bug fixes and a _lot_ of translation updates."
msgstr ""
"Bertsio honek ezaugarri berri batzuk ditu, hala nola Thunar-en fitxategi-"
"eragiketen erantzun hobea eta Xfwm4-ko lauzatze-hobekuntzak. Gainerako "
"guztia akats-zuzenketak eta itzulpen-eguneraketa _asko_ dira."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1334361600.md:13
msgid ""
"We hope you will enjoy this release. Please give us feedback by sharing your"
" thoughts, blogging, tweeting or by filing bug reports! With your help, 4.10"
" will be the best release ever (at least until 4.12)!"
msgstr ""
"Espero dugu bertsio honekin gozatuko duzuela. Eman iezaguzu zure iritzia: "
"partekatu zure gogoetak, idatzi blogean, txiokatu edo bidali akats-"
"txostenak! Zure laguntzarekin, 4.10 inoizko bertsiorik onena izango da (4.12"
" iritsi arte, behintzat)!"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1334361600.md:17
msgid "[Download](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.10pre2/)"
msgstr "[Deskargatu](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.10pre2/)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1334361600.md:18
msgid "[Changes in this release](/download/changelogs/4.10pre2)"
msgstr "[Bertsio honetako aldaketak](/download/changelogs/4.10pre2)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1334361600.md:19
msgid "[Permalink](/about/news/1334361600/)"
