#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.20 released"
msgstr "Xfce 4.20 argitaratu da"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:7
msgid ""
"After almost two years of work, we are happy to announce the release of Xfce"
" 4.20 !"
msgstr ""
"Ia bi urteko lanaren ondoren, pozik iragartzen dugu Xfce 4.20 argitaratu "
"dela!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:11
msgid ""
"Since Xfce 4.18 a lot of major development happened. Our team added many "
"nice new features, did a gazillion of bug fixes and did various minor "
"improvements. Finally, all that was released for your pleasure."
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.18 geroztik garapen handia egon da. Gure taldeak ezaugarri berri "
"polit ugari gehitu ditu, akats-zuzenketa piloa egin ditu eta hainbat "
"hobekuntza txiki egin ditu. Azkenean, hori guztia zuen gozamenerako "
"argitaratu da."

#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:13
msgid ""
"<img src=\"//cdn.xfce.org/about/screenshots/4.20-1.png\" border=\"0\" "
"alt=\"Xfce 4.20 screenshot\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>\n"
msgstr ""
"<img src=\"//cdn.xfce.org/about/screenshots/4.20-1.png\" border=\"0\" "
"alt=\"Xfce 4.20 pantaila-argazkia\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:15
msgid ""
"The major focus during this development cycle was the preparation of the "
"codebase to be ready for Wayland. So that we meanwhile have experimental "
"Wayland support for most components. More details in the links below."
msgstr ""
"Garapen-ziklo honetako ardatz nagusia kode-oinarria Wayland-erako prestatzea"
" izan da. Horri esker, osagai gehienek Wayland-erako euskarri esperimentala "
"dute dagoeneko. Xehetasun gehiago beheko esteketan."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:17
msgid ""
"Assuming you have installed Xfce 4.18, here is an overview on the major "
"changes you will see on an upgrade to Xfce 4.20:"
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.18 instalatuta duzula suposatuz, hona hemen Xfce 4.20ra eguneratzean "
"ikusiko dituzun aldaketa nagusien ikuspegi orokorra:"

#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:19
msgid "<https://www.xfce.org/about/tour420>"
msgstr "<https://www.xfce.org/about/tour420>"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:21
msgid ""
"A detailed overview of the changes between Xfce 4.18 and Xfce 4.20 releases "
"can be found on the following page:"
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.18 eta Xfce 4.20 bertsioen arteko aldaketen ikuspegi orokor zehatza "
"orri honetan aurki daiteke:"

#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:23
msgid "<https://www.xfce.org/download/changelogs/4.20>"
msgstr "<https://www.xfce.org/download/changelogs/4.20>"

#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:27
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.20>"
msgstr "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.20>"

#: content/about/news/_index.md:0
msgid "News"
msgstr "Albisteak"

#: content/about/screenshots.md:0
msgid "Screenshots"
msgstr "Pantaila-argazkiak"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour410.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.10 tour"
msgstr "Xfce 4.10 bisita gidatua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.10. It only "
"covers the visual part of what has been done; for the full list of changes, "
"see the [changelogs](/download/changelogs/)."
msgstr ""
"Bisita gidatu honek Xfce 4.10-en ezaugarri berri nagusiak aurkeztuko "
"dizkizu. Egindakoaren alderdi bisuala soilik jasotzen du; aldaketen zerrenda"
" osorako, ikusi [aldaketa-logak](/download/changelogs/)."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:9
msgid "Online Documentation"
msgstr "Lineako dokumentazioa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:11
msgid ""
"During the 4.10 development we've decided to remove user manuals from the "
"packages and move them to an online wiki at "
"[docs.xfce.org](https://docs.xfce.org). The reason for this change is to "
"make [contributing](https://docs.xfce.org/wiki/documentation) and updating "
"the documentation easier."
msgstr ""
"4.10 bertsioaren garapenean, erabiltzaile-eskuliburuak paketeetatik kendu "
"eta [docs.xfce.org](https://docs.xfce.org) lineako wiki batera eramatea "
"erabaki dugu. Aldaketa honen arrazoia dokumentazioari [ekarpenak "
"egitea](https://docs.xfce.org/wiki/documentation) eta hura eguneratzea "
"erraztea da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:13
msgid ""
"![When you click a Help button Xfce will ask you to go to an online wiki "
"page][img-online-help]"
msgstr ""
"![Laguntza botoi bat sakatzean, Xfce-k lineako wiki-orri batera joateko "
"eskatuko dizu][img-online-help]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:15
msgid ""
"We hope that with the introduction of the wiki it will be easier for "
"developers and contributors to maintain the documentation."
msgstr ""
"Espero dugu wikiari esker errazagoa izango dela garatzaileentzat eta "
"laguntzaileentzat dokumentazioa mantentzea."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:17 content/about/tour418.md:199
#: content/about/tour46.md:131
msgid "Application Finder *(xfce4-appfinder)*"
msgstr "Aplikazio-bilatzailea *(xfce4-appfinder)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:19
msgid "![Collapsed view of the Application Finder][img-appfinder-collapsed]"
msgstr ""
"![Aplikazio-bilatzailearen ikuspegi tolestua][img-appfinder-collapsed]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:21
msgid ""
"The application finder has been completely rewritten and combines the "
"functionality of the old appfinder and xfrun4. Apart from user interface "
"improvements, it now allows creating custom actions matching a prefix or a "
"regex pattern."
msgstr ""
"Aplikazio-bilatzailea guztiz berridatzi da, eta appfinder zaharraren eta "
"xfrun4-ren funtzionaltasuna batzen du. Erabiltzaile-interfazearen "
"hobekuntzez gain, orain aurrizki edo adierazpen erregular batekin bat "
"datozen ekintza pertsonalizatuak sortzeko aukera ematen du."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:23
msgid "![Expanded view of the Application Finder][img-appfinder-expanded]"
msgstr "![Aplikazio-bilatzailearen ikuspegi zabaldua][img-appfinder-expanded]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:25 content/about/tour412.md:39
#: content/about/tour414.md:33 content/about/tour416.md:47
#: content/about/tour418.md:37 content/about/tour46.md:19
#: content/about/tour48.md:29
msgid "Panel *(xfce4-panel)*"
msgstr "Panela *(xfce4-panel)*"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:27
msgid "Multiple Rows"
msgstr "Errenkada anitz"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:29
msgid ""
"In 4.10 there is a single panel-wide option for configuring the number of "
"rows in the panel. Some plugins (e.g. *launchers*) fit a single row, while "
"others, like window buttons are allowed to occupy full width of the panel."
msgstr ""
"4.10ean, panel osorako aukera bakarra dago panelaren errenkada kopurua "
"konfiguratzeko. Plugin batzuk (adibidez, *abiarazleak*) errenkada bakar "
"batean sartzen dira, eta beste batzuek, leiho-botoiek kasu, panelaren "
"zabalera osoa har dezakete."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:31
msgid ""
"![A horizontal panel with a number of rows set to three][img-panel-rows]"
msgstr ""
"![Panel horizontala, errenkada kopurua hirutan ezarrita][img-panel-rows]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:33
msgid "Deskbar Mode"
msgstr "Deskbar modua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:35
msgid ""
"The panel features a new configuration called a *deskbar* mode. In the "
"deskbar mode the panel is aligned vertically, just like in the vertical "
"mode, but the plugins are laid out horizontally. With multiple rows, it "
"allows creating wide vertical panels suitable for wide-screen setups."
msgstr ""
"Panelak konfigurazio berri bat du, *deskbar* modua deitua. Deskbar moduan, "
"panela bertikalki lerrokatzen da, modu bertikalean bezala, baina pluginak "
"horizontalki antolatzen dira. Errenkada anitzekin, pantaila zabaleko "
"konfiguraziotarako egokiak diren panel bertikal zabalak sor daitezke."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:37
msgid ""
"![A panel in Deskbar mode with a number of rows set to five][img-panel-"
"deskbar]"
msgstr ""
"![Panela Deskbar moduan, errenkada kopurua bostean ezarrita][img-panel-"
"deskbar]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:39
msgid "Actions Plugin"
msgstr "Ekintzen plugina"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:41
msgid ""
"Session plugin from the xfce4-session package has been merged with a "
"rewritten *actions* plugin"
msgstr ""
"xfce4-session paketeko saio-plugina berridatzitako *ekintzen* pluginarekin "
"bateratu da"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:43
msgid ""
"![Action plugin in a menu mode (left), and in a button mode (right)][img-"
"panel-actions]"
msgstr ""
"![Ekintzen plugina menu moduan (ezkerrean) eta botoi moduan "
"(eskuinean)][img-panel-actions]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:45
msgid "Window Buttons"
msgstr "Leiho-botoiak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:47
msgid ""
"The *window buttons* plugin no longer expands, which makes the plugin "
"positioning more flexible. In order to restore the previous behavior please "
"add a transparent *separator* plugin with the **Expand** option enabled just"
" behind the window buttons plugin."
msgstr ""
"*Leiho-botoiak* plugina jada ez da zabaltzen, eta horrek pluginaren kokapena"
" malguagoa egiten du. Aurreko portaera leheneratzeko, gehitu *bereizle* "
"plugin garden bat, **Zabaldu** aukera gaituta duela, leiho-botoien "
"pluginaren atzean."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:49 content/about/tour412.md:105
#: content/about/tour414.md:55 content/about/tour416.md:41
#: content/about/tour418.md:71 content/about/tour46.md:67
#: content/about/tour48.md:9
msgid "File Manager *(thunar)*"
msgstr "Fitxategi-kudeatzailea *(thunar)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:51
msgid ""
"There are few visual changes in this release of Thunar. The window has less "
"padding and the position of the status bar has been adjusted."
msgstr ""
"Thunar-en bertsio honetan aldaketa bisual gutxi daude. Leihoak betegarri "
"gutxiago du eta egoera-barraren kokapena doitu egin da."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:53 content/about/tour46.md:33
msgid "Session Manager *(xfce4-session)*"
msgstr "Saio-kudeatzailea *(xfce4-session)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:55
msgid ""
"The *session manager*'s settings dialog has a button for clearing the saved "
"session (no more `rm -r ~/.config/sessions`). Xfce4-tips has been removed "
"and the session manager can now lock the screen before suspending or "
"hibernating the system."
msgstr ""
"*Saio-kudeatzailearen* ezarpen-elkarrizketak gordetako saioa garbitzeko "
"botoi bat du (ez gehiago `rm -r ~/.config/sessions`). Xfce4-tips kendu egin "
"da, eta saio-kudeatzaileak orain pantaila blokea dezake sistema eten edo "
"hibernatu aurretik."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:57
msgid "Applications Autostart"
msgstr "Aplikazioen abio automatikoa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:59
msgid ""
"Another noticeable change is the way GNOME and KDE compatibility works. "
"Compatibility check boxes only enable services, which have to be started "
"before other applications (*gnome-keyring* and *gconf* for GNOME and "
"*kdeinit* for KDE). All other autostart applications are available from "
"**Applications Autostart**, but they are listed using an italic font and not"
" enabled by default in order to distinguish them from Xfce applications. "
"Unlike in previous versions of Xfce, compatibility services can be started "
"independently from each other."
msgstr ""
"Beste aldaketa nabarmen bat GNOME eta KDErekiko bateragarritasunaren "
"funtzionamendua da. Bateragarritasun-kontrol laukiek beste aplikazioen "
"aurretik abiarazi behar diren zerbitzuak soilik gaitzen dituzte (*gnome-"
"keyring* eta *gconf* GNOMErentzat, eta *kdeinit* KDErentzat). Abio "
"automatikoko gainerako aplikazio guztiak **Aplikazioen abio automatikoa** "
"atalean daude eskuragarri, baina letra etzanez zerrendatzen dira eta ez "
"daude lehenespenez gaituta, Xfce-ren aplikazioetatik bereizteko. Xfce-ren "
"aurreko bertsioetan ez bezala, bateragarritasun-zerbitzuak bata "
"bestearengandik independenteki abiaraz daitezke."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:61
msgid ""
"![Applications, which are not a part of Xfce, are listed using an italic "
"font][img-session-autostart]"
msgstr ""
"![Xfce-ren parte ez diren aplikazioak letra etzanez zerrendatzen dira][img-"
"session-autostart]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:63 content/about/tour412.md:63
#: content/about/tour46.md:85 content/about/tour48.md:73
msgid "Settings *(xfce4-settings)*"
msgstr "Ezarpenak *(xfce4-settings)*"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:65
msgid "Settings Daemon"
msgstr "Ezarpenen daemona"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:67
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.8 used two processes for applying settings: `xfce4-settings-helper` "
"and `xfsettingsd`. In 4.10 they have been merged into xfsettingsd, which now"
" handles all system settings."
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.8-k bi prozesu erabiltzen zituen ezarpenak aplikatzeko: "
"`xfce4-settings-helper` eta `xfsettingsd`. 4.10ean xfsettingsd-n bateratu "
"dira, eta orain hark kudeatzen ditu sistemaren ezarpen guztiak."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:71
msgid ""
"The new *settings manager* groups configuration dialogs in categories and "
"allows you to search for their names or descriptions. Most of the dialogs "
"are also now embedded in the settings manager window (this was a compile-"
"time option in Xfce 4.8)."
msgstr ""
"*Ezarpen-kudeatzaile* berriak konfigurazio-elkarrizketak kategoriatan "
"taldekatzen ditu, eta haien izenak edo deskribapenak bilatzeko aukera ematen"
" du. Elkarrizketa gehienak ezarpen-kudeatzailearen leihoan txertatuta daude "
"orain ere (hori konpilazio-aukera bat zen Xfce 4.8an)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:73
msgid ""
"![The settings manager with icons grouped by category and a search filter "
"applied][img-settings-manager]"
msgstr ""
"![Ezarpen-kudeatzailea, ikonoak kategoriaka taldekatuta eta bilaketa-"
"iragazki bat aplikatuta][img-settings-manager]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:75
msgid "Settings Editor"
msgstr "Ezarpen-editorea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:77
msgid ""
"The *settings editor* no longer collapses the entire tree when you edit a "
"property (this is because it now reloads a single cell rather than the whole"
" tree). Most properties can now be edited in-place, making it easier to "
"quickly adjust settings."
msgstr ""
"*Ezarpen-editoreak* jada ez du zuhaitz osoa tolesten propietate bat "
"editatzean (orain gelaxka bakarra birkargatzen duelako, ez zuhaitz osoa). "
"Propietate gehienak bertan editatu daitezke orain, eta horrela errazagoa da "
"ezarpenak azkar doitzea."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:79
msgid ""
"Using settings editor you can also monitor changes of settings in a selected"
" channel. Right-click on a channel in the main window, and select "
"**Monitor** to display the monitor window."
msgstr ""
"Ezarpen-editorearekin, hautatutako kanal bateko ezarpenen aldaketak ere "
"monitoriza ditzakezu. Egin eskuineko klik kanal batean leiho nagusian, eta "
"hautatu **Monitorizatu** monitore-leihoa bistaratzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:81
msgid ""
"![Settings editor with an open channel monitor, while editing a property in-"
"place][img-settings-editor]"
msgstr ""
"![Ezarpen-editorea kanal-monitore bat irekita duela, propietate bat bertan "
"editatzen den bitartean][img-settings-editor]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:83
msgid "MIME Type Editor"
msgstr "MIME moten editorea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:85
msgid ""
"In the last couple of years, many people were asking for a tool to manage "
"their file type associations. The new *MIME type editor* does just that. It "
"allows you to easily assign a default application to a file type, see your "
"changes and reset them to default settings when necessary. Note that it does"
" not allow you to change the system MIME Type definitions (add or remove "
"types and change icons)."
msgstr ""
"Azken urteotan, jende askok eskatu du fitxategi moten asoziazioak kudeatzeko"
" tresna bat. *MIME moten editore* berriak hori egiten du, hain zuzen. "
"Fitxategi mota bati aplikazio lehenetsi bat erraz esleitzeko, zure aldaketak"
" ikusteko eta behar denean ezarpen lehenetsietara berrezartzeko aukera "
"ematen du. Kontuan izan ez duela sistemaren MIME moten definizioak aldatzeko"
" aukerarik ematen (motak gehitu edo kendu eta ikonoak aldatu)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:87
msgid ""
"![MIME types matching a pattern and a menu for selecting a default "
"application][img-settings-mime]"
msgstr ""
"![Eredu batekin bat datozen MIME motak eta aplikazio lehenetsia hautatzeko "
"menu bat][img-settings-mime]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:89
msgid "Mouse and Touchpad"
msgstr "Sagua eta ukipen-panela"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:91
msgid ""
"The *mouse and touchpad* dialog is capable of handling basic Synaptics and "
"Wacom properties in the GUI. A settings daemon running in the background "
"handles all kinds of device properties, as documented in the [mouse "
"settings](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/mouse) wiki."
msgstr ""
"*Sagua eta ukipen-panela* elkarrizketak Synaptics eta Wacom-en oinarrizko "
"propietateak kudea ditzake interfaze grafikoan. Atzeko planoan exekutatzen "
"den ezarpen-daemon batek gailuen era guztietako propietateak kudeatzen ditu,"
" [saguaren ezarpenak](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/mouse) "
"wikian dokumentatuta dagoen bezala."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:93
msgid ""
"![Synaptics touchpad settings in the mouse and touchpad dialog][img-"
"settings-mouse]"
msgstr ""
"![Synaptics ukipen-panelaren ezarpenak sagua eta ukipen-panela "
"elkarrizketan][img-settings-mouse]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:95 content/about/tour412.md:73
#: content/about/tour418.md:65 content/about/tour420.md:277
msgid "Appearance Settings"
msgstr "Itxuraren ezarpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:97
msgid ""
"In 4.10 you can drag and drop a tarball with a downloaded theme onto the "
"*style* or *icon* list. Xfce will attempt to extract and install the files "
"into the `~/.themes` or `~/.icons` directory."
msgstr ""
"4.10ean, deskargatutako gai baten tarball-a *estilo* edo *ikono* zerrendara "
"arrastatu eta jaregin dezakezu. Xfce fitxategiak `~/.themes` edo `~/.icons` "
"direktorioan erauzten eta instalatzen saiatuko da."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:99 content/about/tour412.md:55
#: content/about/tour418.md:47 content/about/tour46.md:9
msgid "Desktop Manager *(xfdesktop)*"
msgstr "Mahaigain-kudeatzailea *(xfdesktop)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:101
msgid ""
"Although the initial plan for Xfce 4.10 was to integrate desktop handling in"
" Thunar, we have decided not to do it at this time yet. Meanwhile, Xfdesktop"
" has gained support for single-click operation, automated background image "
"cycling and thumbnail rendering."
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.10erako hasierako plana mahaigainaren kudeaketa Thunar-en integratzea"
" bazen ere, oraingoz ez egitea erabaki dugu. Bitartean, Xfdesktop-ek klik "
"bakarreko funtzionamendurako, atzeko planoko irudien txandakatze "
"automatikorako eta koadro txikiak errendatzeko euskarria jaso du."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:103
msgid ""
"![Desktop with image thumbnails and support for single-click operation][img-"
"xfdesktop]"
msgstr ""
"![Mahaigaina irudien koadro txikiekin eta klik bakarreko funtzionamenduaren "
"euskarriarekin][img-xfdesktop]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:105
msgid "Xfdesktop is now shipped with a new default background image."
msgstr "Xfdesktop-ek atzeko planoko irudi lehenetsi berri bat dakar orain."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:107 content/about/tour412.md:9
#: content/about/tour418.md:213 content/about/tour46.md:43
msgid "Window Manager *(xfwm4)*"
msgstr "Leiho-kudeatzailea *(xfwm4)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:109
msgid ""
"Xfwm4 can now tile a window when you drag it to the edge of the screen. This"
" feature is optional and is disabled by default. In such a case windows can "
"still be tiled using a keyboard shortcut. Another improvement is a better "
"theming support and cursor key navigation in the tab window (Alt+Tab)."
msgstr ""
"Xfwm4-k orain leiho bat lauza dezake pantailaren ertzera arrastatzean. "
"Ezaugarri hau hautazkoa da, eta lehenespenez desgaituta dago. Hala ere, "
"leihoak laster-tekla baten bidez lauza daitezke. Beste hobekuntza bat gaien "
"euskarri hobea eta kurtsore-teklekin nabigatzea da fitxen leihoan (Alt+Tab)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour412.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.12 tour"
msgstr "Xfce 4.12 bisita gidatua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.12. It only "
"covers improvements made on the surface; for the full list of changes, see "
"the [changelogs](/download/changelogs/)."
msgstr ""
"Bisita gidatu honek Xfce 4.12-ren ezaugarri berri nagusiak aurkeztuko "
"dizkizu. Azalean egindako hobekuntzak soilik jasotzen ditu; aldaketen "
"zerrenda osorako, ikusi [aldaketa-logak](/download/changelogs/)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:11
msgid "Window Switcher Dialog"
msgstr "Leiho-aldatzailearen elkarrizketa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:13
msgid ""
"The window manager's Alt+Tab dialog is now fully themeable and also gained "
"two new modes: a 'List' mode and a 'Window Preview' mode. Furthermore users "
"use their mouse to click/select the window they want to give focus to."
msgstr ""
"Leiho-kudeatzailearen Alt+Tab elkarrizketa guztiz pertsonaliza daiteke "
"gaiekin orain, eta bi modu berri ere baditu: 'Zerrenda' modua eta 'Leihoen "
"aurrebista' modua. Gainera, erabiltzaileek sagua erabil dezakete fokua eman "
"nahi dioten leihoa klikatu/hautatzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:15
msgid ""
"![The traditional dialog is fully themable now][img-tabwin-simple-crop]"
msgstr ""
"![Elkarrizketa tradizionala guztiz pertsonaliza daiteke gaiekin orain][img-"
"tabwin-simple-crop]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:17
msgid "The List mode of the Alt-Tab dialog."
msgstr "Alt-Tab elkarrizketaren Zerrenda modua."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:19
msgid ""
"![List mode of Alt-Tab, showing all window titles][img-tabwin-list-crop]"
msgstr ""
"![Alt-Tab-en Zerrenda modua, leiho guztien tituluak erakutsiz][img-tabwin-"
"list-crop]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:21
msgid ""
"The Window Preview mode shows thumbnails of windows' content alongside their"
" icon. Activating the compositor is a prerequisite for this mode."
msgstr ""
"Leihoen aurrebista moduak leihoen edukiaren koadro txikiak erakusten ditu, "
"haien ikonoaren ondoan. Modu hau erabiltzeko, konposatzailea aktibatu behar "
"da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:23
msgid "![Window thumbnails][img-tabwin-preview-crop]"
msgstr "![Leihoen koadro txikiak][img-tabwin-preview-crop]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:25
msgid "Tiling, Zooming, Client-side Decorations"
msgstr "Lauzatzea, zooma, bezero aldeko apaingarriak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:27
msgid ""
"Support for Client-Side Decorations (CSDs) has been improved. They now "
"properly snap to screen and panel borders, and tile correctly, even with "
"shadows."
msgstr ""
"Bezero aldeko apaingarrien (CSD) euskarria hobetu da. Orain behar bezala "
"atxikitzen dira pantailaren eta panelaren ertzetara, eta zuzen lauzatzen "
"dira, itzalekin ere."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:29
msgid "![Gtk3 apps with their decorations drawn by the client][img-xfwm4-csd]"
msgstr ""
"![Gtk3 aplikazioak, bezeroak marraztutako apaingarriekin][img-xfwm4-csd]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:31
msgid ""
"Window tiling mode was improved by providing support for corner-tiling, and "
"a new zooming mode was added using Alt + Mouse Wheel."
msgstr ""
"Leihoak lauzatzeko modua hobetu da izkinetan lauzatzeko euskarria emanez, "
"eta zoom modu berri bat gehitu da Alt + saguaren gurpila erabiliz."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:33
msgid ""
"![Drag and drop a window to a corner to tile it][img-xfwm4-tiling-small]"
msgstr ""
"![Arrastatu eta jaregin leiho bat izkina batera lauzatzeko][img-"
"xfwm4-tiling-small]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:35
msgid "HiDPI Support"
msgstr "HiDPI euskarria"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:37
msgid ""
"In order to better support modern hi-resolution screens, two new Xfwm4 "
"themes were added (hdpi, xhdpi)."
msgstr ""
"Bereizmen handiko pantaila modernoak hobeto onartzeko, Xfwm4-ren bi gai "
"berri gehitu dira (hdpi, xhdpi)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:41
msgid "Intelligent Hiding"
msgstr "Ezkutatze adimentsua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:43
msgid ""
"The panel can now intelligently hide itself when a window is dragged near "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Panela orain modu adimentsuan ezkuta daiteke leiho bat bere ondora "
"arrastatzen denean."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:45
msgid "![Oh what is this window??][img-panel-shown]"
msgstr "![Ai, zer da leiho hau??][img-panel-shown]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:47
msgid "![Don't come closer!][img-panel-shown-stack]"
msgstr "![Ez hurbildu!][img-panel-shown-stack]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:49
msgid "![Hah! Now you don't see me!][img-panel-hidden]"
msgstr "![Ha! Orain ez nauzu ikusten!][img-panel-hidden]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:51
msgid "Gtk3 plugins"
msgstr "Gtk3 pluginak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:53
msgid ""
"Infrastructure was added to be able to load Gtk3 plugins alongside Gtk2 "
"plugins."
msgstr ""
"Gtk3 pluginak Gtk2 pluginekin batera kargatu ahal izateko azpiegitura gehitu"
" da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:57
msgid ""
"The desktop has a new wallpaper settings dialog with many new options and "
"better multi-monitor support. Drag the dialog to the display or workspace "
"where you want to change the wallpaper."
msgstr ""
"Mahaigainak horma-paperaren ezarpen-elkarrizketa berri bat du, aukera berri "
"ugarirekin eta monitore anitzen euskarri hobearekin. Arrastatu elkarrizketa "
"horma-papera aldatu nahi duzun pantailara edo laneko areara."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:59
msgid ""
"![Better multi-monitor support][img-xfdesktop-properties-multiworkspace]"
msgstr ""
"![Monitore anitzen euskarri hobea][img-xfdesktop-properties-multiworkspace]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:61
msgid ""
"Uncheck 'apply to all workspaces' to set a different wallpaper for each "
"workspace."
msgstr ""
"Desmarkatu 'aplikatu laneko area guztiei' laneko area bakoitzerako horma-"
"paper desberdin bat ezartzeko."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:65 content/about/tour418.md:59
#: content/about/tour420.md:287
msgid "Display Settings"
msgstr "Pantailaren ezarpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:67
msgid ""
"Support for multi-monitor use was vastly improved in the display settings "
"dialog. Upon connecting a new display, a quick setup popup offers some of "
"the most-used modes for users to quickly change their layout."
msgstr ""
"Monitore anitzen erabilerarako euskarria asko hobetu da pantailaren ezarpen-"
"elkarrizketan. Pantaila berri bat konektatzean, konfigurazio azkarreko leiho"
" gainerakor batek modu erabilienetako batzuk eskaintzen ditu, erabiltzaileek"
" beren diseinua azkar alda dezaten."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:69
msgid "![Configure multiple displays][img-xfce4-display-settings-twoscreens]"
msgstr "![Konfiguratu pantaila anitz][img-xfce4-display-settings-twoscreens]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:71
msgid ""
"![Choose your layout when plugging in a new display][img-xfce4-display-"
"layout]"
msgstr ""
"![Aukeratu zure diseinua pantaila berri bat konektatzean][img-xfce4-display-"
"layout]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:75
msgid "The appearance dialog now showcases previews for styles and icons."
msgstr ""
"Itxuraren elkarrizketak estiloen eta ikonoen aurrebistak erakusten ditu "
"orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:77
msgid "![Gtk style preview][img-xfce4-appearance-settings-style]"
msgstr "![Gtk estiloaren aurrebista][img-xfce4-appearance-settings-style]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:79
msgid "![Icon theme preview][img-xfce4-appearance-settings-icons]"
msgstr "![Ikono-gaiaren aurrebista][img-xfce4-appearance-settings-icons]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour412.md:81 content/about/tour414.md:69
#: content/about/tour416.md:67
msgid "Power Manager *(xfce4-power-manager)*"
msgstr "Energia-kudeatzailea *(xfce4-power-manager)*"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:83 content/about/tour414.md:71
#: content/about/tour414.md:85
msgid "Panel Plugin"
msgstr "Panel-plugina"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:85
msgid ""
"A new panel plugin was created which allows you to quickly control your "
"screen brightness, either via the menu or by simply using your mouse's "
"scroll wheel over the plugin. The plugin's menu also shows all other "
"connected devices with a power status, e.g. bluetooth keyboards or wireless "
"mice. It still offers quick access to the presentation mode, which inhibits "
"your screensaver for as long as the option is active."
msgstr ""
"Panel-plugin berri bat sortu da pantailaren distira azkar kontrolatzeko, "
"menuaren bidez edo saguaren gurpila pluginaren gainean erabiliz. Pluginaren "
"menuak energia-egoera duten konektatutako beste gailu guztiak ere erakusten "
"ditu, adibidez bluetooth teklatuak edo hari gabeko saguak. Aurkezpen "
"modurako sarbide azkarra eskaintzen jarraitzen du; modu horrek pantaila-"
"babeslea inhibitzen du aukera aktibo dagoen bitartean."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:87
msgid ""
"![The plugin's menu allows users to control screen brightness and check on "
"the remaining uptime their battery provides.][img-xfpm-plugin-crop]"
msgstr ""
"![Pluginaren menuari esker, erabiltzaileek pantailaren distira kontrola "
"dezakete eta bateriak ematen dien gainerako iraupena egiaztatu.][img-xfpm-"
"plugin-crop]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:89 content/about/tour414.md:49
msgid "Settings Dialog"
msgstr "Ezarpen-elkarrizketa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:91
msgid ""
"The settings dialog was completely restructured (separating button/lid "
"events from system and display behavior) and offers a clearer way of setting"
" your preferences."
msgstr ""
"Ezarpen-elkarrizketa guztiz berregituratu da (botoi eta tapa gertaerak "
"sistemaren eta pantailaren portaeratik bereiziz), eta zure hobespenak "
"ezartzeko modu argiagoa eskaintzen du."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:93
msgid ""
"![Configure what action to take when certain buttons are pressed or the "
"laptop lid is closed][img-xfpm-prefs-general]"
msgstr ""
"![Konfiguratu zer ekintza egin botoi jakin batzuk sakatzean edo ordenagailu "
"eramangarriaren tapa ixtean][img-xfpm-prefs-general]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:95
msgid ""
"![Configure what to do when the user is inactive or battery is drained][img-"
"xfpm-prefs-system]"
msgstr ""
"![Konfiguratu zer egin erabiltzailea inaktibo dagoenean edo bateria agortzen"
" denean][img-xfpm-prefs-system]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:97
msgid "![Manage display power management][img-xfpm-prefs-display]"
msgstr "![Kudeatu pantailaren energia-kudeaketa][img-xfpm-prefs-display]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:99
msgid ""
"![Display information on all connected devices][img-xfpm-prefs-devices]"
msgstr ""
"![Bistaratu konektatutako gailu guztien informazioa][img-xfpm-prefs-devices]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:101
msgid ""
"When light-locker is available, you can control its settings directly via "
"the power manager."
msgstr ""
"light-locker eskuragarri dagoenean, haren ezarpenak zuzenean kontrola "
"ditzakezu energia-kudeatzailearen bidez."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:103
msgid "![Setup light-locker integration][img-xfpm-prefs-security]"
msgstr "![Konfiguratu light-locker integrazioa][img-xfpm-prefs-security]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:107
msgid "Tab Support"
msgstr "Fitxen euskarria"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:109
msgid ""
"A long-awaited feature was added: you can now open multiple folders in the "
"same Thunar window."
msgstr ""
"Aspalditik itxarondako ezaugarri bat gehitu da: orain karpeta anitz ireki "
"ditzakezu Thunar-en leiho berean."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:111
msgid "![Browse multiple directories][img-thunar-tabs]"
msgstr "![Arakatu direktorio anitz][img-thunar-tabs]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:113
msgid ""
"Thunar now displays the remaining free space with a bar in a folder "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"Thunar-ek orain gainerako leku librea barra batekin erakusten du karpeta "
"baten propietateetan."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:115
msgid "![Freespace bar][img-thunar-freespace]"
msgstr "![Leku librearen barra][img-thunar-freespace]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:117
msgid "And you can select multiple files to see their properties at once."
msgstr ""
"Eta fitxategi anitz hauta ditzakezu haien propietateak aldi berean ikusteko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:119
msgid "![Multiple File Properties][img-thunar-multifiles-props]"
msgstr "![Fitxategi anitzen propietateak][img-thunar-multifiles-props]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour412.md:121
msgid "Goodies"
msgstr "Aparteko Estrak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:123
msgid ""
"There have been lots of improvements to our goodies, and some new and shiny "
"applications have been added by new contributors."
msgstr ""
"Hobekuntza ugari egin dira gure altxorretan, eta laguntzaile berriek "
"aplikazio berri eta distiratsu batzuk gehitu dituzte."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:125
msgid "Alternative panel menu plugin *(xfce4-whiskermenu)*"
msgstr "Panelerako menu-plugin alternatiboa *(xfce4-whiskermenu)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:127
msgid ""
"The whisker menu is an alternative to the traditional menu plugin, showing "
"favourites, allowing to search through existing apps and much more."
msgstr ""
"Whisker menua menu-plugin tradizionalaren alternatiba bat da: gogokoak "
"erakusten ditu, dauden aplikazioen artean bilatzeko aukera ematen du eta "
"askoz gehiago."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:129
msgid "![Browse through categories][img-whiskermenu-default]"
msgstr "![Arakatu kategorietan][img-whiskermenu-default]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:131
msgid "![Search for an application][img-whiskermenu-search]"
msgstr "![Bilatu aplikazio bat][img-whiskermenu-search]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:133
msgid "Task Manager *(xfce4-taskmanager)*"
msgstr "Ataza-kudeatzailea *(xfce4-taskmanager)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:135
msgid ""
"The task manager got a revamped user interface, a filter and also supports "
"Gtk3 now."
msgstr ""
"Ataza-kudeatzaileak erabiltzaile-interfaze berritua eta iragazki bat ditu, "
"eta Gtk3 onartzen du orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:137
msgid "![Show processes as a tree][img-taskman-tree]"
msgstr "![Erakutsi prozesuak zuhaitz gisa][img-taskman-tree]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:139
msgid "![Filter processes by name][img-taskman-filter]"
msgstr "![Iragazi prozesuak izenaren arabera][img-taskman-filter]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:141 content/about/tour414.md:91
msgid "Media Player *(parole)*"
msgstr "Multimedia-erreproduzitzailea *(parole)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:143
msgid ""
"Parole's UI was totally redone in Gtk3. It now supports multiple video "
"backends, makes more efficient use of your resources and contains a few "
"novel plugins."
msgstr ""
"Parole-ren interfazea guztiz berregin da Gtk3n. Orain bideo-motor anitz "
"onartzen ditu, zure baliabideak modu eraginkorragoan erabiltzen ditu eta "
"plugin berritzaile batzuk ditu."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:145
msgid "![Watch videos][img-parole]"
msgstr "![Ikusi bideoak][img-parole]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:147
msgid ""
"The media controls are now contained in a slide-over overlay (with a "
"configurable timeout)."
msgstr ""
"Multimedia-kontrolak orain gainjartze irristakor batean daude (denbora-muga "
"konfiguragarriarekin)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:149
msgid "![Listen to music][img-parole-audio]"
msgstr "![Entzun musika][img-parole-audio]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:151
msgid "Text Editor *(mousepad)*"
msgstr "Testu-editorea *(mousepad)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:153
msgid ""
"Mousepad was totally rewritten, gained a settings dialog and now supports "
"Gtk3."
msgstr ""
"Mousepad guztiz berridatzi da, ezarpen-elkarrizketa bat du eta Gtk3 onartzen"
" du orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:155
msgid "![New mousepad settings][img-mousepad-prefs]"
msgstr "![Mousepad-en ezarpen berriak][img-mousepad-prefs]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour412.md:157
msgid "A note on Xfce's portability"
msgstr "Xfce-ren eramangarritasunari buruzko ohar bat"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:159
msgid ""
"All but one of those screenshots were taken on machines running OpenBSD "
"-current, a good proof that Xfce is still portable and friendly to all Unix "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"Pantaila-argazki horiek guztiak, bat izan ezik, OpenBSD -current exekutatzen"
" duten makinetan atera dira: Xfce oraindik eramangarria eta Unix sistema "
"guztiekin atsegina dela erakusten duen froga ona."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour414.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.14 tour"
msgstr "Xfce 4.14 bisita gidatua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.14. It only "
"covers improvements made on the surface; for the full list of changes, see "
"the [changelogs](/download/changelogs/)."
msgstr ""
"Bisita gidatu honek Xfce 4.14-ren ezaugarri berri nagusiak aurkeztuko "
"dizkizu. Azalean egindako hobekuntzak soilik jasotzen ditu; aldaketen "
"zerrenda osorako, ikusi [aldaketa-logak](/download/changelogs/)."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:9 content/about/tour416.md:17
#: content/about/tour418.md:53
msgid "Settings Manager *(xfce4-settings)*"
msgstr "Ezarpen-kudeatzailea *(xfce4-settings)*"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:11
msgid "Color Profiles Dialog"
msgstr "Kolore-profilen elkarrizketa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:13
msgid ""
"A new dialog for setting [color "
"profiles](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/4.14/color) for "
"monitors, printers and scanners was introduced. It acts as a frontend to "
"various daemons that talk directly to colord, e.g. saned (scanners), cupsd "
"(printers) or xiccd (monitors)."
msgstr ""
"Monitore, inprimagailu eta eskanerren [kolore-"
"profilak](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/4.14/color) ezartzeko "
"elkarrizketa berri bat sartu da. colord-ekin zuzenean komunikatzen diren "
"hainbat daemonen interfaze gisa jarduten du, adibidez saned (eskanerrak), "
"cupsd (inprimagailuak) edo xiccd (monitoreak)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:15
msgid "![The new color profiles dialog][img-color-profiles]"
msgstr "![Kolore-profilen elkarrizketa berria][img-color-profiles]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:17 content/about/tour416.md:29
msgid "Display Dialog"
msgstr "Pantailaren elkarrizketa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:19
msgid ""
"Several improvements were made to the [display "
"dialog](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/4.14/display). Apart from "
"tweaks to the user interface to make the interaction more intuitive "
"(introducing display numbering, showing a primary indicator with quick "
"access to panel, notification and desktop settings etc.) a feature to save "
"and restore complete display profiles was added. If a single profile exists "
"for a setup, the Xfce settings daemon will automatically enable it. If "
"multiple profiles exist, it will pop up the minimal dialog and offer all "
"profiles in addition to the previously available pre-sets (internal only, "
"mirror, extend and external only)."
msgstr ""
"[Pantailaren "
"elkarrizketan](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/4.14/display) "
"hainbat hobekuntza egin dira. Elkarreragina intuitiboagoa egiteko "
"erabiltzaile-interfazean egindako doikuntzez gain (pantailen zenbaketa, eta "
"panelaren, jakinarazpenen eta mahaigainaren ezarpenetarako sarbide azkarra "
"duen pantaila nagusiaren adierazlea, etab.), pantaila-profil osoak gorde eta"
" leheneratzeko ezaugarri bat gehitu da. Konfigurazio baterako profil bakarra"
" badago, Xfce-ren ezarpen-daemonak automatikoki gaituko du. Profil anitz "
"badaude, elkarrizketa minimoa agertuko da eta profil guztiak eskainiko ditu,"
" lehendik zeuden aurrezarpenez gain (barnekoa soilik, ispilua, hedatu eta "
"kanpokoa soilik)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:21
msgid "![The primary indicator][img-display-general]"
msgstr "![Pantaila nagusiaren adierazlea][img-display-general]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:23
msgid "![The display profile list][img-display-advanced]"
msgstr "![Pantaila-profilen zerrenda][img-display-advanced]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:25
msgid ""
"![The improved minimal dialog - in this case only showing one profile only "
"which never happens anymore now ;)][img-display-minimal]"
msgstr ""
"![Elkarrizketa minimo hobetua; kasu honetan profil bakarra erakusten du, eta"
" hori orain ez da inoiz gertatzen ;)][img-display-minimal]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:27
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Irisgarritasuna"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:29
msgid ""
"One "
"[accessibility](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/4.14/accessibility)"
" feature that people coming from other desktop environments or operating "
"systems were still missing is to set a (custom) keyboard shortcut (by "
"default: Super+F1) to visually locate the mouse pointer. This feature was "
"added in Xfce 4.14."
msgstr ""
"Beste mahaigain-ingurune edo sistema eragile batzuetatik datozenek oraindik "
"faltan zuten "
"[irisgarritasun](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/4.14/accessibility)"
" ezaugarri bat zen saguaren erakuslea bisualki aurkitzeko laster-tekla "
"(pertsonalizatu) bat ezartzea (lehenespenez: Super+F1). Ezaugarri hau Xfce "
"4.14an gehitu da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:31
msgid "![The mouse pointer location animation][img-locate-mouse]"
msgstr "![Saguaren erakuslearen kokapenaren animazioa][img-locate-mouse]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:35
msgid "General: Icon size"
msgstr "Orokorra: ikono-tamaina"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:37
msgid ""
"A new feature that we introduced in the "
"[panel](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/4.14/start) is being able to "
"control the icon size of all plugins. ('All' may not be technically correct,"
" as not all plugins support the new API as of now, but now they *can*. Plus "
"the Window buttons plugin is an exception, because libwnck doesn't allow "
"anything other than 16px or 32px.) This means setups that were previously "
"impossible, because icons would upscale automatically according to size-"
"steps hard-coded in the panel, are now possible (see below)."
msgstr ""
"[Panelean](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/4.14/start) sartu dugun "
"ezaugarri berri bat plugin guztien ikono-tamaina kontrolatzeko aukera da. "
"('Guztiak' agian ez da teknikoki zuzena, plugin guztiek ez baitute oraindik "
"API berria onartzen, baina orain *onar dezakete*. Gainera, Leiho-botoien "
"plugina salbuespena da, libwnck-ek ez duelako 16px edo 32px ez den beste "
"ezer onartzen.) Horrek esan nahi du lehen ezinezkoak ziren konfigurazioak "
"(ikonoak panelean finkatutako tamaina-urratsen arabera automatikoki "
"handitzen zirelako) orain posible direla (ikusi behean)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:39
msgid "![A 32px tall panel with 16px icons][img-panel-iconsize]"
msgstr "![32px-ko altuerako panela, 16px-ko ikonoekin][img-panel-iconsize]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:41
msgid "Window buttons: Grouping"
msgstr "Leiho-botoiak: taldekatzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:43
msgid ""
"Grouping was improved in the [Window buttons "
"plugin](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/4.14/tasklist), both "
"functionally (by improving the matching and icon-finding) and visually by "
"providing a new group indicator that is less likely to clash with window "
"titles containing an enumeration in brackets."
msgstr ""
"Taldekatzea hobetu da [Leiho-botoien "
"pluginean](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/4.14/tasklist), bai "
"funtzionalki (bat-etortzea eta ikonoen bilaketa hobetuz) bai bisualki, "
"taldeen adierazle berri bat emanez, kortxete artean zenbaketa duten leiho-"
"tituluekin nahasteko arrisku txikiagoa duena."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:45
msgid "![The new group indicator (two terminal windows)][img-panel-group]"
msgstr "![Taldeen adierazle berria (bi terminal-leiho)][img-panel-group]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:47
msgid "Session *(xfce4-session)*"
msgstr "Saioa *(xfce4-session)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:51
msgid ""
"As soon as a "
"[session](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/4.14/preferences) has "
"been saved a new tab is dynamically added to the settings dialog displaying "
"all saved sessions and allowing to delete one or all of them. This should "
"make it way more discoverable for users if they actually have saved sessions"
" that influence the startup behavior - previously this had to be checked "
"manually in the filesystem."
msgstr ""
"[Saio](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/4.14/preferences) bat gorde "
"bezain laster, fitxa berri bat gehitzen zaio dinamikoki ezarpen-"
"elkarrizketari; gordetako saio guztiak erakusten ditu, eta bat edo guztiak "
"ezabatzeko aukera ematen du. Horrela, askoz errazagoa izango da "
"erabiltzaileentzat abioaren portaeran eragiten duten gordetako saiorik duten"
" jakitea; lehen, fitxategi-sisteman eskuz egiaztatu behar zen."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:53
msgid "![The settings dialog after saving a session][img-session-saved]"
msgstr "![Ezarpen-elkarrizketa saio bat gorde ondoren][img-session-saved]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:57
msgid "Pathbar"
msgstr "Bide-barra"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:59
msgid ""
"Up to Xfce 4.12 [Thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/4.14/start) "
"offered two options for the pathbar/locationbar. The best of both worlds has"
" now been mixed into one powerful pathbar, featuring both clickable "
"breadcrumbs (i.e. folders), an easily accessible way to hand-type a path as "
"well as an improved look."
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.12 arte, [Thunar-ek](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/4.14/start) bi"
" aukera eskaintzen zituen bide-barra/kokapen-barrarako. Bi munduetako onena "
"bide-barra indartsu bakar batean nahastu da orain: ogi-apur klikagarriak "
"(hau da, karpetak), bide bat eskuz idazteko modu erraz bat eta itxura "
"hobetua ditu."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:61
msgid "![Thunar's new pathbar][img-thunar-pathbar]"
msgstr "![Thunar-en bide-barra berria][img-thunar-pathbar]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:63
msgid "Folder Thumbnailer"
msgstr "Karpeten koadro txikien sorgailua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:65
msgid ""
"Same as on the Desktop you can now save an image with the name 'folder.jpg' "
"in a folder and get it displayed as its icon in the File Manager. Note: "
"[Please read the "
"docs](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/tumbler/available_plugins#customized_thumbnailer_for_folders)"
" on how to set this up (if your distribution hasn't enabled it by default)."
msgstr ""
"Mahaigainean bezala, orain 'folder.jpg' izeneko irudi bat gorde dezakezu "
"karpeta batean, eta fitxategi-kudeatzailean karpetaren ikono gisa "
"bistaratuko da. Oharra: [irakurri "
"dokumentazioa](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/tumbler/available_plugins#customized_thumbnailer_for_folders)"
" hau nola konfiguratu jakiteko (zure banaketak lehenespenez gaitu ez badu)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:67
msgid "![Thunar's new folder thumbnails][img-thunar-folder-jpg]"
msgstr "![Thunar-en karpeten koadro txiki berriak][img-thunar-folder-jpg]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:73
msgid ""
"The [Power Manager's panel plugin](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-"
"manager/4.14/panel-plugin) supports symbolic icons now and uses the standard"
" UPower icon names (making it more compatible with all icon themes). It also"
" shows an indicator if applications inhibit power management functions like "
"suspend (when power is low) or display dimming (after a defined timeout)."
msgstr ""
"[Energia-kudeatzailearen panel-"
"pluginak](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-manager/4.14/panel-plugin) "
"ikono sinbolikoak onartzen ditu orain, eta UPower-en ikono-izen estandarrak "
"erabiltzen ditu (ikono-gai guztiekin bateragarriagoa izan dadin). Gainera, "
"adierazle bat erakusten du aplikazioek energia-kudeaketaren funtzioak "
"inhibitzen badituzte, hala nola etetea (energia gutxi dagoenean) edo "
"pantaila iluntzea (denbora-muga jakin baten ondoren)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:75
msgid ""
"![Parole's video playback is inhibiting power management][img-xfpm-"
"inhibitors]"
msgstr ""
"![Parole-ren bideo-erreprodukzioa energia-kudeaketa inhibitzen ari da][img-"
"xfpm-inhibitors]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:77
msgid "Notification Service *(xfce4-notifyd)*"
msgstr "Jakinarazpen-zerbitzua *(xfce4-notifyd)*"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:79 content/about/tour44.md:123
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Ezarpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:81
msgid ""
"Several new features have been added in Xfce's [Notification "
"service](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/notifyd/start), including a "
"notifications log, the possibility to disable notifications per application,"
" a global 'Do Not Disturb' mode, which inhibits all notifications, and "
"finally a new animation ('slide out')."
msgstr ""
"Hainbat ezaugarri berri gehitu dira Xfce-ren [Jakinarazpen-"
"zerbitzuan](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/notifyd/start), besteak beste "
"jakinarazpenen erregistroa, aplikazio bakoitzeko jakinarazpenak desgaitzeko "
"aukera, 'Ez molestatu' modu orokorra (jakinarazpen guztiak inhibitzen "
"dituena) eta, azkenik, animazio berri bat ('irristatu kanpora')."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:83
msgid "![The new notification animation 'slide out'][img-notifyd-slideout]"
msgstr ""
"![Jakinarazpenen animazio berria 'irristatu kanpora'][img-notifyd-slideout]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:87
msgid ""
"Furthermore a new panel plugin was added which provides quick access to both"
" the 'Do Not Disturb' mode as well as the log of recent notifications."
msgstr ""
"Gainera, panel-plugin berri bat gehitu da, 'Ez molestatu' modurako eta azken"
" jakinarazpenen erregistrorako sarbide azkarra eskaintzen duena."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:89
msgid "![The new panel plugin][img-notifyd-panel]"
msgstr "![Panel-plugin berria][img-notifyd-panel]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:93
msgid "Mini Mode"
msgstr "Mini modua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:95
msgid ""
"[Parole](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/parole/start) now features a 'Mini "
"Mode', where the interface is simplified to just display the album artwork "
"and can be positioned over other windows without getting in the way."
msgstr ""
"[Parole-k](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/parole/start) 'Mini modua' du orain: "
"interfazea sinplifikatu egiten da albumaren azala soilik erakusteko, eta "
"beste leihoen gainean jar daiteke traba egin gabe."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:97
msgid ""
"![Just right-click anywhere in the player window to select 'Mini "
"Mode'...][img-parole-normal-mode]"
msgstr ""
"![Egin eskuineko klik erreproduzitzailearen leihoko edozein lekutan 'Mini "
"modua' hautatzeko...][img-parole-normal-mode]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:99
msgid ""
"![Afterwards, enjoy a truly minimalistic playback experience!][img-parole-"
"mini-mode]"
msgstr ""
"![Ondoren, gozatu erreprodukzio-esperientzia benetan minimalista "
"batez!][img-parole-mini-mode]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:101
msgid "Screensaver *(xfce4-screensaver)*"
msgstr "Pantaila-babeslea *(xfce4-screensaver)*"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:103
msgid "A Modern Locking Experience"
msgstr "Blokeatze-esperientzia modernoa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:105
msgid ""
"The new Xfce [Screensaver](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screensaver/start) "
"provides a configurable lockscreen experience. You can selectively toggle "
"the lock screen and screensaver, and all Xscreensaver themes are supported "
"(with configuration options) out of the box. If you prefer a blank screen, "
"Xfce Screensaver also includes a blank screen option with DPMS integration."
msgstr ""
"Xfce-ren [Pantaila-babesle](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screensaver/start) "
"berriak blokeo-pantaila konfiguragarria eskaintzen du. Blokeo-pantaila eta "
"pantaila-babeslea bereizita aktiba ditzakezu, eta Xscreensaver-en gai "
"guztiak berez onartzen dira (konfigurazio-aukerekin). Pantaila beltza "
"nahiago baduzu, Xfce Screensaver-ek pantaila beltzaren aukera ere badu, DPMS"
" integrazioarekin."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:107
msgid ""
"![The new lock screen, sharing styles with LightDM GTK+ Greeter for a "
"consistent experience.][img-saver-dialog]"
msgstr ""
"![Blokeo-pantaila berria, LightDM GTK+ Greeter-ekin estiloak partekatzen "
"dituena esperientzia koherentea izateko.][img-saver-dialog]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:109
msgid ""
"![Make it your own. Xfce Screensaver supports a multitude of configuration "
"options.][img-saver-preferences]"
msgstr ""
"![Egin zeurea. Xfce Screensaver-ek konfigurazio-aukera ugari onartzen "
"ditu.][img-saver-preferences]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:111
msgid "Terminal *(xfce4-terminal)*"
msgstr "Terminala *(xfce4-terminal)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:113
msgid ""
"Lots and lots of features have accumulated in the "
"[Terminal](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/terminal/start) over the last years. "
"Amongst them 'Undo Close Tab' and 'Close Other Tabs' functionality (similar "
"to web browsers), 'Copy Input to All Tabs', 'Set Title Color' (allows to "
"customize tab text color), 'Save Contents' (saves tab contents to a file), "
"an 'Unsafe Paste' dialog (which prevents the terminal from auto-executing "
"pasted text as a command) and support for zooming. Finally when closing a "
"tab or window, there is a new check for running processes which prevents "
"accidentally closing a terminal that is running a process."
msgstr ""
"Azken urteotan ezaugarri piloa metatu dira "
"[Terminalean](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/terminal/start). Horien artean "
"daude 'Desegin fitxa ixtea' eta 'Itxi beste fitxak' funtzioak (web-"
"nabigatzaileen antzekoak), 'Kopiatu sarrera fitxa guztietara', 'Ezarri "
"tituluaren kolorea' (fitxaren testuaren kolorea pertsonalizatzeko), 'Gorde "
"edukia' (fitxaren edukia fitxategi batean gordetzen du), 'Itsaste ez-"
"segurua' elkarrizketa (terminalak itsatsitako testua komando gisa "
"automatikoki exekutatzea saihesten du) eta zoomaren euskarria. Azkenik, "
"fitxa edo leiho bat ixtean, exekutatzen ari diren prozesuen egiaztapen berri"
" bat dago, prozesu bat exekutatzen ari den terminal bat nahi gabe ixtea "
"saihesteko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:115
msgid "![Zooming, 'Save Contents' and much more!][img-terminal]"
msgstr "![Zooma, 'Gorde edukia' eta askoz gehiago!][img-terminal]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:117
msgid "Screenshooter *(xfce4-screenshooter)*"
msgstr "Pantaila-argazkien tresna *(xfce4-screenshooter)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:119
msgid ""
"The Xfce [Screenshooter](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screenshooter/start) "
"gained several notable features, amongst others seeing the size of the "
"screenshot while dragging, moving the selection with the mouse and better "
"[imgur](https://imgur.com) integration."
msgstr ""
"Xfce-ren [Pantaila-argazkien "
"tresnak](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screenshooter/start) hainbat ezaugarri "
"nabarmen ditu, besteak beste pantaila-argazkiaren tamaina ikustea "
"arrastatzen den bitartean, hautapena saguarekin mugitzea eta "
"[imgur](https://imgur.com) integrazio hobea."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:121
msgid ""
"![I can drag and move the screenshot area, whoop whoop!][img-screenshooter]"
msgstr ""
"![Pantaila-argazkiaren area arrastatu eta mugi dezaket, ieup!][img-"
"screenshooter]"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour416.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.16 tour"
msgstr "Xfce 4.16 bisita gidatua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.16. It only "
"covers improvements made on the (user-visible) surface; for the full list of"
" changes, see the [changelog](/download/changelogs/4.16/)."
msgstr ""
"Bisita gidatu honek Xfce 4.16-ren ezaugarri berri nagusiak aurkeztuko "
"dizkizu. Azalean (erabiltzaileak ikus dezakeen aldean) egindako hobekuntzak "
"soilik jasotzen ditu; aldaketen zerrenda osorako, ikusi [aldaketa-"
"loga](/download/changelogs/4.16/)."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour416.md:9
msgid "Visual identity: New icons and palette"
msgstr "Identitate bisuala: ikono eta paleta berriak"

#: content/about/tour416.md:11
msgid ""
"In order to make Xfce shine a little more out of the box and to strengthen "
"its visual identity we created new icons for all of our core applications "
"and based them on a shared palette to ensure consistency. We also set some "
"further (implicit) design constraints, loosely following "
"[Adwaita](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adwaita_(design_language))'s "
"principles."
msgstr ""
"Xfce-k berez pixka bat gehiago distira dezan eta bere identitate bisuala "
"indartzeko, ikono berriak sortu ditugu gure oinarrizko aplikazio "
"guztietarako, eta paleta partekatu batean oinarritu ditugu koherentzia "
"bermatzeko. Diseinu-murriztapen (inplizitu) gehiago ere ezarri ditugu, "
"[Adwaita](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adwaita_(design_language))-ren "
"printzipioak gutxi gorabehera jarraituz."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:13
msgid "![The Xfce palette][img-palette]"
msgstr "![Xfce-ren paleta][img-palette]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:15
msgid ""
"![New upstream Xfce icons, coming in many sizes for sharp appearance][img-"
"upstream-icons]"
msgstr ""
"![Xfce-ren ikono ofizial berriak, tamaina askotan, itxura zorrotza "
"izateko][img-upstream-icons]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:19
msgid ""
"The Settings Manager itself received a visual refresh of its filter box, "
"which can now be hidden permanently. At the same time the search "
"capabilities of the filter box were improved by searching the descriptive "
"'Comments' part of each dialog's launcher (aka "
"[.desktop](https://specifications.freedesktop.org/desktop-entry-"
"spec/desktop-entry-spec-latest.html)) file."
msgstr ""
"Ezarpen-kudeatzaileak berak bere iragazki-koadroaren itxura berritua jaso "
"du, eta orain betiko ezkuta daiteke. Aldi berean, iragazki-koadroaren "
"bilaketa-gaitasunak hobetu dira, elkarrizketa bakoitzaren abiarazle-"
"fitxategiko ([.desktop](https://specifications.freedesktop.org/desktop-"
"entry-spec/desktop-entry-spec-latest.html)) 'Comments' zati deskribatzailean"
" ere bilatuz."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:21
msgid "![Visually cleaner, more powerful filter box][img-settings-manager]"
msgstr ""
"![Iragazki-koadro garbiagoa bisualki eta indartsuagoa][img-settings-manager]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour416.md:23 content/about/tour418.md:163
msgid "Default Applications"
msgstr "Aplikazio lehenetsiak"

#: content/about/tour416.md:25
msgid ""
"This new dialog represents a merger between the previously available 'MIME "
"Type Editor' and the 'Preferred Applications' dialogs. Consolidating both in"
" one place means users have an easier time setting default applications to "
"handle certain file types."
msgstr ""
"Elkarrizketa berri hau lehen eskuragarri zeuden 'MIME moten editorea' eta "
"'Aplikazio hobetsiak' elkarrizketen bateratzea da. Biak leku bakar batean "
"biltzeak esan nahi du erabiltzaileek errazago ezar ditzaketela fitxategi "
"mota jakin batzuk kudeatzeko aplikazio lehenetsiak."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:27
msgid "![The new Default Applications dialog][img-default-applications]"
msgstr ""
"![Aplikazio lehenetsien elkarrizketa berria][img-default-applications]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:31
msgid ""
"To better support high-density displays - which come in various sizes and "
"densities - we added fractional scaling based on the RandR extension of X11."
" Furthermore the preferred mode of a display is now marked with an asterisk "
"and aspect ratios are shown along display resolutions."
msgstr ""
"Dentsitate handiko pantailak (tamaina eta dentsitate askotakoak) hobeto "
"onartzeko, X11-ren RandR hedapenean oinarritutako eskalatze zatikia gehitu "
"dugu. Gainera, pantaila baten modu hobetsia izartxo batez markatzen da "
"orain, eta aspektu-erlazioak bereizmenen ondoan erakusten dira."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:33
msgid "![Fractional scaling support][img-display-dialog]"
msgstr "![Eskalatze zatikiaren euskarria][img-display-dialog]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour416.md:35
msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "Laster-teklak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:37
msgid ""
"In order to make things easier for our users we added more default keyboard "
"shortcuts out of the box, for instance for window tiling or to open Thunar. "
"The keyboard shortcuts dialog itself was also visually updated."
msgstr ""
"Gure erabiltzaileei gauzak errazteko, laster-tekla lehenetsi gehiago gehitu "
"ditugu, adibidez leihoak lauzatzeko edo Thunar irekitzeko. Laster-teklen "
"elkarrizketak berak ere itxura eguneratua du."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:39
msgid "![Visually updated keyboard shortcuts dialog][img-keyboard-shortcuts]"
msgstr ""
"![Itxura eguneratua duen laster-teklen elkarrizketa][img-keyboard-shortcuts]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:43
msgid ""
"In Thunar's copy and move dialogs users can now easily pause the respective "
"file operation. Furthermore support for queued file transfer, remembering "
"view settings per folder and support for transparency in Gtk themes was "
"added."
msgstr ""
"Thunar-en kopiatze- eta lekualdatze-elkarrizketetan, erabiltzaileek erraz "
"pausa dezakete dagokion fitxategi-eragiketa. Gainera, fitxategi-"
"transferentziak ilaran jartzeko euskarria, karpeta bakoitzeko ikuspegi-"
"ezarpenak gogoratzea eta Gtk gaietako gardentasunerako euskarria gehitu "
"dira."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:45
msgid "![Thunar can now pause copying/moving files][img-thunar-copy]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar-ek orain fitxategiak kopiatzea/lekualdatzea pausa dezake][img-"
"thunar-copy]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:49
msgid ""
"The panel received quite a few noteworthy updates, an animation for autohide"
" and intellihide, a new 'Status Tray' plugin that combines both legacy "
"Systray item support with modern StatusNotifier item support, dark mode "
"support, launchers showing additional actions on right-click, window buttons"
" offering to 'Launch a new instance...' and much more."
msgstr ""
"Panelak eguneraketa nabarmen dezente jaso ditu: animazio bat automatikoki "
"ezkutatzeko eta ezkutatze adimentsurako, 'Egoera-erretilua' plugin berria "
"(Systray elementu zaharren euskarria eta StatusNotifier elementu modernoen "
"euskarria batzen dituena), modu ilunaren euskarria, eskuineko klikarekin "
"ekintza gehigarriak erakusten dituzten abiarazleak, 'Abiarazi instantzia "
"berri bat...' eskaintzen duten leiho-botoiak eta askoz gehiago."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:51
msgid "![Dark mode enabled in the panel's settings dialog][img-panel-dark]"
msgstr "![Modu iluna gaituta panelaren ezarpen-elkarrizketan][img-panel-dark]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:53
msgid "![The new statustray plugin][img-panel-statustray]"
msgstr "![Statustray plugin berria][img-panel-statustray]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:55
msgid "![Autohide animation][img-panel-autohide]"
msgstr "![Automatikoki ezkutatzeko animazioa][img-panel-autohide]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:57
msgid "![Launch a new instance!][img-panel-launch]"
msgstr "![Abiarazi instantzia berri bat!][img-panel-launch]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour416.md:59
msgid "About Dialog *(xfce4-about)*"
msgstr "Honi buruz elkarrizketa *(xfce4-about)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:61
msgid ""
"Not only was the Xfce tab reworked to be more visually appealing and easily "
"parsable, a separate tab showing basic information about the user's system "
"was also added."
msgstr ""
"Xfce fitxa berrantolatu da bisualki erakargarriagoa eta errazago "
"irakurtzekoa izan dadin, eta horrez gain, erabiltzailearen sistemari buruzko"
" oinarrizko informazioa erakusten duen fitxa bereizi bat gehitu da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:63
msgid "![About Xfce][img-about-xfce]"
msgstr "![Xfce-ri buruz][img-about-xfce]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:65
msgid "![About System][img-about-system]"
msgstr "![Sistemari buruz][img-about-system]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:69
msgid ""
"The settings dialog of the power manager was cleaned up and shows either 'on"
" battery' or 'plugged in' settings as opposed to both in a huge table."
msgstr ""
"Energia-kudeatzailearen ezarpen-elkarrizketa garbitu egin da, eta "
"'bateriarekin' edo 'entxufatuta' ezarpenak erakusten ditu, bi aukerak taula "
"erraldoi batean erakutsi beharrean."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:71
msgid "![Power Manager settings][img-powermanager]"
msgstr "![Energia-kudeatzailearen ezarpenak][img-powermanager]"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour418.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.18 tour"
msgstr "Xfce 4.18 bisita gidatua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.18. It only "
"covers improvements made on the (user-visible) surface."
msgstr ""
"Bisita gidatu honek Xfce 4.18-ren ezaugarri berri nagusiak aurkeztuko "
"dizkizu. Azalean (erabiltzaileak ikus dezakeen aldean) egindako hobekuntzak "
"soilik jasotzen ditu."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:9
msgid ""
"Check the full [Xfce 4.18 changelog](/download/changelogs/4.18/) for a "
"detailed list of changes."
msgstr ""
"Kontsultatu [Xfce 4.18-ren aldaketa-log osoa](/download/changelogs/4.18/) "
"aldaketen zerrenda zehatza ikusteko."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour418.md:11
msgid "Widget Library *(libxfce4ui)*"
msgstr "Trepeten liburutegia *(libxfce4ui)*"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:13
msgid "Filename Input Dialog"
msgstr "Fitxategi-izena sartzeko elkarrizketa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:15
msgid ""
"XfceFilenameInput is a comfortable widget for filename input, which was "
"added in order to prevent invalid filenames at an early stage and to give "
"detailed feedback on the concrete problem."
msgstr ""
"XfceFilenameInput fitxategi-izenak sartzeko trepeta erosoa da; fitxategi-"
"izen baliogabeak hasieratik saihesteko eta arazo zehatzari buruzko "
"informazio xehea emateko gehitu da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:17
msgid ""
"![XfceFilenameInput - trailing whitespaces][img-xfce4ui-new-file-dialog1]"
msgstr ""
"![XfceFilenameInput - amaierako zuriuneak][img-xfce4ui-new-file-dialog1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:19
msgid "![XfceFilenameInput - slash][img-xfce4ui-new-file-dialog2]"
msgstr "![XfceFilenameInput - barra][img-xfce4ui-new-file-dialog2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:21
msgid "Generic Shortcut Editor"
msgstr "Laster-teklen editore generikoa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:23
msgid ""
"This widget is a shortcut editor which was introduced in order to have a "
"graphical interface to modify component-specific shortcuts. Currently, it is"
" only used inside Thunar, Xfce4-terminal and Mousepad, though other "
"components might follow."
msgstr ""
"Trepeta hau laster-teklen editore bat da, osagai bakoitzaren laster-teklak "
"aldatzeko interfaze grafiko bat izateko sartua. Gaur egun Thunar, "
"Xfce4-terminal eta Mousepad-en barruan bakarrik erabiltzen da, baina beste "
"osagai batzuek ere jarrai dezakete."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:25
msgid "![XfceShortcutsEditor in Thunar][img-xfce4ui-shortcuts-editor]"
msgstr "![XfceShortcutsEditor Thunar-en][img-xfce4ui-shortcuts-editor]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour418.md:27
msgid "Thumbnail Service *(tumbler)*"
msgstr "Koadro txikien zerbitzua *(tumbler)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:29
msgid ""
"Some performance improvements for the pixbuf-thumbnailer and the scheduler "
"were done. As well now there are multiple overwrite options for the desktop-"
"thumbnailer."
msgstr ""
"pixbuf-thumbnailer eta antolatzailearen errendimenduan zenbait hobekuntza "
"egin dira. Gainera, desktop-thumbnailer-ek gainidazteko aukera anitz ditu "
"orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:31
msgid ""
"There is now support for the thumbnail sizes x-large and xx-large, which are"
" very useful for high resolution displays."
msgstr ""
"Orain x-large eta xx-large koadro txikien tamainak onartzen dira, oso "
"erabilgarriak bereizmen handiko pantailetarako."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:33
msgid ""
"Tumbler and Thunar now support shared thumbnail repositories, like described"
" in the freedesktop.org thumbnail specification. This feature can be used to"
" produce thumbnails for a folder in advance, directly located near the "
"pictures. Like that, the thumbnails don't need to be re-generated for each "
"individual user."
msgstr ""
"Tumbler-ek eta Thunar-ek koadro txikien biltegi partekatuak onartzen dituzte"
" orain, freedesktop.org-en koadro txikien zehaztapenean deskribatzen den "
"bezala. Ezaugarri hau karpeta baterako koadro txikiak aldez aurretik "
"sortzeko erabil daiteke, irudien ondoan bertan kokatuta. Horrela, koadro "
"txikiak ez dira erabiltzaile bakoitzarentzat berriro sortu behar."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:35
msgid ""
"For more information on shared thumbnails, check the [related blog "
"post](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog03.html)."
msgstr ""
"Koadro txiki partekatuei buruzko informazio gehiagorako, ikusi [lotutako "
"blog-sarrera](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog03.html)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:39
msgid ""
"The DateTime and the Clock plugins provided overlapping functionality. In "
"order to prevent parallel development, they have been merged into a single "
"plugin."
msgstr ""
"DateTime eta Clock pluginek funtzionaltasun gainjarria eskaintzen zuten. "
"Garapen paraleloa saihesteko, plugin bakar batean bateratu dira."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:41
msgid "![The new 'Clock' panel widget][img-panel-clock1]"
msgstr "![Paneleko 'Erlojua' trepeta berria][img-panel-clock1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:43
msgid ""
"The new Clock plugin received a new binary time mode now and provides a "
"sleep monitor. Here's a screenshot of all possible layouts which are: "
"Analog, Binary, Digital, Fuzzy and LCD."
msgstr ""
"Erlojuaren plugin berriak denbora bitarrean erakusteko modu berri bat du "
"orain, eta lo-monitore bat eskaintzen du. Hona hemen diseinu posible guztien"
" pantaila-argazkia: analogikoa, bitarra, digitala, lausoa eta LCD."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:45
msgid "![All possible Clock Modes][img-panel-clock2]"
msgstr "![Erlojuaren modu posible guztiak][img-panel-clock2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:49
msgid ""
"Like in Thunar, the 'Delete' menu entry in the context menu can now be "
"hidden."
msgstr ""
"Thunar-en bezala, laster-menuko 'Ezabatu' sarrera ezkuta daiteke orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:51
msgid ""
"In order to don't mess the desktop by accident on pressing 'rearrange "
"desktop icons', the user is asked for confirmation now."
msgstr ""
"'Berrantolatu mahaigaineko ikonoak' sakatzean mahaigaina nahi gabe ez "
"nahasteko, berrespena eskatzen zaio orain erabiltzaileari."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:55
msgid ""
"The search entry for xfce4-settings-manager was a bit simplified. Now it "
"will always be shown, without any slider or button."
msgstr ""
"xfce4-settings-manager-en bilaketa-sarrera apur bat sinplifikatu da. Orain "
"beti erakutsiko da, irristagailu edo botoirik gabe."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:57
msgid ""
"![xfce4-settings-manager - the search entry is always shown][img-settings-"
"main-dialog]"
msgstr ""
"![xfce4-settings-manager - bilaketa-sarrera beti erakusten da][img-settings-"
"main-dialog]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:61
msgid ""
"xfce4-display-settings got some minor improvements and the possibility to "
"decide what to do when new displays are connected."
msgstr ""
"xfce4-display-settings-ek hobekuntza txiki batzuk jaso ditu, baita pantaila "
"berriak konektatzean zer egin erabakitzeko aukera ere."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:63
msgid "![xfce4-display-settings - minor improvements][img-settings-display]"
msgstr "![xfce4-display-settings - hobekuntza txikiak][img-settings-display]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:67
msgid ""
"On selecting a new theme, there is now the option to automatically set a "
"matching xfwm4 theme, if available."
msgstr ""
"Gai berri bat hautatzean, bat datorren xfwm4 gai bat automatikoki ezartzeko "
"aukera dago orain, eskuragarri badago."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:69
msgid ""
"![xfce4-appearance-settings - toggle to set matching Xfwm4 theme][img-"
"settings-appearance]"
msgstr ""
"![xfce4-appearance-settings - bat datorren Xfwm4 gaia ezartzeko "
"etengailua][img-settings-appearance]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:73 content/about/tour420.md:171
msgid "List View"
msgstr "Zerrenda-ikuspegia"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:75
msgid ""
"For directories, the count of containing files can now be displayed in the "
"size column. It is now possible to add a 'file creation date' column, and "
"the 'configure columns' dialog can be opened with a right-click on any "
"column head."
msgstr ""
"Direktorioetan, barneko fitxategien kopurua bistara daiteke orain tamainaren"
" zutabean. Orain 'fitxategiaren sorrera-data' zutabe bat gehi daiteke, eta "
"'konfiguratu zutabeak' elkarrizketa edozein zutabe-goiburutan eskuineko klik"
" eginez ireki daiteke."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:77
msgid "![Thunar - List View - Preferences][img-thunar-listview1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Zerrenda-ikuspegia - Hobespenak][img-thunar-listview1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:79
msgid ""
"![Thunar - List View - File count and file creation date][img-thunar-"
"listview2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Zerrenda-ikuspegia - Fitxategi kopurua eta fitxategiaren sorrera-"
"data][img-thunar-listview2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:81
msgid "Image Preview"
msgstr "Irudien aurrebista"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:83
msgid ""
"Finally, an image preview side pane has been added to Thunar. No, wait, "
"actually two of them! You can choose to either use the 'embedded' mode which"
" will take no extra space, but hide parts of the left side pane. Or you can "
"go for the 'standalone' mode, which will use a separate pane on the right "
"and display as well some basic information."
msgstr ""
"Azkenean, irudien aurrebistarako alboko panel bat gehitu zaio Thunar-i. Ez, "
"itxaron, bi gehitu dira! 'Txertatua' modua erabil dezakezu, leku "
"gehigarririk hartzen ez duena baina ezkerreko alboko panelaren zati bat "
"ezkutatzen duena. Edo 'bereizia' modua aukera dezakezu, eskuinaldean panel "
"bereizi bat erabiltzen duena eta oinarrizko informazio batzuk ere erakusten "
"dituena."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:85
msgid "![Thunar - Embedded Image Preview][img-thunar-preview1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Irudien aurrebista txertatua][img-thunar-preview1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:87
msgid "![Thunar - Standalone Image Preview][img-thunar-preview2]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Irudien aurrebista bereizia][img-thunar-preview2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:89
msgid "Undo and Redo"
msgstr "Desegin eta berregin"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:91
msgid ""
"It is now possible to undo basic file operations and to redo them. Undo and "
"Redo can be used for 'move', 'rename', 'trash', 'link' and 'create' "
"operations. Per default, a history of the last 10 operations is stored, "
"though the history length is configurable. Whenever an Undo/Redo is "
"triggered, a notification with few details will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Orain fitxategien oinarrizko eragiketak desegin eta berregin daitezke. "
"Desegin eta Berregin 'lekualdatu', 'berrizendatu', 'zakarrontzira bota', "
"'estekatu' eta 'sortu' eragiketetarako erabil daitezke. Lehenespenez, azken "
"10 eragiketen historia gordetzen da, baina historiaren luzera konfigura "
"daiteke. Desegin/Berregin bat abiarazten den bakoitzean, xehetasun batzuk "
"dituen jakinarazpen bat erakutsiko da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:93
msgid "![Thunar - Undo and Redo][img-thunar-undo-redo]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Desegin eta berregin][img-thunar-undo-redo]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:95
msgid "File Highlight"
msgstr "Fitxategiak nabarmentzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:97
msgid ""
"Files now can be highlighted by setting the background and the filename to "
"different colors. This can be done via an additional tab, located in the "
"'properties' dialog. The view menu provides a checkbox in order to "
"enable/disable the feature. Once enabled, files now can be shown in all the "
"colors of the rainbow."
msgstr ""
"Orain fitxategiak nabarmen daitezke, atzeko planoari eta fitxategi-izenari "
"kolore desberdinak ezarriz. Hori 'propietateak' elkarrizketako fitxa "
"gehigarri baten bidez egin daiteke. Ikusi menuak kontrol-lauki bat "
"eskaintzen du ezaugarria gaitu/desgaitzeko. Gaituta dagoenean, fitxategiak "
"ostadarraren kolore guztietan erakuts daitezke."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:99
msgid "![Thunar - File Highlight Options][img-thunar-hightlight1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Fitxategiak nabarmentzeko aukerak][img-thunar-hightlight1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:101
msgid "![Thunar - Highlighted files in List View][img-thunar-hightlight2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Nabarmendutako fitxategiak zerrenda-ikuspegian][img-thunar-"
"hightlight2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:103
msgid "![Thunar - Highlighted files in Icon View][img-thunar-hightlight3]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Nabarmendutako fitxategiak ikono-ikuspegian][img-thunar-"
"hightlight3]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:105
msgid ""
"For more information on file highlight, check the [related blog "
"post](https://elessar-space.blogspot.com/2022/08/gsoc22-file-highlighting-"
"in-thunar.html)."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategiak nabarmentzeari buruzko informazio gehiagorako, ikusi [lotutako "
"blog-sarrera](https://elessar-space.blogspot.com/2022/08/gsoc22-file-"
"highlighting-in-thunar.html)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:107 content/about/tour420.md:90
msgid "Toolbar"
msgstr "Tresna-barra"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:109
msgid ""
"It is now possible to customize the toolbar according to your personal "
"needs! An additional dialog has been added for that purpose, on which the "
"visibility and position of specific items can be managed. As well custom "
"actions, which appear for folders can be used in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Orain tresna-barra zure behar pertsonaletara egokitu dezakezu! Horretarako "
"elkarrizketa gehigarri bat gehitu da, non elementu jakinen ikusgaitasuna eta"
" kokapena kudea daitezkeen. Karpetetan agertzen diren ekintza "
"pertsonalizatuak ere erabil daitezke tresna-barran."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:111
msgid ""
"When the menubar is hidden, an additional toolbar button which can be used "
"to show the menu will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Menu-barra ezkutatuta dagoenean, menua erakusteko erabil daitekeen tresna-"
"barrako botoi gehigarri bat bistaratuko da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:113
msgid ""
"![Thunar - Toolbar with all configurable Elements][img-thunar-toolbar1]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Tresna-barra elementu konfiguragarri guztiekin][img-thunar-"
"toolbar1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:115
msgid "![Thunar - Toolbar Configuration Dialog][img-thunar-toolbar2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Tresna-barraren konfigurazio-elkarrizketa][img-thunar-toolbar2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:117
msgid "![Thunar - Show Menubar button][img-thunar-toolbar3]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Erakutsi menu-barra botoia][img-thunar-toolbar3]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:119
msgid ""
"For more information on the configurable toolbar, check the [related blog "
"post](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog10.html)."
msgstr ""
"Tresna-barra konfiguragarriari buruzko informazio gehiagorako, ikusi "
"[lotutako blog-"
"sarrera](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog10.html)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:121 content/about/tour420.md:177
msgid "Split View"
msgstr "Ikuspegi zatitua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:123
msgid ""
"Thunar now provides the option to use split panes. The pane separator can be"
" moved, and its position will be stored. Via a xfconf setting, it is as well"
" possible to have a vertical split."
msgstr ""
"Thunar-ek panel zatituak erabiltzeko aukera eskaintzen du orain. Panelen "
"arteko bereizlea mugi daiteke, eta haren kokapena gorde egingo da. xfconf "
"ezarpen baten bidez, zatiketa bertikala ere izan daiteke."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:125
msgid "![Thunar - Split Panes][img-thunar-splitpanes]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Panel zatituak][img-thunar-splitpanes]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:127 content/about/tour420.md:115
msgid "Statusbar"
msgstr "Egoera-barra"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:129
msgid ""
"The status bar style was tweaked and '|' is now used to separate entries. "
"Furthermore, it is now possible to customize it by using the context menu."
msgstr ""
"Egoera-barraren estiloa doitu da, eta orain '|' erabiltzen da sarrerak "
"bereizteko. Gainera, laster-menua erabiliz pertsonaliza daiteke orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:131
msgid "![Thunar - Statusbar Customization][img-thunar-statusbar]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Egoera-barraren pertsonalizazioa][img-thunar-statusbar]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:133
msgid "Recursive Search"
msgstr "Bilaketa errekurtsiboa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:135
msgid ""
"Thunar has now the possibility to search recursively, directly inside Thunar"
" itself. The search is done in a separate thread and search results are "
"added rapidly into a List View. A new row 'Location' shows where the search "
"results are located, and the context menu provides the option 'Open Item "
"Location' in order to travel there quickly. The preferences dialog provides "
"an option to limit recursive search to local folders, or to disable it."
msgstr ""
"Thunar-ek orain modu errekurtsiboan bilatzeko aukera du, zuzenean Thunar-en "
"barruan. Bilaketa hari bereizi batean egiten da, eta emaitzak azkar gehitzen"
" dira zerrenda-ikuspegi batera. 'Kokapena' errenkada berri batek bilaketaren"
" emaitzak non dauden erakusten du, eta laster-menuak 'Ireki elementuaren "
"kokapena' aukera eskaintzen du hara azkar joateko. Hobespenen elkarrizketak "
"bilaketa errekurtsiboa karpeta lokaletara mugatzeko edo desgaitzeko aukera "
"eskaintzen du."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:137
msgid "![Thunar - Recursive Search][img-thunar-search1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Bilaketa errekurtsiboa][img-thunar-search1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:139
msgid "![Thunar - Recursive Search Preferences][img-thunar-search2]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Bilaketa errekurtsiboaren hobespenak][img-thunar-search2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:141
msgid ""
"For more information on the recursive search feature, check the [related "
"blog post](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog04.html)."
msgstr ""
"Bilaketa errekurtsiboaren ezaugarriari buruzko informazio gehiagorako, ikusi"
" [lotutako blog-"
"sarrera](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog04.html)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:143
msgid "Recently used Files"
msgstr "Azken aldian erabilitako fitxategiak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:145
msgid ""
"Recently used files now can be accessed in the side pane. Like for the "
"'Recursive Search' feature, the new 'Location' row can be used in List View."
" Additionally, for 'Recent' a new row 'Recency' can be added to sort the "
"files by their latest usage."
msgstr ""
"Azken aldian erabilitako fitxategiak alboko panelean atzi daitezke orain. "
"'Bilaketa errekurtsiboa' ezaugarrian bezala, 'Kokapena' errenkada berria "
"erabil daiteke zerrenda-ikuspegian. Gainera, 'Azkenak' atalean 'Berritasuna'"
" errenkada berri bat gehi daiteke, fitxategiak azken erabileraren arabera "
"ordenatzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:147
msgid "![Thunar - Recently Used Files][img-thunar-recent]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Azken aldian erabilitako fitxategiak][img-thunar-recent]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:149
msgid ""
"For more information on 'Recent' in Thunar check the [related blog "
"post](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog02.html)."
msgstr ""
"Thunar-eko 'Azkenak' atalari buruzko informazio gehiagorako, ikusi [lotutako"
" blog-sarrera](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog02.html)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:151
msgid "Bookmark Menu"
msgstr "Laster-marken menua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:153
msgid ""
"In order to keep the 'Go' menu compact, bookmarks have been moved into a "
"separate, new 'Bookmarks' menu. The menu item 'add Bookmark' was rather "
"hidden in the 'send to' menu in Thunar 4.18. As part of the new 'Bookmarks' "
"menu, it is more prominent now."
msgstr ""
"'Joan' menua trinkoa izan dadin, laster-markak 'Laster-markak' menu berri "
"eta bereizi batera eraman dira. 'Gehitu laster-marka' menu-elementua nahiko "
"ezkutatuta zegoen Thunar 4.18-ko 'bidali hona' menuan. 'Laster-markak' menu "
"berriaren parte gisa, nabarmenagoa da orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:155
msgid "![Thunar - Bookmarks Menu][img-thunar-bookmarks]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Laster-marken menua][img-thunar-bookmarks]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:157
msgid "Trash directory"
msgstr "Zakarrontziaren direktorioa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:159
msgid ""
"With the new release, the trash directory provides an info bar which gives "
"easy access to `Empty Trash` and 'Restore' functionality. When using List "
"View, a 'Date Deleted' column will be shown, so that the files can be sorted"
" by deletion date. Via context menu, it is now possible to select 'Restore "
"and Show' in order to automatically open a new tab in the folder of the "
"restored file(s)."
msgstr ""
"Bertsio berriarekin, zakarrontziaren direktorioak informazio-barra bat "
"eskaintzen du, `Hustu zakarrontzia` eta 'Leheneratu' funtzioetarako sarbide "
"erraza ematen duena. Zerrenda-ikuspegia erabiltzean, 'Ezabatze-data' zutabe "
"bat erakutsiko da, fitxategiak ezabatze-dataren arabera ordenatu ahal "
"izateko. Laster-menuaren bidez, orain 'Leheneratu eta erakutsi' hauta "
"daiteke, leheneratutako fitxategien karpetan fitxa berri bat automatikoki "
"irekitzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:161
msgid "![Thunar - Trash Infobar and Date Deleted Column][img-thunar-trash]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Zakarrontziaren informazio-barra eta Ezabatze-data zutabea][img-"
"thunar-trash]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:165
msgid ""
"The management to set/unset default applications for specific mime types was"
" improved. The context menu got a dedicated item 'Set Default Application' "
"which will open the 'ApplicationChooserDialog' with 'use as default' "
"preselected. The dialog now has a section 'Default Application' in order to "
"make clear which default application currently is set. If you want to remove"
" applications from the list, right click it and select 'forget association'."
msgstr ""
"MIME mota jakinetarako aplikazio lehenetsiak ezarri/kentzeko kudeaketa "
"hobetu da. Laster-menuak 'Ezarri aplikazio lehenetsia' elementu berezia du, "
"'ApplicationChooserDialog' elkarrizketa 'erabili lehenetsi gisa' aurrez "
"hautatuta irekitzen duena. Elkarrizketak 'Aplikazio lehenetsia' atal bat du "
"orain, une honetan zein aplikazio lehenetsi dagoen ezarrita argi uzteko. "
"Zerrendatik aplikazioak kendu nahi badituzu, egin eskuineko klik eta hautatu"
" 'ahaztu asoziazioa'."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:167
msgid ""
"![Thunar - Context Menu Entry to set Default Application][img-thunar-"
"default-application1]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Aplikazio lehenetsia ezartzeko laster-menuko sarrera][img-thunar-"
"default-application1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:169
msgid ""
"![Thunar - Revamped Application Chooser Dialog][img-thunar-default-"
"application2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Aplikazio-hautatzailearen elkarrizketa berritua][img-thunar-"
"default-application2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:171 content/about/tour420.md:147
msgid "Custom Actions"
msgstr "Ekintza pertsonalizatuak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:173
msgid ""
"It is now possible to arrange custom actions in cascading submenus. Just "
"enter the same submenu name for a custom action in order to place it into "
"the same menu. If you require multiple menu levels, you can achieve that by "
"using '/' in the path of the 'Submenu' entry."
msgstr ""
"Orain ekintza pertsonalizatuak azpimenu kaskadatan antola daitezke. Sartu "
"azpimenu-izen bera ekintza pertsonalizatu baterako, menu berean jartzeko. "
"Menu-maila anitz behar badituzu, 'Azpimenua' sarreraren bidean '/' erabiliz "
"lor dezakezu."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:175
msgid "![Thunar - Custom Action Submenu][img-thunar-uca-submenu1]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Ekintza pertsonalizatuen azpimenua][img-thunar-uca-submenu1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:177
msgid ""
"![Thunar - Custom Action Configuration Dialog][img-thunar-uca-submenu2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Ekintza pertsonalizatuen konfigurazio-elkarrizketa][img-thunar-"
"uca-submenu2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:179 content/about/tour420.md:227
#: content/about/tour420.md:355
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Hobespenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:181
msgid ""
"The thumbnail settings in the preferences dialog got grouped together, and "
"meanwhile it is possible to limit the file size for which thumbnails should "
"be generated. That should mitigate possible performance issues by preventing"
" thumbnail generation for huge video files."
msgstr ""
"Hobespenen elkarrizketako koadro txikien ezarpenak elkarrekin taldekatu "
"dira, eta orain koadro txikiak sortuko zaizkien fitxategien tamaina muga "
"daiteke. Horrek errendimendu-arazo posibleak arin ditzake, bideo-fitxategi "
"erraldoien koadro txikiak sortzea saihestuz."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:183
msgid "![Thunar - Thumbnail Preferences][img-thunar-preferences1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Koadro txikien hobespenak][img-thunar-preferences1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:185
msgid ""
"File transfer operations optionally can use *.partial~ as an intermediate "
"file now. After a transfer operation, there is now the option to verify the "
"file checksums in order to make sure that no single bit got corrupted. Note "
"that the checksum feature will require some extra time during copy when "
"activated."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategi-transferentziako eragiketek *.partial~ erabil dezakete orain "
"tarteko fitxategi gisa, hala nahi izanez gero. Transferentzia-eragiketa "
"baten ondoren, fitxategien kontrol-baturak egiaztatzeko aukera dago orain, "
"bit bakar bat ere hondatu ez dela ziurtatzeko. Kontuan izan kontrol-baturen "
"ezaugarriak denbora gehigarria beharko duela kopiatzean, aktibatuta "
"dagoenean."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:187
msgid "![Thunar - File Transfer Preferences][img-thunar-preferences2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - Fitxategi-transferentziaren hobespenak][img-thunar-preferences2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:189
msgid ""
"For more information on the new file transfer options, check the [related "
"blog post](https://dev.ikx.kr/GSOC-5th/)."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategi-transferentziako aukera berriei buruzko informazio gehiagorako, "
"ikusi [lotutako blog-sarrera](https://dev.ikx.kr/GSOC-5th/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:191
msgid ""
"A checkbox was added in order to allow running shell scripts. In Thunar 4.18"
" it only was possible to change that behavior by changing a hidden setting. "
"Use that option with caution!"
msgstr ""
"Kontrol-lauki bat gehitu da shell scriptak exekutatzea baimentzeko. Thunar "
"4.18an, portaera hori ezarpen ezkutu bat aldatuz bakarrik alda zitekeen. "
"Erabili aukera hori kontu handiz!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:193
msgid "![Thunar - Script Execution Preferences][img-thunar-preferences3]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Scripten exekuzioaren hobespenak][img-thunar-preferences3]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:195
msgid ""
"There is now the possibility to restore tabs on startup, and to show the "
"full directory path in the tab title."
msgstr ""
"Orain fitxak abioan leheneratzeko aukera dago, baita direktorioaren bide "
"osoa fitxaren tituluan erakustekoa ere."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:197
msgid "![Thunar - Tab and Window Preferences][img-thunar-preferences4]"
msgstr "![Thunar - Fitxen eta leihoen hobespenak][img-thunar-preferences4]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:201
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurazioa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:203
msgid ""
"Application Finder got support for the 'PrefersNonDefaultGPU' property, "
"which is useful for systems with hybrid graphic cards."
msgstr ""
"Aplikazio-bilatzaileak 'PrefersNonDefaultGPU' propietatea onartzen du orain,"
" txartel grafiko hibridoak dituzten sistemetarako erabilgarria."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:205
msgid "Environment variables are now parsed when passed in collapsed mode."
msgstr ""
"Ingurune-aldagaiak orain analizatu egiten dira modu tolestuan pasatzen "
"direnean."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:207
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Itxura"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:209
msgid "An option to hide the window decorations was added."
msgstr "Leiho-apaingarriak ezkutatzeko aukera bat gehitu da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:211
msgid "![xfce4-appfinder without window decorations][img-appfinder]"
msgstr "![xfce4-appfinder leiho-apaingarririk gabe][img-appfinder]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:215
msgid "Workspaces"
msgstr "Laneko areak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:217
msgid "Workspace setting will now work as well with other window managers."
msgstr ""
"Laneko areen ezarpenak beste leiho-kudeatzaile batzuekin ere funtzionatuko "
"du orain."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:219
msgid "Compositor"
msgstr "Konposatzailea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:221
msgid "The compositor now supports adaptive vsync with GLX."
msgstr "Konposatzaileak vsync moldagarria onartzen du orain GLX-ekin."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour418.md:223 content/about/tour420.md:12
#: content/about/tour420.md:205
msgid "General"
msgstr "Orokorra"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:225 content/about/tour420.md:44
msgid "Scaling"
msgstr "Eskalatzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:227
msgid ""
"Improved support for UI scaling and fix for many blurry icons in the core "
"components when scaling is used. This will be particularly useful for Hi DPI"
" screens."
msgstr ""
"Interfazearen eskalatzerako euskarria hobetu da, eta eskalatzea erabiltzean "
"oinarrizko osagaietako ikono lauso asko konpondu dira. Hori bereziki "
"erabilgarria izango da Hi DPI pantailetan."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:229
msgid "Window Header Bars"
msgstr "Leihoen goiburu-barrak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:231
msgid ""
"All header bars of Xfce Windows/Dialogs by default will be drawn by the "
"window manager now (Xfwm4). Some dialogs optionally support 'GtkHeaderBar' "
"(CSD) which can be enabled via a xfconf setting."
msgstr ""
"Xfce-ren leiho/elkarrizketen goiburu-barra guztiak leiho-kudeatzaileak "
"(Xfwm4) marraztuko ditu orain lehenespenez. Elkarrizketa batzuek "
"'GtkHeaderBar' (CSD) onartzen dute aukeran, eta xfconf ezarpen baten bidez "
"gaitu daiteke."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:233
msgid ""
"![xfce-appearance-settings - Preference to enable GtkHeaderBar][img-general-"
"gtkheaderbar]"
msgstr ""
"![xfce-appearance-settings - GtkHeaderBar gaitzeko hobespena][img-general-"
"gtkheaderbar]"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour420.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.20 tour"
msgstr "Xfce 4.20 bisita gidatua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:8
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.20. It only "
"covers improvements made on the (user-visible) surface."
msgstr ""
"Bisita gidatu honek Xfce 4.20-ren ezaugarri berri nagusiak aurkeztuko "
"dizkizu. Azalean (erabiltzaileak ikus dezakeen aldean) egindako hobekuntzak "
"soilik jasotzen ditu."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:10
msgid ""
"Check the full [Xfce 4.20 changelog](/download/changelogs/4.20/) for a "
"detailed list of changes."
msgstr ""
"Kontsultatu [Xfce 4.20-ren aldaketa-log osoa](/download/changelogs/4.20/) "
"aldaketen zerrenda zehatza ikusteko."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:14
msgid "Wayland"
msgstr "Wayland"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:16
msgid ""
"**Important Notice:** Please be aware that the Wayland support in Xfce 4.20 "
"is experimental. It is recommended for advanced users only, as you may "
"encounter bugs and experience incomplete functionality. Proceed with "
"caution!"
msgstr ""
"**Ohar garrantzitsua:** kontuan izan Xfce 4.20-ko Wayland euskarria "
"esperimentala dela. Erabiltzaile aurreratuentzat soilik gomendatzen da, "
"akatsak eta funtzionaltasun osatugabea aurki ditzakezulako. Jardun kontuz!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:18
msgid ""
"Thanks to [Brian](https://gitlab.xfce.org/kelnos) and "
"[Gaël](https://gitlab.xfce.org/Tamaranch) almost all Xfce components are "
"able to run on Wayland windowing, while still keeping support for X11 "
"windowing."
msgstr ""
"[Brian](https://gitlab.xfce.org/kelnos) eta "
"[Gaël](https://gitlab.xfce.org/Tamaranch)-i esker, Xfce-ren ia osagai "
"guztiek Wayland leiho-sisteman exekutatu daitezke, X11 leiho-sistemaren "
"euskarria mantenduz."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:20
msgid ""
"This major effort was achieved by abstracting away any X11/Wayland windowing"
" specific calls and making use of Wayland/Wlroots protocols. A whole new "
"Xfce library, \"libxfce4windowing\" was introduced during that process. "
"XWayland will not be required to run any of the ported Xfce components."
msgstr ""
"Ahalegin handi hori X11/Wayland leiho-sistemen dei espezifiko guztiak "
"abstraituz eta Wayland/Wlroots protokoloak erabiliz lortu da. Prozesu "
"horretan, Xfce liburutegi guztiz berri bat sortu da: \"libxfce4windowing\". "
"Ez da XWayland behar izango Xfce-ren egokitutako osagaiak exekutatzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:22
msgid ""
"So far Xfce does not feature a compositor which supports Wayland. If you "
"want to run Xfce in Wayland, Labwc and Wayfire will give you the best "
"results. A detailed instruction on this can be found "
"[here](https://wiki.xfce.org/releng/wayland_roadmap#testing). Please be "
"aware that Wayland support is still experimental!"
msgstr ""
"Oraingoz, Xfce-k ez du Wayland onartzen duen konposatzailerik. Xfce Wayland-"
"en exekutatu nahi baduzu, Labwc-k eta Wayfire-k emango dizkizute emaitzarik "
"onenak. Horri buruzko argibide zehatzak "
"[hemen](https://wiki.xfce.org/releng/wayland_roadmap#testing) aurki "
"daitezke. Kontuan izan Wayland euskarria esperimentala dela oraindik!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:24
msgid ""
"Plans are underway to add Wayland support to Xfwm4 while preserving its "
"existing X11 functionality. However, such a restructurization will be a "
"major effort and we cannot tell yet when/if it will be done, so please don't"
" hold your breath waiting for it."
msgstr ""
"Xfwm4-ri Wayland euskarria gehitzeko asmoa dago, X11 funtzionaltasuna "
"mantenduz. Hala ere, berregituratze horrek ahalegin handia eskatuko du, eta "
"oraindik ezin dugu esan noiz egingo den (edo egingo den), beraz, ez egon "
"arnasari eutsita zain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:26
msgid ""
"For few components and multiple features, it was not possible to port them "
"to Wayland, partly because there are no standardized Wayland protocols "
"available yet to provide the required services:"
msgstr ""
"Osagai gutxi batzuk eta ezaugarri ugari ezin izan dira Wayland-era eraman, "
"neurri batean oraindik ez dagoelako beharrezko zerbitzuak emateko Wayland "
"protokolo estandarizaturik:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:28
msgid ""
"Workspace support is missing (ext-workspace protocol [was just "
"merged](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wayland/wayland-"
"protocols/-/merge_requests/40))."
msgstr ""
"Laneko areen euskarria falta da (ext-workspace protokoloa [bateratu berri "
"da](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wayland/wayland-"
"protocols/-/merge_requests/40))."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:29
msgid ""
"Systray icons will be missing for multiple applications (required to use "
"StatusNotifier instead of GtkStatusIcon)"
msgstr ""
"Sistemaren erretiluko ikonoak falta izango dira hainbat aplikaziotan "
"(GtkStatusIcon-en ordez StatusNotifier erabiltzea beharrezkoa da)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:30
msgid ""
"Xfce4-settings: Keyboard and mouse settings so far are internal to the "
"Wayland compositor and as such the according Xfce dialogs won't be available"
" on Wayland yet."
msgstr ""
"Xfce4-settings: teklatuaren eta saguaren ezarpenak, oraingoz, Wayland "
"konposatzailearen barnekoak dira, eta, beraz, dagozkien Xfce elkarrizketak "
"ez daude oraindik eskuragarri Wayland-en."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:31
msgid ""
"Power related keyboard handling (brightness keys, suspend, etc.) is internal"
" to the Wayland compositor and as such cannot be supported yet by Xfce "
"components."
msgstr ""
"Energiarekin lotutako teklatuaren kudeaketa (distira-teklak, etetea, etab.) "
"Wayland konposatzailearen barnekoa da, eta, beraz, Xfce-ren osagaiek ezin "
"dute oraindik onartu."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:32
msgid ""
"Wayland does not specify a native protocol for taking screenshots. However, "
"xfce4-screenshooter already supports screenshots via the wlroots "
"'screencopy' protocol (entire screen). Screenshots of a rectangle selection "
"or the active window are not yet supported via Wayland."
msgstr ""
"Wayland-ek ez du pantaila-argazkiak ateratzeko protokolo natiborik zehazten."
" Hala ere, xfce4-screenshooter-ek dagoeneko onartzen ditu pantaila-argazkiak"
" wlroots-en 'screencopy' protokoloaren bidez (pantaila osoa). Laukizuzen-"
"hautapen baten edo leiho aktiboaren pantaila-argazkiak ez dira oraindik "
"onartzen Wayland bidez."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:34
msgid "Some other Xfce components don't run at all on Wayland:"
msgstr "Xfce-ren beste osagai batzuk ez dira batere exekutatzen Wayland-en:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:36
msgid "Xfwm4"
msgstr "Xfwm4"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:37
msgid "Xfdashboard"
msgstr "Xfdashboard"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:38
msgid ""
"Xfce4-screensaver (porting to Wayland [completed but not "
"merged](https://gitlab.xfce.org/apps/xfce4-screensaver/-/merge_requests/28),"
" as it requires the experimental [libwlembed "
"library](https://gitlab.xfce.org/kelnos/libwlembed))"
msgstr ""
"Xfce4-screensaver (Wayland-erako egokitzapena [osatuta dago baina ez "
"bateratuta](https://gitlab.xfce.org/apps/xfce4-screensaver/-/merge_requests/28),"
" [libwlembed liburutegi](https://gitlab.xfce.org/kelnos/libwlembed) "
"esperimentala behar duelako)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:39
msgid ""
"Xfce4-windowck-plugin (needs to be [ported to "
"libxfce4windowing](https://gitlab.xfce.org/panel-plugins/xfce4-windowck-"
"plugin/-/issues/37))"
msgstr ""
"Xfce4-windowck-plugin ([libxfce4windowing-era "
"eraman](https://gitlab.xfce.org/panel-plugins/xfce4-windowck-"
"plugin/-/issues/37) behar da)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:40
msgid ""
"Xfce4-xkb-plugin (keyboard handling is internal to the Wayland compositor)"
msgstr ""
"Xfce4-xkb-plugin (teklatuaren kudeaketa Wayland konposatzailearen barnekoa "
"da)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:42
msgid ""
"More detailed info on the current Wayland status can be found on our "
"[Wayland roadmap.](https://wiki.xfce.org/releng/wayland_roadmap)"
msgstr ""
"Wayland-en egungo egoerari buruzko informazio zehatzagoa gure [Wayland "
"ibilbide-orrian](https://wiki.xfce.org/releng/wayland_roadmap) aurki "
"daiteke."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:46
msgid ""
"Icons and thumbnail scaling was fixed for various components. Various "
"missing icons for larger scales were added. Any blurriness when using Xfce "
"components on a HiDPI display should be gone now."
msgstr ""
"Ikonoen eta koadro txikien eskalatzea konpondu da hainbat osagaitan. Eskala "
"handiagoetarako falta ziren hainbat ikono gehitu dira. Xfce-ren osagaiak "
"HiDPI pantaila batean erabiltzean, lausotasun oro desagertu beharko "
"litzateke orain."

#: content/about/tour420.md:48
msgid "[exo](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/exo/start)"
msgstr "[exo](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/exo/start)"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:50
msgid "Icon View Performance"
msgstr "Ikono-ikuspegiaren errendimendua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:52
msgid ""
"By using different container types, the \"Exo-Icon-View\" now can handle "
"100,000 files and more without freezing."
msgstr ""
"Edukiontzi mota desberdinak erabiliz, \"Exo-Icon-View\"-k orain 100.000 "
"fitxategi eta gehiago kudea ditzake izoztu gabe."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:54
msgid "Type ahead search box"
msgstr "Idatzi ahala bilatzeko koadroa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:56
msgid ""
"The type ahead search box in the exo icon view now always stays inside the "
"according view widget."
msgstr ""
"Exo-ren ikono-ikuspegiko idatzi ahala bilatzeko koadroa beti geratzen da "
"orain dagokion ikuspegi-trepetaren barruan."

#: content/about/tour420.md:58
msgid "[libxfce4ui](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/libxfce4ui/start)"
msgstr "[libxfce4ui](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/libxfce4ui/start)"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:60
msgid "Shortcut Editor"
msgstr "Laster-teklen editorea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:62
msgid ""
"Shortcuts now can be used for multiple actions if they don't conflict with "
"each other."
msgstr ""
"Laster-teklak ekintza anitzetarako erabil daitezke orain, elkarren artean "
"gatazkarik ez badute."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:64
msgid "About Dialog"
msgstr "Honi buruz elkarrizketa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:66
msgid ""
"The dialog now shows the distribution logo, information about the used "
"windowing system and the used GPU."
msgstr ""
"Elkarrizketak banaketaren logotipoa, erabilitako leiho-sistemari buruzko "
"informazioa eta erabilitako GPUa erakusten ditu orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:68
msgid "![libxfce4ui - about dialog][img-libxfce4ui_about]"
msgstr "![libxfce4ui - honi buruz elkarrizketa][img-libxfce4ui_about]"

#: content/about/tour420.md:70
msgid ""
"[libxfce4windowing](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/libxfce4windowing/start)"
msgstr ""
"[libxfce4windowing](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/libxfce4windowing/start)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:72
msgid ""
"This library is new to Xfce. Libxfce4windowing is an abstraction library "
"that attempts to present windowing concepts (screens, top level windows, "
"workspaces, etc.) in a windowing-system-independent manner."
msgstr ""
"Liburutegi hau berria da Xfce-n. Libxfce4windowing abstrakzio-liburutegi bat"
" da, leiho-sistemen kontzeptuak (pantailak, goi-mailako leihoak, laneko "
"areak, etab.) leiho-sistematik independentea den moduan aurkezten saiatzen "
"dena."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:74
msgid ""
"Currently, X11 is fully supported via libwnck. Wayland is partially "
"supported by using various Wayland protocol extensions. However, the full "
"range of operations available on X11 is not available on Wayland, due to "
"missing features in these protocols extensions."
msgstr ""
"Gaur egun, X11 guztiz onartzen da libwnck-en bidez. Wayland partzialki "
"onartzen da, Wayland protokoloaren hainbat hedapen erabiliz. Hala ere, X11-n"
" eskuragarri dauden eragiketa guztiak ez daude eskuragarri Wayland-en, "
"protokolo-hedapen horietan ezaugarri batzuk falta direlako."

#: content/about/tour420.md:76
msgid "[thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/start)"
msgstr "[thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/start)"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:78
msgid "Mounted and Remote Locations"
msgstr "Muntatutako eta urruneko kokapenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:80
msgid "Mount points now show an emblem and have a specific type description."
msgstr ""
"Muntatze-puntuek ikur bat erakusten dute orain, eta mota-deskribapen "
"espezifiko bat dute."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:82
msgid "Ipv6 remote URLs are now supported."
msgstr "IPv6 urruneko URLak onartzen dira orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:84
msgid ""
"It is now possible to create symbolic links as well on remote locations."
msgstr "Orain esteka sinbolikoak urruneko kokapenetan ere sor daitezke."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:86
msgid "Search"
msgstr "Bilaketa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:88
msgid ""
"It is not required any more to wait until a search is finished to open the "
"context menu on search results."
msgstr ""
"Jada ez da beharrezkoa bilaketa bat amaitu arte itxarotea bilaketaren "
"emaitzen gaineko laster-menua irekitzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:92
msgid "A couple of new toolbar buttons were added:"
msgstr "Tresna-barrako botoi berri batzuk gehitu dira:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:94
msgid "View Switcher - A drop-down button to select a view."
msgstr "Ikuspegi-aldatzailea - Ikuspegi bat hautatzeko goitibeherako botoia."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:95
msgid ""
"Menu - This hamburger button will show automatically in the toolbar, when "
"the menubar is hidden. It will reveal a vertical menu, bar, when pressed."
msgstr ""
"Menua - Hanburgesa-botoi hau automatikoki agertuko da tresna-barran, menu-"
"barra ezkutatuta dagoenean. Sakatzean, menu-barra bertikal bat erakutsiko "
"du."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:96
msgid "New Tab - Open a new tab using the current directory."
msgstr "Fitxa berria - Ireki fitxa berri bat uneko direktorioarekin."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:97
msgid "New Window - Open a new window using the current directory."
msgstr "Leiho berria - Ireki leiho berri bat uneko direktorioarekin."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:99
msgid "![thunar - new toolbar buttons][img-thunar_toolbar_new_items]"
msgstr ""
"![thunar - tresna-barrako botoi berriak][img-thunar_toolbar_new_items]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:101
msgid ""
"![thunar - improved hamburger toolbar button][img-thunar_toolbar_hamburger]"
msgstr ""
"![thunar - tresna-barrako hanburgesa-botoi hobetua][img-"
"thunar_toolbar_hamburger]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:103
msgid ""
"On shrinking the Thunar window, toolbar items will now be moved to an "
"overflow menu. Like that, it is possible to maintain smaller thunar windows."
msgstr ""
"Thunar-en leihoa txikitzean, tresna-barrako elementuak gainezkatze-menu "
"batera eramango dira orain. Horrela, Thunar-en leiho txikiagoak izan "
"daitezke."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:105
msgid ""
"Furthermore, a bug was fixed which prevented the usage of submenu custom "
"actions in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Gainera, tresna-barran azpimenuetako ekintza pertsonalizatuak erabiltzea "
"eragozten zuen akats bat konpondu da."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:107
msgid "Window Decorations"
msgstr "Leiho-apaingarriak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:109
msgid "There is now an option to use client side decorations in Thunar (CSD)."
msgstr ""
"Orain Thunar-en bezero aldeko apaingarriak (CSD) erabiltzeko aukera dago."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:111
msgid "![thunar - CSD with menu][img-thunar_csd_with_menu]"
msgstr "![thunar - CSD menuarekin][img-thunar_csd_with_menu]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:113
msgid "![thunar - CSD without menu][img-thunar_csd_without_menu]"
msgstr "![thunar - CSD menurik gabe][img-thunar_csd_without_menu]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:117
msgid ""
"An option to show the number of hidden files in the statusbar was added."
msgstr ""
"Egoera-barran fitxategi ezkutuen kopurua erakusteko aukera bat gehitu da."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:119
msgid "Recently Used Files"
msgstr "Azken aldian erabilitako fitxategiak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:121
msgid ""
"Only files which were successfully opened are now added to the list of "
"recently used files."
msgstr ""
"Arrakastaz ireki diren fitxategiak bakarrik gehitzen dira orain azken aldian"
" erabilitako fitxategien zerrendara."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:123
msgid "Directories won't be added to the recently used files anymore."
msgstr ""
"Direktorioak jada ez dira gehituko azken aldian erabilitako fitxategietara."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:125
msgid "Symbolic Icons"
msgstr "Ikono sinbolikoak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:127
msgid ""
"There is now an option to use symbolic icons in the side pane and colored "
"icons in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Orain ikono sinbolikoak alboko panelean eta ikono koloredunak tresna-barran "
"erabiltzeko aukera dago."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:129
msgid "![thunar - symbolic icons][img-thunar_symbolic_icons]"
msgstr "![thunar - ikono sinbolikoak][img-thunar_symbolic_icons]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:131
msgid "![thunar - colored icons][img-thunar_colored_icons]"
msgstr "![thunar - ikono koloredunak][img-thunar_colored_icons]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:133
msgid "Drag and Drop"
msgstr "Arrastatu eta jaregin"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:135
msgid "While dragging files, folders are now opened automatically on hover."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategiak arrastatzen diren bitartean, karpetak automatikoki irekitzen "
"dira orain gainetik pasatzean."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:137
msgid ""
"While dragging files, the focus of the split view pane is now updated when "
"hovered."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategiak arrastatzen diren bitartean, ikuspegi zatituko panelaren fokua "
"eguneratu egiten da orain gainetik pasatzean."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:139
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "Errendimendua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:141
msgid ""
"In the past, you might have faced situation involving bigger numbers of "
"files in which thunar showed a freeze. Due to various different performance "
"measures, thunar now is much more bullet-proof for action involving huge "
"numbers of files."
msgstr ""
"Iraganean, baliteke fitxategi kopuru handiak zituzten egoeretan Thunar "
"izoztuta ikusi izana. Errendimendu-neurri desberdinei esker, Thunar orain "
"askoz sendoagoa da fitxategi kopuru erraldoiak dituzten ekintzetarako."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:143
msgid ""
"This was achieved by using appropriate container types, moving some actions "
"into separate jobs and throttling of view-updates."
msgstr ""
"Hori edukiontzi mota egokiak erabiliz, ekintza batzuk lan bereizietara "
"eramanez eta ikuspegiaren eguneraketak mugatuz lortu da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:145
msgid ""
"A [number of integration test "
"cases](https://wiki.xfce.org/thunar/dev/integration_testcases) will be used "
"in order to keep performance on the current level in the future."
msgstr ""
"[Integrazio-proba kasu "
"batzuk](https://wiki.xfce.org/thunar/dev/integration_testcases) erabiliko "
"dira etorkizunean errendimendua egungo mailan mantentzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:149
msgid ""
"Shortcuts for custom action will now as well work when the custom action is "
"located in a sub-menu."
msgstr ""
"Ekintza pertsonalizatuen laster-teklek ere funtzionatuko dute orain ekintza "
"pertsonalizatua azpimenu batean dagoenean."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:151
msgid "File Transfer"
msgstr "Fitxategi-transferentzia"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:153
msgid ""
"For file validation in thunar 4.18.x a md5 checksum was calculated for "
"source and target file. This calculation turned out to be rather slow and "
"actually superfluous. Now files are just compared directly. In addition, the"
" usage of direct I/O operations now attempts to prevent comparison of "
"possibly cached buffers."
msgstr ""
"Thunar 4.18.x-en fitxategiak baliozkotzeko, md5 kontrol-batura bat "
"kalkulatzen zen jatorrizko eta helburuko fitxategietarako. Kalkulu hori "
"nahiko motela eta, egia esan, alferrikakoa zela ikusi zen. Orain fitxategiak"
" zuzenean alderatzen dira. Gainera, S/I eragiketa zuzenak erabiliz, cachean "
"egon daitezkeen bufferrak alderatzea saihesten saiatzen da orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:155
msgid ""
"An option was added to only copy files in parallel if the relevant devices "
"are in idle state. This prevents possible fragmentation during copy for HDD "
"drives."
msgstr ""
"Aukera bat gehitu da fitxategiak paraleloan kopiatzeko soilik dagozkien "
"gailuak inaktibo daudenean. Horrek HDD unitateetan kopiatzean gerta "
"daitekeen zatiketa saihesten du."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:157
msgid "Transferring files no longer steals the current focus."
msgstr "Fitxategiak transferitzeak jada ez du uneko fokua lapurtzen."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:159
msgid ""
"The file transfer question dialog now provides the same options while having"
" less buttons. In addition, file thumbnails now are properly requested by "
"the dialog."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategi-transferentziaren galdera-elkarrizketak aukera berak eskaintzen "
"ditu orain, botoi gutxiagorekin. Gainera, elkarrizketak behar bezala "
"eskatzen ditu orain fitxategien koadro txikiak."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:161
msgid "![thunar - file transfer dialog][img-thunar_transfer_dialog]"
msgstr ""
"![thunar - fitxategi-transferentziaren elkarrizketa][img-"
"thunar_transfer_dialog]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:163
msgid "Launchers"
msgstr "Abiarazleak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:165
msgid ""
"By default, launcher names instead of filenames are shown now for trusted "
"launchers."
msgstr ""
"Lehenespenez, abiarazle fidagarrietarako abiarazleen izenak erakusten dira "
"orain, fitxategi-izenen ordez."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:167
msgid "Undo/Redo"
msgstr "Desegin/Berregin"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:169
msgid ""
"The user now will be asked before any deletion will be done by an undo "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Orain erabiltzaileari galdetuko zaio desegite-eragiketa batek edozein "
"ezabaketa egin aurretik."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:173
msgid ""
"Similar to the tree-view side pane, the main view now also supports folder "
"expansion."
msgstr ""
"Zuhaitz-ikuspegiko alboko panelaren antzera, ikuspegi nagusiak ere karpetak "
"zabaltzea onartzen du orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:175
msgid "![thunar - expandable folders][img-thunar_expandable_folders]"
msgstr "![thunar - karpeta zabalgarriak][img-thunar_expandable_folders]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:179
msgid ""
"A shortcut now can be used to toggle between split-view panes, and the "
"focused pane now uses different coloring."
msgstr ""
"Laster-tekla bat erabil daiteke orain ikuspegi zatituko panelen artean "
"txandakatzeko, eta fokua duen panelak kolore desberdina erabiltzen du orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:181
msgid "![thunar - split view][img-thunar_split_view]"
msgstr "![thunar - ikuspegi zatitua][img-thunar_split_view]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:183
msgid ""
"A dialog will now ask for confirmation when closing a split-pane with "
"multiple tabs."
msgstr ""
"Fitxa anitz dituen panel zatitu bat ixtean, elkarrizketa batek berrespena "
"eskatuko du orain."

#: content/about/tour420.md:185
msgid "[xfce4-appfinder](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-appfinder/start)"
msgstr "[xfce4-appfinder](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-appfinder/start)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:187
msgid ""
"The application list now as well can be navigated via Ctrl+N / Ctrl+P keys "
"(VI default)."
msgstr ""
"Aplikazioen zerrendan Ctrl+N / Ctrl+P teklekin ere nabiga daiteke orain (VI "
"lehenetsia)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:189
msgid ""
"An option was added to close the Appfinder window automatically when focus "
"is lost."
msgstr ""
"Aukera bat gehitu da Appfinder-en leihoa automatikoki ixteko fokua galtzen "
"denean."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:191
msgid ""
"Ctrl+Enter can be used to execute commands immediately when selecting "
"entries from the dropdown."
msgstr ""
"Ctrl+Sartu erabil daiteke komandoak berehala exekutatzeko goitibeherako "
"zerrendatik sarrerak hautatzean."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:193
msgid ""
"Within the new version, application specific actions will show on right "
"click."
msgstr ""
"Bertsio berrian, aplikazio bakoitzaren ekintza espezifikoak eskuineko "
"klikarekin erakutsiko dira."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:195
msgid "An option to show generic names of launchers was added."
msgstr "Abiarazleen izen generikoak erakusteko aukera bat gehitu da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:197
msgid ""
"Appfinder optionally can now be launched as a daemon, so that it will "
"respond even quicker."
msgstr ""
"Appfinder daemon gisa abiaraz daiteke orain, hala nahi izanez gero, are "
"azkarrago erantzun dezan."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:199
msgid "An option allows now to launch items on a single click."
msgstr ""
"Aukera batek elementuak klik bakarrarekin abiarazteko aukera ematen du "
"orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:201
msgid "![xfce4-appfinder - settings][img-appfinder_new]"
msgstr "![xfce4-appfinder - ezarpenak][img-appfinder_new]"

#: content/about/tour420.md:203
msgid "[xfce4-panel](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/start)"
msgstr "[xfce4-panel](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/start)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:207
msgid "The border width of the panel is now configurable."
msgstr "Panelaren ertzaren zabalera konfigura daiteke orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:209
msgid ""
"For manual installations: the panel now does its best to find plugins in XDG"
" base directories, and better preserves its configuration when it can't find"
" them."
msgstr ""
"Eskuzko instalazioetarako: panelak ahal duen guztia egiten du orain pluginak"
" XDG oinarrizko direktorioetan aurkitzeko, eta hobeto gordetzen du bere "
"konfigurazioa aurkitzen ez dituenean."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:211
msgid "Clock"
msgstr "Erlojua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:213
msgid "LCD clock: An option was added to visualize inactive segments."
msgstr "LCD erlojua: segmentu inaktiboak bistaratzeko aukera bat gehitu da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:215
msgid "Analog: There is now an optional 24h mode."
msgstr "Analogikoa: 24 orduko modu hautazko bat dago orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:217
msgid "Digital: Week numbers now are shown optionally."
msgstr ""
"Digitala: asteen zenbakiak erakuts daitezke orain, hala nahi izanez gero."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:219
msgid "Show Desktop"
msgstr "Erakutsi mahaigaina"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:221
msgid ""
"There is now the possibility to show the desktop when hovering the mouse on "
"the \"show desktop\" panel icon."
msgstr ""
"Orain mahaigaina erakusteko aukera dago sagua paneleko \"erakutsi "
"mahaigaina\" ikonoaren gainetik pasatzean."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:223
msgid "Tasklist"
msgstr "Ataza-zerrenda"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:225
msgid ""
"Icon size management has been improved overall, notably by switching to "
"libxfce4windowing."
msgstr ""
"Ikono-tamainaren kudeaketa orokorrean hobetu da, bereziki libxfce4windowing-"
"era aldatuz."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:229
msgid ""
"The 'delete' key can now be used to remove panel objects, and several "
"objects can be removed at once."
msgstr ""
"'Ezabatu' tekla erabil daiteke orain panelaren objektuak kentzeko, eta "
"hainbat objektu aldi berean ken daitezke."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:231
msgid ""
"Panel objects in the panel configuration list now will have the same icons "
"as in the panel itself."
msgstr ""
"Panelaren konfigurazio-zerrendako objektuek panelean bertan dituzten ikono "
"berak izango dituzte orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:233
msgid "![xfce4-panel - panel configuration list][img-panel_item_list]"
msgstr "![xfce4-panel - panelaren konfigurazio-zerrenda][img-panel_item_list]"

#: content/about/tour420.md:235
msgid ""
"[xfce4-power-manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-manager/start)"
msgstr ""
"[xfce4-power-manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-manager/start)"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:237
msgid "Screen Locking"
msgstr "Pantaila blokeatzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:239
msgid ""
"There is no dedicated \"security\" tab anymore. Lock screen management was "
"massively simplified and \"Light Locker\" was dropped. \"lock-on-sleep\" is "
"now synchronized with xfce4-session and xfce4-screensaver."
msgstr ""
"Jada ez dago \"segurtasun\" fitxa berezirik. Blokeo-pantailaren kudeaketa "
"izugarri sinplifikatu da, eta \"Light Locker\" kendu egin da. \"lock-on-"
"sleep\" orain xfce4-session eta xfce4-screensaver-ekin sinkronizatzen da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:241
msgid ""
"Screen locking settings are now only handled by xfce4-screensaver to avoid "
"conflicts. A button to open xfce4-screensaver-preferences was added:"
msgstr ""
"Pantaila blokeatzeko ezarpenak xfce4-screensaver-ek bakarrik kudeatzen ditu "
"orain, gatazkak saihesteko. xfce4-screensaver-preferences irekitzeko botoi "
"bat gehitu da:"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:243
msgid "![xfce4-power-manager - settings][img-power_manager_settings]"
msgstr "![xfce4-power-manager - ezarpenak][img-power_manager_settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:245
msgid "![xfce4-screensaver - settings][img-power_manager_screensaver]"
msgstr "![xfce4-screensaver - ezarpenak][img-power_manager_screensaver]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:247
msgid "Power Settings"
msgstr "Energia-ezarpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:249
msgid ""
"Support for handling different power profiles via power-profiles-daemon was "
"added."
msgstr ""
"power-profiles-daemon bidez energia-profil desberdinak kudeatzeko euskarria "
"gehitu da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:251
msgid ""
"The overall charge state calculation was wrong for some cases and is now "
"fixed."
msgstr ""
"Karga-egoera orokorraren kalkulua okerra zen kasu batzuetan, eta orain "
"konponduta dago."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:253
msgid ""
"When the critical power dialog pops up, unintentional user actions are now "
"prevented."
msgstr ""
"Energia kritikoaren elkarrizketa agertzen denean, erabiltzailearen nahi "
"gabeko ekintzak saihesten dira orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:255
msgid "There is now support for the hybrid sleep mode."
msgstr "Orain lo hibridoko modua onartzen da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:257
msgid "The device details tab now as well shows the energy rate."
msgstr "Gailuaren xehetasunen fitxak energia-tasa ere erakusten du orain."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:259
msgid "Others"
msgstr "Beste batzuk"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:261
msgid "Several use-cases for lid close were fixed."
msgstr "Tapa ixtearen hainbat erabilera-kasu konpondu dira."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:263
msgid "There are now the options \"shutdown\" and \"do nothing\" on lid close."
msgstr "Orain \"itzali\" eta \"ez egin ezer\" aukerak daude tapa ixtean."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:265
msgid ""
"Buttons to change the brightness exponentially and keyboard backlight toggle"
" keys now are supported."
msgstr ""
"Distira esponentzialki aldatzeko botoiak eta teklatuaren atzeko argia "
"aktibatzeko/desaktibatzeko teklak onartzen dira orain."

#: content/about/tour420.md:267
msgid "[xfce4-session](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/start)"
msgstr "[xfce4-session](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/start)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:269
msgid ""
"The logout dialog will not provide a checkbox to enable session saving "
"anymore."
msgstr ""
"Saio-ixteko elkarrizketak jada ez du saioa gordetzea gaitzeko kontrol-"
"laukirik eskainiko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:271
msgid ""
"It is now possible to start a Wayland session via `startxfce4 --wayland`."
msgstr "Orain Wayland saio bat abiaraz daiteke `startxfce4 --wayland` bidez."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:273
msgid ""
"Minimal support for xdg-desktop-portal was added by registering for a "
"wallpaper, screenshot and background xapp."
msgstr ""
"xdg-desktop-portal-erako gutxieneko euskarria gehitu da, horma-paper, "
"pantaila-argazki eta atzeko planoko xapp baterako erregistratuz."

#: content/about/tour420.md:275
msgid "[xfce4-settings](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/start)"
msgstr "[xfce4-settings](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/start)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:279
msgid ""
"Icon themes are now loaded in a separate thread, in order to prevent a "
"possible freeze."
msgstr ""
"Ikono-gaiak hari bereizi batean kargatzen dira orain, izozte posible bat "
"saihesteko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:281
msgid ""
"For icon themes which are known to be incomplete, a warning now will be "
"shown."
msgstr ""
"Osatugabeak direla dakigun ikono-gaietarako, abisu bat erakutsiko da orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:283
msgid "The usage of client side decorations is opt-in now, not opt-out."
msgstr ""
"Bezero aldeko apaingarriak erabiltzea aukerakoa da orain, eta ez lehenetsia."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:285
msgid ""
"Dark themes now are identified and supported in a more reliable way. "
"(Relevant e.g. for the Qogir and Orchis themes)"
msgstr ""
"Gai ilunak modu fidagarriagoan identifikatu eta onartzen dira orain. "
"(Garrantzitsua da, adibidez, Qogir eta Orchis gaietarako)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:289
msgid ""
"The default display profile has been added to the list of profiles that can "
"match, and will be used if more than one matches now."
msgstr ""
"Pantaila-profil lehenetsia bat etor daitezkeen profilen zerrendara gehitu "
"da, eta bat baino gehiago bat datozenean hura erabiliko da orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:291
msgid ""
"Profile management has been extended to all profiles, not just those that "
"match, and their names can now be edited."
msgstr ""
"Profilen kudeaketa profil guztietara zabaldu da, ez bakarrik bat "
"datozenetara, eta haien izenak edita daitezke orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:293
msgid ""
"Scaling now always is done for both dimensions, and the preview shows the "
"resulting size."
msgstr ""
"Eskalatzea beti egiten da orain bi dimentsioetan, eta aurrebistak ondoriozko"
" tamaina erakusten du."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:295
msgid ""
"Mirror state management has been improved overall, in particular by removing"
" the need to match refresh rates."
msgstr ""
"Ispilu-egoeraren kudeaketa orokorrean hobetu da, bereziki freskatze-"
"maiztasunak bat etortzeko beharra kenduz."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:297
msgid ""
"The minimal dialog has been improved, in particular by allowing the display "
"to be extended to the left and from top to bottom, and with compact profile "
"display."
msgstr ""
"Elkarrizketa minimoa hobetu da, bereziki pantaila ezkerrera eta goitik "
"behera hedatzeko aukera emanez, eta profilak modu trinkoan bistaratuz."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:299
msgid "![xfce4-settings - minimal display][img-settings_display]"
msgstr "![xfce4-settings - pantaila minimoa][img-settings_display]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:301
msgid "Mouse Settings"
msgstr "Saguaren ezarpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:303
msgid ""
"A checkbox was added to toggle between adaptive and flat mouse accel "
"profile."
msgstr ""
"Kontrol-lauki bat gehitu da saguaren azelerazio-profil moldagarriaren eta "
"lauaren artean txandakatzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:305
msgid ""
"High resolution scrolling can now be enabled for mice which do support it."
msgstr ""
"Bereizmen handiko korritzea gaitu daiteke orain hura onartzen duten "
"saguetan."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:307
msgid "![xfce4-settings - mouse][img-settings_mouse]"
msgstr "![xfce4-settings - sagua][img-settings_mouse]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:309
msgid "Mime Settings"
msgstr "MIME ezarpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:311
msgid "It is now possible to select/change multiple items at once."
msgstr "Orain hainbat elementu aldi berean hautatu/aldatu daitezke."

#: content/about/tour420.md:313
msgid "[xfconf](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfconf/start)"
msgstr "[xfconf](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfconf/start)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:315
msgid ""
"A systemd user unit, corresponding to the D-Bus session service, is now "
"added."
msgstr ""
"D-Bus saio-zerbitzuari dagokion systemd erabiltzaile-unitate bat gehitu da "
"orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:317
msgid ""
"Whitespaces are now properly escaped when writing a xfconf channel to disk."
msgstr ""
"Zuriuneak behar bezala ihes-karaktereztatzen dira orain xfconf kanal bat "
"diskoan idaztean."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:319
msgid "Xfconf-query now displays array contents."
msgstr "Xfconf-query-k matrizeen edukia bistaratzen du orain."

#: content/about/tour420.md:321
msgid "[xfdesktop](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfdesktop/start)"
msgstr "[xfdesktop](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfdesktop/start)"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:323
msgid "Background Management"
msgstr "Atzeko planoaren kudeaketa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:325
msgid ""
"For random wallpaper cycling, wallpapers now are only repeated after all "
"other wallpapers were shown."
msgstr ""
"Horma-paperen ausazko txandakatzean, horma-paperak beste guztiak erakutsi "
"ondoren bakarrik errepikatzen dira orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:327
msgid ""
"Old Xfce backgrounds were ported from .png to .svg to be usable for large "
"screens."
msgstr ""
"Xfce-ren atzeko plano zaharrak .png-tik .svg-ra eraman dira, pantaila "
"handietan erabilgarriak izan daitezen."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:329
msgid "Gradients will now be rendered in a gamma-correct way."
msgstr "Gradienteak gamma zuzenarekin errendatuko dira orain."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:331
msgid "Icon grid"
msgstr "Ikonoen sareta"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:333
msgid "The confirmation dialog for arranging desktop icons now is optional."
msgstr ""
"Mahaigaineko ikonoak antolatzeko berrespen-elkarrizketa hautazkoa da orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:335
msgid ""
"It is now possible to set custom colors for icon labels and icon background."
msgstr ""
"Orain kolore pertsonalizatuak ezar daitezke ikonoen etiketetarako eta "
"ikonoen atzeko planorako."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:337
msgid "The icon grid on each monitor is now independent of one another."
msgstr ""
"Monitore bakoitzeko ikonoen sareta beste monitoreetakoekiko independentea da"
" orain."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:339
msgid "Minimized Application Icons"
msgstr "Minimizatutako aplikazioen ikonoak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:341
msgid ""
"Window icons are now initially shown on the monitor where the window was "
"present before being minimized."
msgstr ""
"Leihoen ikonoak, hasieran, minimizatu aurretik leihoa zegoen monitorean "
"erakusten dira orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:343
msgid ""
"The context menu (when clicking on an empty space) now has more useful "
"options than before."
msgstr ""
"Laster-menuak (leku huts batean klik egitean) lehen baino aukera "
"erabilgarriagoak ditu orain."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:345
msgid "File Icons"
msgstr "Fitxategien ikonoak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:347
msgid "There is now an option to sort folders before files."
msgstr "Orain karpetak fitxategien aurretik ordenatzeko aukera dago."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:349
msgid ""
"The positions of the icons are now saved in a way that should avoid icons "
"moving around in unexpected ways when monitors are added and removed."
msgstr ""
"Ikonoen kokapenak orain monitoreak gehitu eta kentzean ikonoak ustekabean "
"mugitzea saihestu beharko lukeen moduan gordetzen dira."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:351
msgid ""
"New files and dropped files now will be placed near the current cursor "
"location."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategi berriak eta jaregindako fitxategiak kurtsorearen uneko kokapenaren"
" ondoan jarriko dira orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:353
msgid "Icons of fixed disks and drives can now be optionally shown."
msgstr ""
"Disko eta unitate finkoen ikonoak erakuts daitezke orain, hala nahi izanez "
"gero."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:357
msgid "The 'Desktop Icons' tab was fully reworked."
msgstr "'Mahaigaineko ikonoak' fitxa guztiz berrantolatu da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:359
msgid "![xfdesktop - settings - desktop icons][img-xfdesktop_settings_icons]"
msgstr ""
"![xfdesktop - ezarpenak - mahaigaineko ikonoak][img-"
"xfdesktop_settings_icons]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:361
msgid ""
"All shortcuts of Xfdesktop now can be configured, using the "
"XfceShortcutsManagers widget."
msgstr ""
"Xfdesktop-en laster-tekla guztiak konfigura daitezke orain, "
"XfceShortcutsManagers trepeta erabiliz."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:363
msgid ""
"![xfdesktop - settings - keyboard shortcuts][img-"
"xfdesktop_settings_shortcuts]"
msgstr ""
"![xfdesktop - ezarpenak - laster-teklak][img-xfdesktop_settings_shortcuts]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:365
msgid ""
"More folders that hold background images were added as shortcuts in the "
"settings dialog."
msgstr ""
"Atzeko planoko irudiak dituzten karpeta gehiago gehitu dira lasterbide gisa "
"ezarpen-elkarrizketan."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:367
msgid ""
"The settings dialog will update if the background is changed from outside "
"the dialog."
msgstr ""
"Ezarpen-elkarrizketa eguneratu egingo da atzeko planoa elkarrizketatik kanpo"
" aldatzen bada."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:369
msgid ""
"Wallpaper image folders now are loaded fully asynchronously to prevent lag."
msgstr ""
"Horma-paperen irudi-karpetak guztiz asinkronoki kargatzen dira orain, "
"atzerapenak saihesteko."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:371
msgid "Context Menu"
msgstr "Laster-menua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:373
msgid ""
"Cascading custom actions will now as well shown correctly in Xfdesktop."
msgstr ""
"Kaskadako ekintza pertsonalizatuak ere behar bezala erakutsiko dira orain "
"Xfdesktop-en."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:375
msgid "It is now possible to open multiple selected folders at once."
msgstr "Orain hautatutako hainbat karpeta aldi berean ireki daitezke."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:377
msgid ""
"The context menu now opens on button press rather than button release, as "
"most users will expect."
msgstr ""
"Laster-menua orain botoia sakatzean irekitzen da, ez askatzean, erabiltzaile"
" gehienek espero duten bezala."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:379
msgid "The middle-click window list menu has new styling and added features."
msgstr ""
"Erdiko klikeko leihoen zerrendaren menuak estilo berria eta ezaugarri "
"gehigarriak ditu."

#: content/about/tour420.md:381
msgid "[xfwm4](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/start)"
msgstr "[xfwm4](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/start)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:383
msgid "Support for stretch theme variants"
msgstr "Gai-aldaeren luzatzerako euskarria"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:385
msgid "Compositor: Block softpipe for GLX vsync"
msgstr "Konposatzailea: blokeatu softpipe GLX vsync-erako"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:387
msgid "Focus: Include skip taskbar/pager when passing focus"
msgstr ""
"Fokua: sartu ataza-barra/orrikatzailea saltatzeko propietatea fokua "
"pasatzean"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:389
msgid ""
"Fix crash when alt-tabbing "
"([#762](https://gitlab.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/-/issues/762))"
msgstr ""
"Konpondu alt-tab egitean gertatzen zen kraskadura "
"([#762](https://gitlab.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/-/issues/762))"

#: content/about/tour420.md:391
msgid ""
"<p align=\"right\"><small>Used theme: \"Greybird-dark\". Used icon-theme: "
"\"elementary Xfce dark\".</small></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"right\"><small>Erabilitako gaia: \"Greybird-dark\". Erabilitako "
"ikono-gaia: \"elementary Xfce dark\".</small></p>\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour44.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.4 tour"
msgstr "Xfce 4.4 bira"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:7
msgid ""
"As of today, the long awaited version 4.4.0 of the Xfce Desktop Environment "
"is finally available. I will try to highlight some of the new features which"
" have been added since the last stable release."
msgstr ""
"Gaurtik aurrera, hainbeste itxarondako Xfce mahaigain-ingurunearen 4.4.0 "
"bertsioa eskuragarri dago azkenean. Azken bertsio egonkorretik gehitu diren "
"ezaugarri berri batzuk nabarmentzen saiatuko naiz."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:9
msgid "Desktop Icons"
msgstr "Mahaigaineko ikonoak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:11
msgid ""
"One of the most often requested features during the 4.0 and 4.2 was support "
"for icons on the desktop. Now, with Xfce 4.4.0, this feature was finally "
"added to the desktop manager **Xfdesktop**."
msgstr ""
"4.0 eta 4.2 bertsioetan gehien eskatutako ezaugarrietako bat mahaigaineko "
"ikonoen euskarria zen. Orain, Xfce 4.4.0rekin, ezaugarri hori azkenean "
"gehitu zaio **Xfdesktop** mahaigain-kudeatzaileari."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:13
msgid "![Desktop Icons][img-desktop-icons]"
msgstr "![Mahaigaineko ikonoak][img-desktop-icons]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:15
msgid ""
"The desktop manager utilizes **Thunar**'s libraries to handle application "
"launchers and regular files/folders on the desktop. The desktop manager is "
"also able to display icons for minimized windows on the desktop, which is "
"quite a popular feature from the CDE world. Of course, you can disable the "
"desktop icons altogether if you prefer a clean desktop."
msgstr ""
"Mahaigain-kudeatzaileak **Thunar**-en liburutegiak erabiltzen ditu "
"mahaigaineko aplikazio-abiarazleak eta fitxategi/karpeta arruntak "
"kudeatzeko. Mahaigain-kudeatzaileak minimizatutako leihoen ikonoak ere "
"bistara ditzake mahaigainean, CDE munduan nahiko ezaguna den ezaugarria. "
"Jakina, mahaigaineko ikonoak guztiz desgai ditzakezu mahaigain garbia "
"nahiago baduzu."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:17
msgid "![Desktop Settings][img-desktop-settings]"
msgstr "![Mahaigainaren ezarpenak][img-desktop-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:19
msgid ""
"**Xfdesktop** also continues to provide access to the applications menu, as "
"it did in the previous Xfce releases."
msgstr ""
"**Xfdesktop**-ek aplikazioen menurako sarbidea ematen jarraitzen du, Xfce-"
"ren aurreko bertsioetan bezala."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:23
msgid ""
"The desktop icon support goes hand in hand with the new file manager "
"[Thunar](http://thunar.xfce.org/) which replaces the previous file manager "
"**Xffm**."
msgstr ""
"Mahaigaineko ikonoen euskarria [Thunar](http://thunar.xfce.org/) fitxategi-"
"kudeatzaile berriarekin batera dator; honek aurreko fitxategi-kudeatzailea, "
"**Xffm**, ordezten du."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:25
msgid "![Thunar File Manager][img-thunar]"
msgstr "![Thunar fitxategi-kudeatzailea][img-thunar]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:27
msgid ""
"**Thunar** was written from scratch to provide an easy to use, but still "
"very lightweight file manager for Xfce. Its user interface was designed to "
"look similar to the file chooser which was introduced with GTK+ 2.4, and "
"other file managers such as **Nautilus** and **pcmanfm** already picked up "
"that idea as well."
msgstr ""
"**Thunar** hutsetik idatzi da Xfce-rako fitxategi-kudeatzaile erabilerraza "
"baina oso arina eskaintzeko. Bere erabiltzaile-interfazea GTK+ 2.4rekin "
"sartutako fitxategi-hautatzailearen antzekoa izateko diseinatu zen, eta "
"beste fitxategi-kudeatzaile batzuek, **Nautilus** eta **pcmanfm** kasu, "
"ideia hori hartu dute dagoeneko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:29
msgid ""
"**Thunar** supports all the file management functionality which users will "
"expect, and also several advanced features. For example, a so-called *Bulk "
"Renamer* is included which allows users to rename multiple files at once "
"using a certain criterion."
msgstr ""
"**Thunar**-ek erabiltzaileek espero duten fitxategi-kudeaketako "
"funtzionaltasun guztia onartzen du, baita hainbat ezaugarri aurreratu ere. "
"Adibidez, *Multzoka berrizendatzeko tresna* deritzona dakar, fitxategi anitz"
" aldi berean irizpide jakin baten arabera berrizendatzeko aukera ematen "
"duena."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:31
msgid "![Thunar Bulk Rename][img-thunar-bulk-rename]"
msgstr "![Thunar-en multzoka berrizendatzea][img-thunar-bulk-rename]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:33
msgid "Removable Drives and Media"
msgstr "Unitate eta euskarri aldagarriak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:35
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.4.0 provides easy access to data on removable drives and media. Just "
"insert the media into the drive or plug the new drive in to the computer and"
" an icon representing the removable volume will appear on the desktop and in"
" **Thunar**'s side pane."
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.4.0-k unitate eta euskarri aldagarrietako datuetarako sarbide erraza "
"eskaintzen du. Sartu euskarria unitatean edo konektatu unitate berria "
"ordenagailura, eta bolumen aldagarria adierazten duen ikono bat agertuko da "
"mahaigainean eta **Thunar**-en alboko panelean."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:37
msgid "![Removable Volumes][img-removable-volumes]"
msgstr "![Bolumen aldagarriak][img-removable-volumes]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:39
msgid ""
"Click on the icon to automatically mount the volume. Right-click the icon to"
" unmount the drive or eject the media from the drive. Note however that this"
" feature requires [HAL](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Software_2fhal) and is "
"therefore only available for Linux 2.6.x and FreeBSD 6.x and above at the "
"time of this writing (there is limited removable media support for FreeBSD "
"4.x and 5.x which does not require HAL)."
msgstr ""
"Egin klik ikonoan bolumena automatikoki muntatzeko. Egin eskuineko klik "
"ikonoan unitatea desmuntatzeko edo euskarria unitatetik ateratzeko. Kontuan "
"izan, ordea, ezaugarri honek "
"[HAL](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Software_2fhal) behar duela, eta, beraz, "
"hau idazterakoan Linux 2.6.x eta FreeBSD 6.x eta berriagoetan bakarrik "
"dagoela eskuragarri (FreeBSD 4.x eta 5.x bertsioetarako euskarri aldagarrien"
" euskarri mugatua dago, HAL behar ez duena)."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:41
msgid "Text Editor"
msgstr "Testu-editorea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:43
msgid ""
"The new text editor **MousePad** is included with this release. **MousePad**"
" provides all the basic editor functionality, nothing more, nothing less."
msgstr ""
"Bertsio honek **MousePad** testu-editore berria dakar. **MousePad**-ek "
"editore baten oinarrizko funtzionaltasun guztia eskaintzen du, ez gehiago, "
"ez gutxiago."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:45
msgid "![MousePad][img-mousepad]"
msgstr "![MousePad][img-mousepad]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:47
msgid ""
"You can think of **MousePad** as the equivalent to **NotePad** on Windows. "
"It starts up very fast, usually in less than one second, even on older "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"**MousePad** Windows-eko **NotePad**-en baliokidetzat har dezakezu. Oso "
"azkar abiarazten da, normalean segundo bat baino gutxiagoan, baita sistema "
"zaharragoetan ere."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:51
msgid "**Xfwm4** continues to be the window manager of the hearts."
msgstr "**Xfwm4**-k bihotzetako leiho-kudeatzailea izaten jarraitzen du."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:53
msgid "![Xfwm4 ARGB32][img-xfwm4-argb32]"
msgstr "![Xfwm4 ARGB32][img-xfwm4-argb32]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:55
msgid ""
"This release features an enhanced compositor, supporting transparent ARGB "
"windows, shadows, window frame transparency and much more."
msgstr ""
"Bertsio honek konposatzaile hobetua du, ARGB leiho gardenak, itzalak, leiho-"
"markoen gardentasuna eta askoz gehiago onartzen dituena."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:57
msgid "![Xfwm4 Switcher][img-xfwm4-switcher]"
msgstr "![Xfwm4 aldatzailea][img-xfwm4-switcher]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:59
msgid ""
"**Xfwm4** also includes a brand new application switcher, as shown in the "
"screenshot above, which displays all windows from the current workspace with"
" icons and window titles."
msgstr ""
"**Xfwm4**-k aplikazio-aldatzaile guztiz berri bat ere badakar, goiko "
"pantaila-argazkian ikusten den bezala, uneko laneko areako leiho guztiak "
"ikono eta leiho-tituluekin bistaratzen dituena."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:61
msgid "![Xfwm4 Themes][img-xfwm4-themes]"
msgstr "![Xfwm4 gaiak][img-xfwm4-themes]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:63
msgid ""
"Further on support for multiple image formats for window decoration themes "
"was added, including `PNG`, `GIF` and `SVG` images."
msgstr ""
"Horrez gain, leiho-apaingarrien gaietarako irudi-formatu anitzen euskarria "
"gehitu da, `PNG`, `GIF` eta `SVG` irudiak barne."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:65
msgid "![Xfwm4 Tweaks][img-xfwm4-tweaks]"
msgstr "![Xfwm4 doikuntzak][img-xfwm4-tweaks]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:67
msgid ""
"Advanced controls for the window manager were also added, allowing thorough "
"tweaking of window behavior."
msgstr ""
"Leiho-kudeatzailearen kontrol aurreratuak ere gehitu dira, leihoen portaera "
"sakon doitzeko aukera ematen dutenak."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:71
msgid ""
"The **Xfce4-panel** was completely rewritten for the Xfce 4.4 release. "
"Multiple panels are supported *out of the box* now and can easily be "
"configured using the new **Panel Manager** shown in the screenshot below."
msgstr ""
"**Xfce4-panel** guztiz berridatzi da Xfce 4.4 bertsiorako. Panel anitz "
"onartzen dira orain *berez*, eta erraz konfigura daitezke beheko pantaila-"
"argazkian ikusten den **Panel-kudeatzaile** berriarekin."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:73
msgid "![Panel Manager][img-panel-manager]"
msgstr "![Panel-kudeatzailea][img-panel-manager]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:75
msgid ""
"One of the major problems in previous Xfce releases was that every plugin "
"had to be run in the same process as the panel, and hence every plugin was "
"able to crash the whole panel. To address this issue, support for external "
"plugins was added to the panel."
msgstr ""
"Xfce-ren aurreko bertsioetako arazo nagusietako bat zen plugin bakoitza "
"panelaren prozesu berean exekutatu behar zela, eta, beraz, edozein pluginek "
"panel osoa kraska zezakeela. Arazo horri aurre egiteko, kanpoko pluginen "
"euskarria gehitu zaio panelari."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:77
msgid "![Panel Add Item Dialog][img-panel-additem]"
msgstr "![Panelaren Gehitu elementua elkarrizketa][img-panel-additem]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:79
msgid ""
"Developers of panel plugins can now decide whether the plugin should run as "
"external process or as part of the panel process, depending on the stability"
" of the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Panel-pluginen garatzaileek orain erabaki dezakete plugina kanpoko prozesu "
"gisa ala panelaren prozesuaren parte gisa exekutatu behar den, pluginaren "
"egonkortasunaren arabera."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:81
msgid "![Panel Icon Box Plugin][img-panel-iconbox]"
msgstr "![Panelaren ikono-kutxaren plugina][img-panel-iconbox]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:83
msgid ""
"Since there is now support for multiple panels, the separate **Xftaskbar4** "
"and **Xfce4-iconbox** utilities are no longer required. Instead, both the "
"taskbar and the iconbox are available as panel plugins now."
msgstr ""
"Orain panel anitz onartzen direnez, **Xftaskbar4** eta **Xfce4-iconbox** "
"tresna bereiziak ez dira jada beharrezkoak. Horren ordez, ataza-barra eta "
"ikono-kutxa panel-plugin gisa daude eskuragarri orain."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:85
msgid ""
"Most of the additional panel plugins, available via the [Xfce Goodies "
"Project](https://goodies.xfce.org/), have been updated for the new panel, "
"and several new plugins were added. For example, the brand new "
"**xfce4-xfapplet-plugin** allows users to add GNOME panel applets to the "
"Xfce panel."
msgstr ""
"[Xfce Goodies proiektuaren](https://goodies.xfce.org/) bidez eskuragarri "
"dauden panel-plugin gehigarri gehienak panel berrirako eguneratu dira, eta "
"hainbat plugin berri gehitu dira. Adibidez, **xfce4-xfapplet-plugin** guztiz"
" berriak GNOME panelaren appletak Xfce panelera gehitzeko aukera ematen die "
"erabiltzaileei."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:87
msgid "Time Management"
msgstr "Denboraren kudeaketa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:89
msgid ""
"The new time management application **Orage** replaces the **Xfcalendar**, "
"which was introduced with Xfce 4.2.0. **Orage** provides several features to"
" efficiently manage your time."
msgstr ""
"Denbora kudeatzeko **Orage** aplikazio berriak **Xfcalendar** ordezten du, "
"Xfce 4.2.0rekin sartu zena. **Orage**-k zure denbora modu eraginkorrean "
"kudeatzeko hainbat ezaugarri eskaintzen ditu."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:91
msgid "![Orage][img-orage]"
msgstr "![Orage][img-orage]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:93
msgid ""
"While **Orage** is very lightweight and easy to use, it supports all the "
"important features found in larger calendar applications like **Outlook** or"
" **Evolution**. While **Xfcalendar** used the custom `dbh` format in the "
"past to store your settings, **Orage** is based on `ical` and therefore "
"compatible with other calendar applications."
msgstr ""
"**Orage** oso arina eta erabilerraza den arren, egutegi-aplikazio "
"handiagoetan (**Outlook** edo **Evolution** kasu) aurkitzen diren ezaugarri "
"garrantzitsu guztiak onartzen ditu. **Xfcalendar**-ek iraganean `dbh` "
"formatu pertsonalizatua erabiltzen zuen zure ezarpenak gordetzeko; "
"**Orage**, berriz, `ical`-en oinarritzen da, eta, beraz, beste egutegi-"
"aplikazio batzuekin bateragarria da."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:95
msgid "Terminal Emulator"
msgstr "Terminal-emuladorea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:97
msgid ""
"While **Terminal** was already available during the 4.2 days, it was not "
"mature enough at that time to be part of the core. With this major release, "
"it was moved into the core desktop."
msgstr ""
"**Terminal** 4.2 garaian ere eskuragarri bazegoen ere, ez zen nahikoa heldua"
" garai hartan muinaren parte izateko. Bertsio nagusi honekin, mahaigainaren "
"muinera eraman da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:99
msgid "![Terminal][img-terminal]"
msgstr "![Terminala][img-terminal]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:101
msgid ""
"Besides the basic features which you might expect from a terminal emulator, "
"it includes some nice additional features, like multiple tabs per window, "
"customizable toolbars and the ability to configure nearly every aspect of "
"the application via *hidden options*. As can be seen in the screenshot "
"above, this release also supports real transparency using **Xfwm4**'s "
"integrated composition manager."
msgstr ""
"Terminal-emulatzaile batetik espero daitezkeen oinarrizko ezaugarriez gain, "
"ezaugarri gehigarri polit batzuk ditu, hala nola leiho bakoitzeko fitxa "
"anitz, tresna-barra pertsonalizagarriak eta aplikazioaren ia alderdi guztiak"
" *aukera ezkutuen* bidez konfiguratzeko gaitasuna. Goiko pantaila-argazkian "
"ikus daitekeen bezala, bertsio honek benetako gardentasuna ere onartzen du, "
"**Xfwm4**-ren konposizio-kudeatzaile integratua erabiliz."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:103
msgid "Printing"
msgstr "Inprimatzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:105
msgid ""
"**Xfprint**, the Xfce printing management application, saw several small "
"improvements with this release. First, the `a2ps` converter is not mandatory"
" anymore, whilst still recommended. Support for `CUPS` 1.2 was added and "
"**Xfprint** is now able to display the printer state with the "
"`CUPS`-backend."
msgstr ""
"**Xfprint**-ek, Xfce-ren inprimatzea kudeatzeko aplikazioak, hobekuntza "
"txiki batzuk izan ditu bertsio honetan. Lehenik, `a2ps` bihurtzailea jada ez"
" da derrigorrezkoa, gomendagarria bada ere. `CUPS` 1.2-rako euskarria gehitu"
" da, eta **Xfprint**-ek inprimagailuaren egoera bistara dezake orain `CUPS` "
"motorrarekin."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:107
msgid "![Xfce Printing][img-xfprint]"
msgstr "![Xfce inprimatzea][img-xfprint]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:109
msgid ""
"**Xfprint** also integrates with **MousePad** to provide generic printing "
"support for different kinds of text documents using the `a2ps` converter."
msgstr ""
"**Xfprint** **MousePad**-ekin ere integratzen da, testu-dokumentu mota "
"desberdinetarako inprimatze-euskarri generikoa emateko `a2ps` bihurtzailea "
"erabiliz."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:111
msgid "![Xfce Print Dialog][img-xfprint-dialog]"
msgstr "![Xfce inprimatze-elkarrizketa][img-xfprint-dialog]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:113
msgid ""
"As you can see the print dialog still looks relatively similar to that of "
"Xfce 4.2, but the internal workings of the printing support were improved, "
"especially the `CUPS` support. Besides that, the printing management "
"functionality was moved to a library, so other applications can use the API "
"to access the printer configuration."
msgstr ""
"Ikus dezakezunez, inprimatze-elkarrizketak Xfce 4.2koaren antzeko itxura du "
"oraindik, baina inprimatze-euskarriaren barne-funtzionamendua hobetu da, "
"bereziki `CUPS` euskarria. Horrez gain, inprimatzea kudeatzeko "
"funtzionaltasuna liburutegi batera eraman da, beste aplikazioek APIa erabil "
"dezaten inprimagailuaren konfiguraziora sartzeko."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:115
msgid "Autostart"
msgstr "Abio automatikoa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:117
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.4.0 implements the new [Autostart "
"Specification](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Standards_2fautostart_2dspec) - "
"actually Xfce was the first desktop to implement said feature, but the "
"others were faster to release. ;-)"
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.4.0-k [abio automatikoaren "
"zehaztapen](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Standards_2fautostart_2dspec) "
"berria inplementatzen du; egia esan, Xfce izan zen ezaugarri hori "
"inplementatu zuen lehen mahaigaina, baina besteak azkarragoak izan ziren "
"argitaratzen. ;-)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:119
msgid "![Xfce Autostart Editor][img-autostart]"
msgstr "![Xfce-ren abio automatikoaren editorea][img-autostart]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:121
msgid ""
"The specification consists of two parts, the *Autostart of Applications "
"During Startup*, which is implemented in **xfce4-session** and the "
"*Autostart Of Applications After Mount* which is implemented in [thunar-"
"volman](http://foo-projects.org/~benny/projects/thunar-volman/index.html). "
"This release also includes the **xfce4-autostart-editor**, shown in the "
"screenshot above, which allows users to easily add, remove or disable "
"autostarted applications."
msgstr ""
"Zehaztapenak bi zati ditu: *Aplikazioen abio automatikoa saioa hastean*, "
"**xfce4-session**-en inplementatua, eta *Aplikazioen abio automatikoa "
"muntatu ondoren*, [thunar-volman](http://foo-"
"projects.org/~benny/projects/thunar-volman/index.html)-en inplementatua. "
"Bertsio honek **xfce4-autostart-editor** ere badakar, goiko pantaila-"
"argazkian ikusten dena, automatikoki abiarazten diren aplikazioak erraz "
"gehitu, kendu edo desgaitzeko aukera ematen diena erabiltzaileei."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:125
msgid ""
"This release introduces new options to customize the desktop to your needs. "
"Some examples of new settings dialogs were already shown in the sections "
"above."
msgstr ""
"Bertsio honek aukera berriak dakartza mahaigaina zure beharretara "
"egokitzeko. Ezarpen-elkarrizketa berrien adibide batzuk goiko ataletan "
"erakutsi dira dagoeneko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:127
msgid "![Preferred Applications][img-preferences-applications]"
msgstr "![Aplikazio hobetsiak][img-preferences-applications]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:129
msgid ""
"The preferred applications framework, which was previously only available in"
" **Terminal**, was imported into Xfce, so users no longer need to edit shell"
" profiles to specify which browser and terminal emulator should be used by "
"Xfce applications. The goal was to make it as easy as possible to change an "
"application for a certain category (GNOME users may have already noticed "
"that GNOME adopted this approach, because it is such simple)."
msgstr ""
"Aplikazio hobetsien esparrua, lehen **Terminal**-en bakarrik eskuragarri "
"zegoena, Xfce-ra ekarri da; beraz, erabiltzaileek jada ez dituzte shell-"
"profilak editatu behar Xfce-ren aplikazioek zein nabigatzaile eta terminal-"
"emulatzaile erabili behar duten zehazteko. Helburua kategoria jakin baterako"
" aplikazio bat aldatzea ahalik eta errazena egitea zen (GNOMEren "
"erabiltzaileak ohartuko ziren GNOMEk ikuspegi hau hartu duela, hain baita "
"sinplea)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:131
msgid "![Keyboard Shortcuts][img-preferences-keyboard]"
msgstr "![Laster-teklak][img-preferences-keyboard]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:133
msgid ""
"And then there was the problem with the keyboard shortcuts in Xfce 4.2... "
"Xfce 4.2 limited the number of freely available keyboard shortcuts, while "
"people wanted to assign any number of keyboard shortcuts. With Xfce 4.4 this"
" limitation is history and the application shortcuts are now separated from "
"the window manager shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"Eta gero Xfce 4.2ko laster-teklen arazoa zegoen... Xfce 4.2k mugatu egiten "
"zuen libre zeuden laster-teklen kopurua, eta jendeak nahi adina laster-tekla"
" esleitu nahi zituen. Xfce 4.4rekin muga hori historia da, eta aplikazioen "
"laster-teklak leiho-kudeatzailearen laster-tekletatik bereizita daude orain."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:135
msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "Iritzia"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:137
msgid ""
"Please post comments on this article in my [blog](http://xfce-"
"diary.blogspot.com/2007/01/visual-tour-of-xfce-440.html) and use the "
"[xfce](/community/lists) mailinglist if you have questions about Xfce 4.4.0 "
"or trouble with the installation."
msgstr ""
"Idatzi artikulu honi buruzko iruzkinak nire [blogean](http://xfce-"
"diary.blogspot.com/2007/01/visual-tour-of-xfce-440.html), eta erabili "
"[xfce](/community/lists) posta-zerrenda Xfce 4.4.0-ri buruzko galderarik edo"
" instalazioarekin arazorik baduzu."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:139 content/about/tour46.md:137
msgid "Links"
msgstr "Estekak"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour44.md:141 content/about/tour46.md:139
msgid "[Xfce website](https://xfce.org/)"
msgstr "[Xfce-ren webgunea](https://xfce.org/)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour44.md:142
msgid "[Thunar website](http://thunar.xfce.org/)"
msgstr "[Thunar-en webgunea](http://thunar.xfce.org/)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:146
msgid "Written by Benedikt Meurer, 21 Jan 2007"
msgstr "Benedikt Meurer-ek idatzia, 2007ko urtarrilak 21ean"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour46.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.6 tour"
msgstr "Xfce 4.6 bira"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:7
msgid ""
"The long awaited 4.6.0 version of the Xfce Desktop Environment is finally "
"available. We will try to highlight some of the new features which have been"
" added since the last stable release."
msgstr ""
"Hainbeste itxarondako Xfce mahaigain-ingurunearen 4.6.0 bertsioa eskuragarri"
" dago azkenean. Azken bertsio egonkorretik gehitu diren ezaugarri berri "
"batzuk nabarmentzen saiatuko gara."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:11
msgid ""
"Since desktop icons have been introduced in Xfce 4.4, people have expressed "
"the need to allow the selection of multiple icons (rubber banding). With "
"**Xfce 4.6**, the **Xfdesktop** manager finally implements this feature: you"
" can select multiple icons, remove them, etcetera..."
msgstr ""
"Mahaigaineko ikonoak Xfce 4.4an sartu zirenetik, jendeak ikono anitz "
"hautatzeko aukeraren beharra adierazi du (laukizuzen bidezko hautapena). "
"**Xfce 4.6**-rekin, **Xfdesktop** kudeatzaileak azkenean ezaugarri hori "
"inplementatzen du: ikono anitz hauta ditzakezu, kendu, etab..."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:13
msgid "![Multiple icons selection][img-xfdesktop-rubberbanding]"
msgstr "![Ikono anitzen hautapena][img-xfdesktop-rubberbanding]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:15
msgid ""
"**Xfce 4.6** features a brand new desktop menu which allows you to "
"manipulate files as with the **Thunar** filemanager contextual menu, but "
"also to open applications, exit your session, or access the help "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"**Xfce 4.6**-k mahaigain-menu guztiz berria du; **Thunar** fitxategi-"
"kudeatzailearen laster-menuarekin bezala fitxategiak maneiatzeko aukera "
"ematen du, baina baita aplikazioak irekitzeko, saioa ixteko edo laguntza-"
"dokumentaziora sartzeko ere."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:17
msgid "![New desktop menu][img-xfdesktop-menu]"
msgstr "![Mahaigain-menu berria][img-xfdesktop-menu]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:21
msgid ""
"A lot of long standing bugs have been fixed in **Xfce4 Panel**, particularly"
" for multiple screen setups, but this new release also brings an improved "
"set of panel plugins."
msgstr ""
"Aspaldiko akats asko konpondu dira **Xfce4 Panel**-ean, bereziki pantaila "
"anitzeko konfigurazioetan, baina bertsio berri honek panel-plugin multzo "
"hobetua ere badakar."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:23
msgid "![New binary clock][img-xfce4-panel-clock]"
msgstr "![Erloju bitar berria][img-xfce4-panel-clock]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:25
msgid ""
"The **clock plugin** has been rewritten to consume fewer system resources "
"and to fix some display bugs, but there is also a new clock mode for the "
"geek in you: binary clock! The new **notification area plugin** allows you "
"to hide selected notification icons to keep your notification area clean and"
" readable."
msgstr ""
"**Erlojuaren plugina** berridatzi egin da sistemaren baliabide gutxiago "
"kontsumitzeko eta bistaratze-akats batzuk konpontzeko, baina zure barneko "
"frikiarentzako erloju-modu berri bat ere badago: erloju bitarra! "
"**Jakinarazpen-arearen plugin** berriak jakinarazpen-ikono hautatuak "
"ezkutatzeko aukera ematen dizu, zure jakinarazpen-area garbi eta irakurgarri"
" mantentzeko."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour46.md:27
msgid "Sound Mixer *(xfce4-mixer)*"
msgstr "Soinu-nahasgailua *(xfce4-mixer)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:29
msgid ""
"**Xfce4 Mixer** has been rewritten from scratch to use "
"[Gstreamer](https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/). This allows us to more "
"easily support multiple sound systems, the user interface is more polished, "
"and you can manage several different sound cards. Additionally, a panel "
"plugin allows you to set the system sound quickly using the mouse scroll "
"wheel."
msgstr ""
"**Xfce4 Mixer** hutsetik berridatzi da "
"[Gstreamer](https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/) erabiltzeko. Horri esker, "
"errazago onar ditzakegu soinu-sistema anitz, erabiltzaile-interfazea "
"txukunagoa da, eta hainbat soinu-txartel desberdin kudea ditzakezu. Gainera,"
" panel-plugin batek sistemaren soinua azkar ezartzeko aukera ematen dizu "
"saguaren gurpila erabiliz."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:31
msgid "![New sound mixer][img-xfce4-mixer]"
msgstr "![Soinu-nahasgailu berria][img-xfce4-mixer]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:35
msgid ""
"**Xfce 4.6** comes with an enhanced session manager: your session should be "
"started faster, and the settings dialog has been reworked to ease the "
"management of session-aware applications. Additionally, the session manager "
"will now automatically restart session applications which crashed so that "
"you are not left without a desktop, panel, window manager, etcetera, if a "
"crash occurs."
msgstr ""
"**Xfce 4.6**-k saio-kudeatzaile hobetua dakar: zure saioa azkarrago abiarazi"
" beharko litzateke, eta ezarpen-elkarrizketa berrantolatu egin da saioaz "
"jabetzen diren aplikazioen kudeaketa errazteko. Gainera, saio-kudeatzaileak "
"automatikoki berrabiaraziko ditu kraskatu diren saioko aplikazioak, "
"kraskadura bat gertatzen bada mahaigainik, panelik, leiho-kudeatzailerik, "
"etab. gabe gera ez zaitezen."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:37
msgid "![Session settings dialog][img-xfce4-session-settings]"
msgstr "![Saioaren ezarpen-elkarrizketa][img-xfce4-session-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:39
msgid ""
"The session manager also includes a new long-awaited feature: support for "
"**suspend** and **hibernate** \"out of the box.\" The logout dialog now has "
"two additional buttons which offer to suspend or hibernate your computer."
msgstr ""
"Saio-kudeatzaileak aspalditik itxarondako ezaugarri berri bat ere badu: "
"**etetea** eta **hibernatzea** berez onartzen dira. Saio-ixteko "
"elkarrizketak bi botoi gehigarri ditu orain, ordenagailua eteteko edo "
"hibernatzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:41
msgid "![Session logout dialog][img-xfce4-session-logout]"
msgstr "![Saio-ixteko elkarrizketa][img-xfce4-session-logout]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:45
msgid ""
"As usual, **Xfwm4** has matured quite a bit during this release cycle: many "
"bugs have been fixed, support for multiple displays has been added, and "
"overall performance has been improved."
msgstr ""
"Ohi bezala, **Xfwm4** dezente heldu da argitalpen-ziklo honetan: akats asko "
"konpondu dira, pantaila anitzen euskarria gehitu da, eta errendimendu "
"orokorra hobetu da."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:47
msgid ""
"In addition to some other new features, **Xfwm4** is now able to detect "
"windows that do not respond and offer to terminate them."
msgstr ""
"Beste ezaugarri berri batzuez gain, **Xfwm4**-k erantzuten ez duten leihoak "
"detekta ditzake orain, eta haiek amaitzea eskaintzen du."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:49
msgid "![Dialog to terminate busy applications][img-xfwm4-net-ping]"
msgstr ""
"![Lanpetuta dauden aplikazioak amaitzeko elkarrizketa][img-xfwm4-net-ping]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:51
msgid ""
"There is also a new **actions menu** which allows you to quickly move and "
"resize windows, put them above or below other windows, or fullscreen them."
msgstr ""
"**Ekintzen menu** berri bat ere badago, leihoak azkar mugitu eta tamainaz "
"aldatzeko, beste leihoen gainean edo azpian jartzeko, edo pantaila osoan "
"jartzeko aukera ematen duena."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:53
msgid "![New actions menu][img-xfwm4-new-menu]"
msgstr "![Ekintzen menu berria][img-xfwm4-new-menu]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:55
msgid ""
"A new **fill** operation has been implemented; it expands a given window to "
"the available space without overlapping other adjacent windows."
msgstr ""
"**Bete** eragiketa berri bat inplementatu da: leiho jakin bat eskuragarri "
"dagoen lekura zabaltzen du, ondoko beste leihoen gainean jarri gabe."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:57
msgid "![Fill operation][img-xfwm4-fill-operation]"
msgstr "![Bete eragiketa][img-xfwm4-fill-operation]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:59
msgid ""
"The **compositor** has been optimized to reduce window flickering during "
"resize operations."
msgstr ""
"**Konposatzailea** optimizatu egin da tamaina aldatzeko eragiketetan leihoen"
" dir-dira murrizteko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:61
msgid "![Flicker free resizing][img-xfwm4-resize]"
msgstr "![Dir-dirarik gabeko tamaina-aldaketa][img-xfwm4-resize]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:63
msgid ""
"Some **tweakable options** have also been added: for example, you can now "
"disable the blinking of windows when they receive an urgency hint."
msgstr ""
"**Aukera doigarri** batzuk ere gehitu dira: adibidez, orain desgaitu egin "
"dezakezu leihoen keinukatzea premia-iradokizun bat jasotzen dutenean."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:65
msgid "![New tweakable options][img-xfwm4-new-tweaks]"
msgstr "![Aukera doigarri berriak][img-xfwm4-new-tweaks]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:69
msgid ""
"There have been many bug fixes and performance improvements in **Thunar**. "
"It can use the mouse forward and backward buttons (if available) to "
"navigate, and it includes a new plugin that allows you to set an image as "
"wallpaper from the context menu."
msgstr ""
"Akats-zuzenketa eta errendimendu-hobekuntza ugari egin dira **Thunar**-en. "
"Saguaren aurrera eta atzera botoiak erabil ditzake (eskuragarri badaude) "
"nabigatzeko, eta plugin berri bat dakar irudi bat horma-paper gisa laster-"
"menutik ezartzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:71
msgid ""
"![Set an image in a Thunar folder as wallpaper][img-thunar-wallpaper-plugin]"
msgstr ""
"![Ezarri Thunar karpeta bateko irudi bat horma-paper gisa][img-thunar-"
"wallpaper-plugin]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:73
msgid ""
"**Thunar** now follows the [XDG user "
"directories](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/xdg-user-dirs) "
"specification; this allows you to have themed and localized user folders to "
"store your music, documents, videos, templates, etcetera..."
msgstr ""
"**Thunar**-ek orain [XDG erabiltzaile-"
"direktorioen](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/xdg-user-dirs) "
"zehaztapena jarraitzen du; horri esker, gaidun eta lokalizatutako "
"erabiltzaile-karpetak izan ditzakezu zure musika, dokumentuak, bideoak, "
"txantiloiak, etab. gordetzeko..."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:75
msgid "![Thunar menu for user directories][img-thunar-xdg-user-dirs]"
msgstr ""
"![Erabiltzaile-direktorioetarako Thunar-en menua][img-thunar-xdg-user-dirs]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:77
msgid ""
"**Thunar** will now display a translucent icon for drives or volumes that "
"are not mounted, so that you can distinguish them from the mounted ones."
msgstr ""
"**Thunar**-ek ikono zeharrargitsu bat bistaratuko du orain muntatuta ez "
"dauden unitate edo bolumenetarako, muntatuta daudenetatik bereizi ahal "
"izateko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:79
msgid ""
"![Translucent icons for unmounted drives and volumes][img-thunar-mounting]"
msgstr ""
"![Ikono zeharrargitsuak muntatu gabeko unitate eta bolumenetarako][img-"
"thunar-mounting]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:81
msgid "Last, but not least, **Thunar** now supports encrypted devices!"
msgstr ""
"Azkenik, baina ez horregatik garrantzi gutxiagokoa, **Thunar**-ek gailu "
"zifratuak onartzen ditu orain!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:83
msgid "![Thunar support for encrypted devices][img-thunar-encrypted]"
msgstr "![Thunar-en gailu zifratuen euskarria][img-thunar-encrypted]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:87
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.6 features a new settings interface, **Xfce Settings Manager**, which"
" allows you to configure your desktop environment much more easily than "
"before. The dialogs which are accessible by single clicking on the icons "
"have been designed to be more compact and to allow you to customize your "
"desktop quickly and in a more intuitive way."
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.6-k ezarpen-interfaze berri bat du, **Xfce ezarpen-kudeatzailea**, "
"zure mahaigain-ingurunea lehen baino askoz errazago konfiguratzeko aukera "
"ematen duena. Ikonoetan klik bakarra eginez atzi daitezkeen elkarrizketak "
"trinkoagoak izateko eta zure mahaigaina azkar eta modu intuitiboagoan "
"pertsonalizatzeko diseinatu dira."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:89
msgid "![Xfce4 Settings Manager][img-xfce4-settings-manager]"
msgstr "![Xfce4 ezarpen-kudeatzailea][img-xfce4-settings-manager]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:91
msgid "Accessibility settings"
msgstr "Irisgarritasun-ezarpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:93
msgid "![Accessibility settings dialog][img-xfce4-accessibility-settings]"
msgstr ""
"![Irisgarritasun-ezarpenen elkarrizketa][img-xfce4-accessibility-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:95
msgid ""
"The **Accessibility settings** dialog allows you to set the accessibility "
"related mouse and keyboard options, such as sticky keys, bounce keys, or "
"mouse emulation."
msgstr ""
"**Irisgarritasun-ezarpenen** elkarrizketak irisgarritasunarekin lotutako "
"saguaren eta teklatuaren aukerak ezartzeko aukera ematen dizu, hala nola "
"tekla itsaskorrak, errebote-teklak edo saguaren emulazioa."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:97
msgid "Appearance settings"
msgstr "Itxuraren ezarpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:99
msgid "![Appearance settings dialog][img-xfce4-appearance-settings]"
msgstr "![Itxuraren ezarpenen elkarrizketa][img-xfce4-appearance-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:101
msgid ""
"The **Appearance settings** dialog allows you to set the widget style, the "
"icon theme, and font, toolbar and menu options."
msgstr ""
"**Itxuraren ezarpenen** elkarrizketak trepeten estiloa, ikono-gaia eta "
"letra-tipoa, tresna-barraren eta menuen aukerak ezartzeko aukera ematen "
"dizu."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:103
msgid "Display settings"
msgstr "Pantailaren ezarpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:105
msgid "![Display settings dialog][img-xfce4-display-settings]"
msgstr "![Pantailaren ezarpenen elkarrizketa][img-xfce4-display-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:107
msgid ""
"The **Display settings** dialog allows you to set the resolution, refresh "
"rate, and the rotation for each screen that is connected."
msgstr ""
"**Pantailaren ezarpenen** elkarrizketak konektatutako pantaila bakoitzaren "
"bereizmena, freskatze-maiztasuna eta biraketa ezartzeko aukera ematen dizu."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:109
msgid "Keyboard settings"
msgstr "Teklatu ezarpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:111
msgid ""
"![Keyboard settings dialog, layout tab][img-xfce4-keyboard-settings-layout]"
msgstr ""
"![Teklatuaren ezarpenen elkarrizketa, diseinuaren fitxa][img-xfce4-keyboard-"
"settings-layout]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:113
msgid ""
"The **Keyboard settings** dialog allows you to set keyboard preferences such"
" as key repeating, keyboard shortcuts, and your keyboard layout."
msgstr ""
"**Teklatuaren ezarpenen** elkarrizketak teklatuaren hobespenak ezartzeko "
"aukera ematen dizu, hala nola teklen errepikapena, laster-teklak eta zure "
"teklatuaren diseinua."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:115
msgid ""
"![Keyboard settings dialog, shortcuts tab][img-xfce4-keyboard-settings-"
"shortcuts]"
msgstr ""
"![Teklatuaren ezarpenen elkarrizketa, laster-teklen fitxa][img-"
"xfce4-keyboard-settings-shortcuts]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:117
msgid ""
"You can now configure shortcuts more simply, and any shortcut conflicts are "
"automatically detected."
msgstr ""
"Orain laster-teklak errazago konfigura ditzakezu, eta laster-teklen arteko "
"gatazkak automatikoki detektatzen dira."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:119
msgid "Mouse settings"
msgstr "Sagu ezarpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:121
msgid "![Mouse settings dialog][img-xfce4-mouse-settings]"
msgstr "![Saguaren ezarpenen elkarrizketa][img-xfce4-mouse-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:123
msgid ""
"The **Mouse settings** dialog allows you to configure the different mice "
"connected to your computer: button order, acceleration, double-click speed, "
"mouse cursor theme, etcetera..."
msgstr ""
"**Saguaren ezarpenen** elkarrizketak zure ordenagailura konektatutako sagu "
"desberdinak konfiguratzeko aukera ematen dizu: botoien ordena, azelerazioa, "
"klik bikoitzaren abiadura, saguaren kurtsorearen gaia, etab..."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:125
msgid "Desktop settings"
msgstr "Mahaiganaren ezarpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:127
msgid "![Desktop settings dialog][img-xfdesktop-settings]"
msgstr "![Mahaigainaren ezarpenen elkarrizketa][img-xfdesktop-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:129
msgid ""
"The **Desktop settings** dialog is now much more compact; it allows you to "
"configure per-screen settings: wallpaper, brightness, desktop menu, "
"displayed icons, etcetera..."
msgstr ""
"**Mahaigainaren ezarpenen** elkarrizketa askoz trinkoagoa da orain; pantaila"
" bakoitzeko ezarpenak konfiguratzeko aukera ematen dizu: horma-papera, "
"distira, mahaigain-menua, bistaratutako ikonoak, etab..."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:133
msgid ""
"**Xfce 4.6** also comes with a brand new application finder which features a"
" cleaner user interface. It is also easier to use it with the keyboard, and "
"it monitors installed applications to update the list \"on the fly.\" It "
"also allows you to create panel launchers quickly by dragging an application"
" icon to the launcher creation window."
msgstr ""
"**Xfce 4.6**-k aplikazio-bilatzaile guztiz berri bat ere badakar, "
"erabiltzaile-interfaze garbiagoarekin. Teklatuarekin erabiltzea ere "
"errazagoa da, eta instalatutako aplikazioak monitorizatzen ditu zerrenda "
"\"berehala\" eguneratzeko. Gainera, panel-abiarazleak azkar sortzeko aukera "
"ematen du, aplikazio baten ikonoa abiarazleak sortzeko leihora arrastatuz."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:135
msgid "![New application finder][img-xfce4-appfinder]"
msgstr "![Aplikazio-bilatzaile berria][img-xfce4-appfinder]"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour46.md:140
msgid "[Thunar website](https://xfce.org/projects/thunar)"
msgstr "[Thunar-en webgunea](https://xfce.org/projects/thunar)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour46.md:144
msgid "Written by Jérôme Guelfucci (February 2009)"
msgstr "Jérôme Guelfucci-ek idatzia (2009 Otsaila)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour46.md:145
msgid "Screenshots by Jannis Pohlmann"
msgstr "Pantaila-argazkien egilea Jannis Pohlmann da"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour48.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.8 tour"
msgstr "Xfce 4.8 bira"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to all the new major visual features in Xfce "
"4.8. This is only the visual part of what has been done; for a full list of "
"changes, see the [changelogs](/download/changelogs/)."
msgstr ""
"Bisita gidatu honek Xfce 4.8-ren ezaugarri bisual berri nagusi guztiak "
"aurkeztuko dizkizu. Egindakoaren alderdi bisuala baino ez da; aldaketen "
"zerrenda osorako, ikusi [aldaketa-logak](/download/changelogs/)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:11
msgid "Remote shares browsing"
msgstr "Urruneko partekatzeak arakatzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:13
msgid ""
"Thunar now has optional support for GVFS which will allow you to browse "
"remote shares using Thunar: FTP, Windows Shares, WebDav and SSH servers..."
msgstr ""
"Thunar-ek GVFSrako euskarri hautazkoa du orain, urruneko partekatzeak "
"Thunar-ekin arakatzeko aukera emango dizuna: FTP, Windows-eko partekatzeak, "
"WebDav eta SSH zerbitzariak..."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:15
msgid "![Thunar browsing a remote share][img-thunar-remote]"
msgstr "![Thunar urruneko partekatze bat arakatzen][img-thunar-remote]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:17
msgid "New file operations progress dialog"
msgstr "Fitxategi-eragiketen aurrerapen-elkarrizketa berria"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:19
msgid ""
"When several file operations (copy or move) are being handled in parallel, "
"Thunar now shows a single progress dialog which displays all the relevant "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategi-eragiketa anitz (kopiatu edo lekualdatu) paraleloan kudeatzen ari "
"direnean, Thunar-ek aurrerapen-elkarrizketa bakarra erakusten du orain, "
"dagokion informazio guztiarekin."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:21
msgid "![Progress dialog][img-thunar-progress]"
msgstr "![Aurrerapen-elkarrizketa][img-thunar-progress]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:23
msgid "Eject button for removable devices"
msgstr "Gailu aldagarrietarako egotzi-botoia"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:25
msgid ""
"It is is now possible to eject removable devices by clicking the eject "
"button near each removable device label in the side pane."
msgstr ""
"Orain gailu aldagarriak egotz daitezke, alboko panelean gailu aldagarri "
"bakoitzaren etiketaren ondoan dagoen egotzi-botoian klik eginez."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:27
msgid "![Eject button][img-thunar-eject]"
msgstr "![Egotzi-botoia][img-thunar-eject]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:31
msgid ""
"The Xfce panel has been totally rewritten in 4.8, here are the most visible "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Xfce panela guztiz berridatzi da 4.8an; hona hemen aldaketa ikusgarrienak."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:33
msgid "Improved positioning and size handling"
msgstr "Kokapenaren eta tamainaren kudeaketa hobetua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:35
msgid ""
"The panel has much better support for positioning panels on the screen. It "
"can be dragged and snapped to screen borders; floating positions are only "
"remembered when moving a panel and the length of the panel can be adjusted "
"as a percentage of the monitor size."
msgstr ""
"Panelak askoz euskarri hobea du panelak pantailan kokatzeko. Arrastatu eta "
"pantailaren ertzetara atxiki daiteke; posizio flotatzaileak panel bat "
"mugitzean bakarrik gogoratzen dira, eta panelaren luzera monitorearen "
"tamainaren ehuneko gisa doi daiteke."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:37
msgid "Transparent backgrounds"
msgstr "Atzeko plano gardenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:39
msgid ""
"The panel is now able to draw transparent panel backgrounds with non "
"transparent items. Your panel items will remain readable and you will enjoy "
"a nice panel look."
msgstr ""
"Panelak orain panelaren atzeko plano gardenak marraz ditzake, elementuak "
"garden jarri gabe. Zure paneleko elementuak irakurgarri geratuko dira, eta "
"panelaren itxura politaz gozatuko duzu."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:41
msgid "![Transparent panel background][img-panel-transparent]"
msgstr "![Panelaren atzeko plano gardena][img-panel-transparent]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:43
msgid "New item editor"
msgstr "Elementu-editore berria"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:45
msgid ""
"The panel now features an item editor which allows to modify, move, add and "
"remove items quickly. This is particularly useful for items which are hard "
"to right click and gives you an easy way to change your panel layout from a "
"single place."
msgstr ""
"Panelak elementu-editore bat du orain, elementuak azkar aldatu, mugitu, "
"gehitu eta kentzeko aukera ematen duena. Hori bereziki erabilgarria da "
"eskuineko klik egiteko zailak diren elementuetarako, eta zure panelaren "
"diseinua leku bakar batetik aldatzeko modu erraza ematen dizu."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:47
msgid "![Panel item editor][img-panel-editor]"
msgstr "![Panelaren elementu-editorea][img-panel-editor]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:49
msgid "Drag and drop to create launchers"
msgstr "Arrastatu eta jaregin abiarazleak sortzeko"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:51
msgid ""
"You can now drag and drop menu entries from the panel applications menu, "
"application finder or Thunar to the panel to create launchers. This feature "
"should please the huge number of people who had been requesting it for ages."
" The launcher also has an integrated application finder to add new items."
msgstr ""
"Orain menu-sarrerak arrastatu eta jaregin ditzakezu paneleko aplikazioen "
"menutik, aplikazio-bilatzailetik edo Thunar-etik panelera, abiarazleak "
"sortzeko. Ezaugarri honek aspalditik eskatzen zuten pertsona ugari poztu "
"beharko lituzke. Abiarazleak aplikazio-bilatzaile integratu bat ere badu "
"elementu berriak gehitzeko."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:53
msgid "Window buttons plugin"
msgstr "Leiho-botoien plugina"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:55
msgid ""
"The iconbox and tasklist plugins are new merged into 1 plugin, called window"
" buttons. It implements different sorting modes, improved handling in "
"vertical panels and can draw a similar frame as Xfwm4 Alt+tab when hovering "
"a button."
msgstr ""
"Ikono-kutxaren eta ataza-zerrendaren pluginak plugin bakar batean bateratu "
"dira orain, leiho-botoiak izenekoan. Ordenatzeko modu desberdinak "
"inplementatzen ditu, panel bertikaletan kudeaketa hobea du, eta botoi baten "
"gainetik pasatzean Xfwm4-ren Alt+tab-en antzeko marko bat marraz dezake."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:57
msgid "New fuzzy clock"
msgstr "Erloju lauso berria"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:59
msgid ""
"An Xfce release without a new clock mode would not be a true Xfce release. "
"Let us introduce you the 'fuzzy' clock mode!"
msgstr ""
"Erloju-modu berririk gabeko Xfce bertsio bat ez litzateke benetako Xfce "
"bertsioa izango. Utziguzu 'lauso' erloju-modua aurkezten!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:61
msgid "![New fuzzy clock mode][img-panel-fuzzy-clock]"
msgstr "![Erloju-modu lauso berria][img-panel-fuzzy-clock]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:63
msgid "New directory menu plugin"
msgstr "Direktorio-menuaren plugin berria"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:65
msgid ""
"The directory menu plugin provides a menu reproducing the arborescence of a "
"particular folder. This allows you to open a terminal or a file manager in a"
" sub-folder in a very fast and efficient way."
msgstr ""
"Direktorio-menuaren pluginak karpeta jakin baten zuhaitz-egitura "
"erreproduzitzen duen menu bat eskaintzen du. Horri esker, terminal bat edo "
"fitxategi-kudeatzaile bat azpikarpeta batean ireki dezakezu oso modu azkar "
"eta eraginkorrean."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:67
msgid "![Directory menu plugin][img-panel-directorymenu]"
msgstr "![Direktorio-menuaren plugina][img-panel-directorymenu]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:69
msgid "Applications menu edition"
msgstr "Aplikazioen menua editatzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:71
msgid ""
"You can now edit the applications menu using any Freedesktop compliant menu "
"editor, Alacarte being the one we used to test."
msgstr ""
"Orain aplikazioen menua Freedesktop-ekin bateragarria den edozein menu-"
"editorerekin edita dezakezu; probatzeko erabili duguna Alacarte da."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:75
msgid "Improved multihead setup configuration"
msgstr "Pantaila anitzeko konfigurazio hobetua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:77
msgid ""
"Xfce can now handle and setup multihead setups for any randr 1.2 compatible "
"driver. Unfortunately, this means it will not work with Nvidia proprietary "
"drivers."
msgstr ""
"Xfce-k orain randr 1.2-rekin bateragarria den edozein kontrolatzailerako "
"pantaila anitzeko konfigurazioak kudeatu eta ezar ditzake. Zoritxarrez, "
"horrek esan nahi du ez duela funtzionatuko Nvidiaren kontrolatzaile "
"jabedunekin."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:79
msgid ""
"You can enable and disable plugged screens, set their resolution, refresh "
"rate, rotation and reflection, clone screens or extend desktops."
msgstr ""
"Konektatutako pantailak gaitu eta desgaitu ditzakezu, haien bereizmena, "
"freskatze-maiztasuna, biraketa eta isladapena ezarri, pantailak klonatu edo "
"mahaigainak hedatu."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:81
msgid "![New display settings dialog][img-display-settings]"
msgstr "![Pantailaren ezarpenen elkarrizketa berria][img-display-settings]"

#. type: Title ####
#: content/about/tour48.md:83
msgid "Timed confirmation"
msgstr "Denbora-mugadun berrespena"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:85
msgid ""
"Any change made with the settings dialog will have to be confirmed within "
"ten seconds or they will be reverted. This prevents broken video drivers "
"from leaving your computer unusable."
msgstr ""
"Ezarpen-elkarrizketarekin egindako edozein aldaketa hamar segundoren buruan "
"berretsi beharko da, bestela desegin egingo da. Horrela, bideo-"
"kontrolatzaile hondatuek ez dute zure ordenagailua erabilezin uzten."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:87
msgid ""
"![Timed confirmation for display settings changes][img-display-settings-"
"confirmation]"
msgstr ""
"![Pantailaren ezarpenen aldaketetarako denbora-mugadun berrespena][img-"
"display-settings-confirmation]"

#. type: Title ####
#: content/about/tour48.md:89
msgid "Quick setup dialog"
msgstr "Konfigurazio azkarreko elkarrizketa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:91
msgid ""
"The quick setup dialog allows you to configure a dual screen setup in a "
"second. Plug the second screen, press the display key or Windows + p and "
"select the wanted layout. Done!"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurazio azkarreko elkarrizketak bi pantailako konfigurazio bat segundo "
"batean ezartzeko aukera ematen dizu. Konektatu bigarren pantaila, sakatu "
"pantaila-tekla edo Windows + p, eta hautatu nahi duzun diseinua. Eginda!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:93
msgid "![Quick multihead setup][img-minimal-display-settings]"
msgstr ""
"![Pantaila anitzeko konfigurazio azkarra][img-minimal-display-settings]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:95
msgid "Settings edition in the Xfce Settings Editor"
msgstr "Ezarpenak editatzea Xfce ezarpen-editorean"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:97
msgid ""
"The Xfce Settings Editor now deserves its name, it is no longer a simpler "
"Xfconf settings viewer. You can now modify, delete, add and reset settings "
"through its interface. It also monitors changes to update its view."
msgstr ""
"Xfce ezarpen-editoreak bere izena merezi du orain: jada ez da Xfconf "
"ezarpenen ikustaile soil bat. Orain ezarpenak aldatu, ezabatu, gehitu eta "
"berrezarri ditzakezu bere interfazearen bidez. Aldaketak ere monitorizatzen "
"ditu bere ikuspegia eguneratzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:99
msgid ""
"![Editing Xfconf properties with the Settings Editor][img-settings-editor]"
msgstr ""
"![Xfconf propietateak ezarpen-editorearekin editatzen][img-settings-editor]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:101
msgid "Improved keyboard layout selection"
msgstr "Teklatu-diseinuaren hautapen hobetua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:103
msgid ""
"The layout selection dialog received a lot of love: it no longer displays "
"cryptic language/variants codes but uses localized languages/variants names."
" Layout edition was also made easier by prefilling the dialogs with the "
"current values."
msgstr ""
"Diseinua hautatzeko elkarrizketak arreta handia jaso du: jada ez ditu "
"hizkuntza/aldaeren kode kriptikoak bistaratzen, hizkuntza/aldaeren izen "
"lokalizatuak baizik. Diseinuak editatzea ere erraztu egin da, elkarrizketak "
"uneko balioekin aurrez betez."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:105
msgid "![Layouts and variants list][img-keyboard-settings-list]"
msgstr "![Diseinuen eta aldaeren zerrenda][img-keyboard-settings-list]"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/community/_index.md:0
msgid "Community"
msgstr "Komunitatea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:6
msgid ""
"Whether it be to solve a problem or to contribute in any way, the Xfce "
"communities are a good place to get help or to share your ideas. You might "
"also want to have a look at the communities of the different distributions "
"which provide Xfce."
msgstr ""
"Arazo bat konpontzeko izan edo edozein modutan laguntzeko izan, Xfce-ren "
"komunitateak leku ona dira laguntza lortzeko edo zure ideiak partekatzeko. "
"Xfce eskaintzen duten banaketa desberdinen komunitateei ere begiratu bat "
"eman diezaiekezu."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:8
msgid "Mailing lists"
msgstr "Posta-zerrendak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:10
msgid ""
"Almost all development and coordination work is taking place on the Xfce "
"mailing lists. A summary of all lists is available at "
"[mail.xfce.org](https://mail.xfce.org). There is also a user-specific list "
"where you can ask questions and freely discuss about the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Garapen- eta koordinazio-lan ia guztia Xfce-ren posta-zerrendetan egiten da."
" Zerrenda guztien laburpena [mail.xfce.org](https://mail.xfce.org) helbidean"
" dago eskuragarri. Erabiltzaileentzako zerrenda berezi bat ere badago, non "
"galderak egin eta mahaigainari buruz libreki eztabaida dezakezun."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:12
msgid "**NOTE:** In order to post to these lists, you must first subscribe."
msgstr ""
"**OHARRA:** zerrenda hauetara idazteko, lehenik harpidetu egin behar duzu."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:14
msgid "Matrix"
msgstr "Matrix"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:16
msgid ""
"If you have a problem that you cannot resolve, you might want to try asking "
"a question in our Matrix channel "
"[#xfce](https://matrix.to/#/#xfce:matrix.org). The channel has several "
"active users. It is recommended that you consult the "
"[documentation](https://docs.xfce.org/) about your problem before asking "
"your question."
msgstr ""
"Konpondu ezin duzun arazoren bat baduzu, gure "
"[#xfce](https://matrix.to/#/#xfce:matrix.org) Matrix kanalean galdetzen saia"
" zaitezke. Kanalak hainbat erabiltzaile aktibo ditu. Gomendagarria da zure "
"arazoari buruzko [dokumentazioa](https://docs.xfce.org/) kontsultatzea "
"galdera egin aurretik."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:18
msgid "Forums"
msgstr "Foroak"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:20
msgid ""
"For users who prefer forums, the [Xfce Forum](https://forum.xfce.org/) is "
"the place to be. Active contributors will be able to help you, but please do"
" not use it for bug reports."
msgstr ""
"Foroak nahiago dituzten erabiltzaileentzat, [Xfce "
"foroa](https://forum.xfce.org/) da lekua. Laguntzaile aktiboek lagundu ahal "
"izango dizute, baina mesedez ez erabili akatsen berri emateko."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:22
msgid "Social Networks"
msgstr "Sare sozialak"

#: content/community/_index.md:24
msgid ""
"You can follow us on the official [Mastodon "
"account](https://floss.social/@xfce)."
msgstr ""
"[Mastodon kontu](https://floss.social/@xfce) ofizialean jarrai gaitzakezu."

#: content/download/_index.md:0
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Deskargatu"

#: content/download/_index.md:7
msgid ""
"Most distributions ship with Xfce in their own packaging format, but if you "
"want a newer version or you want to build Xfce from scratch, you can find "
"the packages below. [How to compile "
"Xfce](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/building)."
msgstr ""
"Banaketa gehienek Xfce beren paketatze-formatuan banatzen dute, baina "
"bertsio berriago bat nahi baduzu edo Xfce hutsetik konpilatu nahi baduzu, "
"paketeak behean aurki ditzakezu. [Nola konpilatu "
"Xfce](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/building)."

#: content/download/_index.md:9
msgid "Stable release {{% version \"stable\" %}}"
msgstr "{{% version \"stable\" %}} bertsio egonkorra"

#: content/download/_index.md:11
msgid ""
"Xfce {{% version \"stable\" %}} is the most recent version of the Xfce "
"desktop environment. [Changes in this release](/download/changelogs/{{% "
"version \"stable\" %}})."
msgstr ""
"Xfce {{% version \"stable\" %}} Xfce mahaigain-ingurunearen bertsiorik "
"berriena da. [Bertsio honetako aldaketak](/download/changelogs/{{% version "
"\"stable\" %}})."

#: content/download/_index.md:13
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/{{% version \"stable\" %}}/>"
msgstr "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/{{% version \"stable\" %}}/>"

#: content/download/_index.md:15
msgid "Individual releases"
msgstr "Banakako bertsioak"

#: content/download/_index.md:17
msgid ""
"Each package in Xfce can make individual stable or development releases, "
"including the core packages (as described in the [release "
"model](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/dev/make-a-platform-"
"release#making_a_platform_release)). You can follow the announcements of the"
" releases on the [Xfce users mailing list](/community), watch the [release "
"feeds](https://archive.xfce.org/feeds/project/) or follow the Xfce "
"[Mastodon](https://floss.social/@xfce)."
msgstr ""
"Xfce-ko pakete bakoitzak bere bertsio egonkor edo garapen-bertsioak argitara"
" ditzake, oinarrizko paketeak barne ([argitalpen-"
"ereduan](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/dev/make-a-platform-"
"release#making_a_platform_release) deskribatzen den bezala). Bertsioen "
"iragarpenak [Xfce erabiltzaileen posta-zerrendan](/community) jarrai "
"ditzakezu, [bertsioen jarioak](https://archive.xfce.org/feeds/project/) "
"begiratu edo Xfce [Mastodon](https://floss.social/@xfce)-en jarraitu."

#: content/download/_index.md:19
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/src/>"
msgstr "<https://archive.xfce.org/src/>"

#: content/download/_index.md:22
msgid "Preview release {{% version \"preview\" %}}"
msgstr "{{% version \"preview\" %}} aurrebista-bertsioa"

#: content/download/_index.md:24
msgid ""
"Xfce {{% version \"preview\" %}} is the latest development release of the "
"Xfce desktop environment. This release should not be used in a production "
"environments. If you are uncertain about downloading this release, you "
"should probably use the [stable release](#stable) above. [Changes in this "
"release](/download/changelogs/{{% version \"preview\" %}})."
msgstr ""
"Xfce {{% version \"preview\" %}} Xfce mahaigain-ingurunearen azken garapen-"
"bertsioa da. Bertsio hau ez litzateke ekoizpen-inguruneetan erabili behar. "
"Bertsio hau deskargatu ala ez zalantzan baldin bazaude, ziurrenik goiko "
"[bertsio egonkorra](#stable) erabili beharko zenuke. [Bertsio honetako "
"aldaketak](/download/changelogs/{{% version \"preview\" %}})."

#: content/download/_index.md:26
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/{{% version \"preview\" %}}/>"
msgstr "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/{{% version \"preview\" %}}/>"

#: content/download/_index.md:30
msgid "Distributions"
msgstr "Banaketak"

#: content/download/_index.md:32
msgid ""
"A lot of different distributions provide Xfce packages. Popular examples "
"built around Xfce are [Xubuntu](https://xubuntu.org/), the [Fedora Xfce "
"Spin](https://fedoraproject.org/spins/xfce), "
"[Manjaro](https://manjaro.org/products/download/) or "
"[Zenwalk](http://www.zenwalk.org/), but there is a good chance your favorite"
" distro provides packages as well."
msgstr ""
"Banaketa askok eskaintzen dituzte Xfce paketeak. Xfce-ren inguruan "
"eraikitako adibide ezagunak dira [Xubuntu](https://xubuntu.org/), [Fedora "
"Xfce Spin](https://fedoraproject.org/spins/xfce), "
"[Manjaro](https://manjaro.org/products/download/) edo "
"[Zenwalk](http://www.zenwalk.org/), baina litekeena da zure banaketa "
"gogokoenak ere paketeak eskaintzea."

#: content/download/_index.md:34
msgid ""
"You can find a more complete list at "
"[DistroWatch.com](https://distrowatch.com/search.php?pkg=xfdesktop&pkgver={{%"
" version \"stable\" %}})."
msgstr ""
"Zerrenda osoagoa "
"[DistroWatch.com](https://distrowatch.com/search.php?pkg=xfdesktop&pkgver={{%"
" version \"stable\" %}}) gunean aurki dezakezu."

#: content/download/_index.md:36
msgid "Artwork"
msgstr "Arte lana"

#: content/download/_index.md:38
msgid ""
"[Download the Xfce artwork "
"tarball](//cdn.xfce.org/downloads/xfce_artwork.tar.bz2). It contains some "
"high-quality logos and banners. Copying of the Xfce logo is subject to the "
"LGPL copyright license."
msgstr ""
"[Deskargatu Xfce-ren arte-lanen "
"tarball-a](//cdn.xfce.org/downloads/xfce_artwork.tar.bz2). Kalitate handiko "
"logotipo eta banner batzuk ditu. Xfce-ren logotipoa kopiatzea LGPL copyright"
" lizentziaren mende dago."

#: content/download/changelogs/_index.md:0
msgid "Changelogs"
msgstr "Aldaketa-logak"

#: content/download/changelogs/_index.md:7
msgid ""
"Xfce release notes are specific to each version. Select your version from "
"the list below to see the changes in the release."
msgstr ""
"Xfce-ren bertsio-oharrak bertsio bakoitzerako espezifikoak dira. Hautatu "
"zure bertsioa beheko zerrendan bertsio horretako aldaketak ikusteko."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:0
msgid "Get Involved"
msgstr "Parte hartu"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:6
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Xfce community. By joining our team, you will be part of an "
"international effort by hundreds of people working to deliver a stunning "
"Free Software computing experience. You will meet new friends, learn new "
"skills and make a difference to millions of users while working with people "
"from all around the globe. There are many different ways you can become part"
" of this, just read on and pick an area which interests you or seems "
"challenging."
msgstr ""
"Ongi etorri Xfce-ren komunitatera. Gure taldean sartuz, ehunka pertsonaren "
"nazioarteko ahalegin baten parte izango zara, Software Libreko konputazio-"
"esperientzia zoragarria eskaintzeko lanean. Lagun berriak egingo dituzu, "
"trebetasun berriak ikasiko dituzu eta milioika erabiltzaileren bizitzan "
"eragina izango duzu, mundu osoko jendearekin lan eginez. Honen parte izateko"
" modu asko daude; jarraitu irakurtzen eta aukeratu interesatzen zaizun edo "
"erronka iruditzen zaizun arlo bat."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:8
msgid ""
"Possible tasks include testing, bug reporting; writing code, developing "
"artwork, documentation or translations; or spreading the word and helping "
"out with promotion and marketing both on line and at tradeshows and "
"conferences."
msgstr ""
"Zeregin posibleen artean daude probak egitea, akatsen berri ematea; kodea "
"idaztea, arte-lanak, dokumentazioa edo itzulpenak egitea; edo hitza "
"zabaltzea eta sustapenean eta marketinean laguntzea, bai sarean bai azoka "
"eta biltzarretan."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:10
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Dokumentazioa"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:12
msgid ""
"There's lots of people using and testing Xfce. By providing useful and up-"
"to-date documentation, you will make a big impact on helping people "
"understand how to make the most of the Xfce Desktop Environment. [Learn More"
" →](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/documentation)"
msgstr ""
"Jende asko ari da Xfce erabiltzen eta probatzen. Dokumentazio erabilgarria "
"eta eguneratua eskainiz, eragin handia izango duzu jendeari Xfce mahaigain-"
"ingurunetik ahalik eta etekin handiena nola atera ulertzen laguntzen. [Ikasi"
" gehiago →](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/documentation)"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:14
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "Itzulpena"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:16
msgid ""
"Are you fluent in multiple languages? By contributing your translations of "
"text to the Xfce Desktop Environment, you will help Xfce be a better part of"
" the global market and more accessible to the millions of potential users "
"out there. [Learn More →](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/translate/start)"
msgstr ""
"Hizkuntza anitz menderatzen dituzu? Xfce mahaigain-ingurunearen testuen "
"itzulpenak eginez, Xfce merkatu globalaren parte hobea izaten eta milioika "
"erabiltzaile potentzialentzat irisgarriagoa izaten lagunduko duzu. [Ikasi "
"gehiago →](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/translate/start)"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:18
msgid "Development"
msgstr "Garapena"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:20
msgid ""
"By becoming a developer, you can make a big difference while enjoying a "
"challenging and fun experience. You'll learn to be a better coder, you will "
"get to implement new features and defeat daunting bugs, creating a stunning "
"product, all the while collaborating with people from all around the world. "
"You can start by browsing the [source code](https://gitlab.xfce.org)."
msgstr ""
"Garatzaile bihurtuz, eragin handia izan dezakezu esperientzia erronkatsu eta"
" dibertigarri batez gozatzen duzun bitartean. Programatzaile hobea izaten "
"ikasiko duzu, ezaugarri berriak inplementatu eta akats beldurgarriak "
"garaituko dituzu, produktu zoragarri bat sortuz, mundu osoko jendearekin "
"elkarlanean. [Iturburu-kodea](https://gitlab.xfce.org) arakatzen has "
"zaitezke."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:22
msgid "Promotion"
msgstr "Zabaltzea"

#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:24
msgid ""
"If you own a blog or website you can greatly help by spreading the word and "
"encouraging new users to give Xfce a try. If you have a Mastodon account you"
" can also help by reposting any announcements we make to help us reach a "
"larger audience."
msgstr ""
"Blog edo webgune bat baduzu, asko lagun dezakezu hitza zabalduz eta "
"erabiltzaile berriak Xfce probatzera animatuz. Mastodon kontu bat baduzu, "
"egiten ditugun iragarpenak berriro argitaratuz ere lagun dezakezu, publiko "
"zabalago batera iristen laguntzeko."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:26
msgid "Bug Reporting and testing"
msgstr "Erroreen berri emate eta probatzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:28
msgid ""
"One of the most useful tasks that we rely on the community for is testing "
"and reporting of bugs. Since Xfce runs on various platform and in a lot of "
"different setups, testing all changes in every possible situation is an "
"impossible task. As such we kindly ask users to assist in testing, and "
"reporting all bugs they may find, using our [bug "
"tracker](https://gitlab.xfce.org)."
msgstr ""
"Komunitatearen esku uzten dugun zereginik erabilgarrienetako bat probak "
"egitea eta akatsen berri ematea da. Xfce hainbat plataformatan eta "
"konfigurazio askotan exekutatzen denez, aldaketa guztiak egoera posible "
"guztietan probatzea ezinezkoa da. Horregatik, erabiltzaileei eskatzen diegu "
"probetan lagun dezaten eta aurki ditzaketen akats guztien berri eman "
"dezaten, gure [akats-jarraitzailea](https://gitlab.xfce.org) erabiliz."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:30
msgid ""
"Once a bug has been found, the cause of the bug needs to be tracked down, "
"and then (obviously) fixed. If you want to get involved in the actual "
"development process of Xfce a great way to start is by solving bugs and then"
" submitting a patch file."
msgstr ""
"Akats bat aurkitu ondoren, haren kausa aurkitu eta, jakina, konpondu egin "
"behar da. Xfce-ren garapen-prozesuan parte hartu nahi baduzu, hasteko modu "
"bikaina akatsak konpontzea eta ondoren adabaki-fitxategi bat bidaltzea da."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:32
msgid "OpenCollective"
msgstr "OpenCollective"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:34
msgid ""
"If you want to fund the project, you can use OpenCollective. Xfce has "
"created two collectives, known as [Xfce "
"($)](https://opencollective.com/xfce) and [Xfce-Eu "
"(€)](https://opencollective.com/xfce-eu) respectively. [Learn More "
"→](https://mail.xfce.org/pipermail/xfce/2021-May/037348.html)"
msgstr ""
"Proiektua finantzatu nahi baduzu, OpenCollective erabil dezakezu. Xfce-k bi "
"kolektibo sortu ditu: [Xfce ($)](https://opencollective.com/xfce) eta [Xfce-"
